#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/_client-proxy-script.adoc:1
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register Clients  to a Proxy with a Bootstrap Script"
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍກັບພຣັອກຊີດ້ວຍສະຄຣິບ Bootstrap"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/_client-proxy-script.adoc:2
msgid ""
"You can register clients through the {productname} Proxy with a bootstrap "
"script.  This is done almost the same way as registering clients directly "
"with the {productname} Server."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/_client-proxy-script.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The difference is that you create the bootstrap script on the {productname} "
"Proxy with a command line tool.  The bootstrap script then deploys all "
"necessary information to the clients.  The bootstrap script requires some "
"parameters such as activation keys or GPG keys.  These parameters depend on "
"your specific setup."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/_client-proxy-script.adoc:4
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Registering Clients to a Proxy with a Bootstrap Script"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍກັບພຣັອກຊີດ້ວຍສະຄຣິບ Bootstrap"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/_client-proxy-script.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Create a client activation key on the {productname} server using the "
"{webui}."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/_client-proxy-script.adoc:6
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:17
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:20
msgid "For more information, see xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/_client-proxy-script.adoc:7
msgid ""
"On the proxy, execute the [command]``mgr-bootstrap`` command line tool as "
"{rootuser}."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/_client-proxy-script.adoc:8
msgid ""
"If needed, use the additional command line switches to tune your bootstrap "
"script."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/_client-proxy-script.adoc:9
msgid ""
"To view available options type [command]``mgr-bootstrap --help`` from the "
"command line:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/_client-proxy-script.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-bootstrap --activation-keys=key-string\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/_client-proxy-script.adoc:11
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:13
msgid "OPTIONAL: Edit the resulting bootstrap script."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ແກ້ໄຂສະຄຣິບ bootstrap ທີ່ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/_client-proxy-script.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Execute the bootstrap script directly on the clients or from the proxy with "
"[command]``ssh``.  Replace [systemitem]``<bootstrap>`` with the name of the "
"bootstrap script and [systemitem]`` <client.example.com>`` with the host "
"name of your client:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/_client-proxy-script.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "cat <bootstrap> | ssh root@<client.example.com> /bin/bash\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:1
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activation Keys"
msgstr "ຄີການເປີດໃຊ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:2
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:27
msgid ""
"Activation keys are used to ensure that your clients have the correct "
"software entitlements, are connecting to the appropriate channels, and are "
"subscribed to the relevant groups.  Each activation key is bound to an "
"organization, which you can set when you create the key."
msgstr "ຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ (Activation keys) ແມ່ນຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານມີສິດນຳໃຊ້ຊອບແວທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ມີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເໝາະສົມ, ແລະ ໄດ້ສະໝັກນຳໃຊ້ກຸ່ມທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ. ແຕ່ລະຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ແມ່ນຖືກຜູກໄວ້ກັບອົງກອນໃດໜຶ່ງ, ເຊິ່ງທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດໄດ້ໃນເວລາສ້າງຄີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:3
msgid ""
"In {productname}, an activation key is a group of configuration settings "
"with a label.  You can apply all configuration settings associated with an "
"activation key by adding its label as a parameter to a bootstrap script.  We "
"recommend you use an activation key label in combination with a bootstrap "
"script.  When the bootstrap script is executed all configuration settings "
"associated with the label are applied to the system the script is run on."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname}, ຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ແມ່ນກຸ່ມຂອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ມີປ້າຍຊື່ (Label). ທ່ານສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ທຸກການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການເພີ່ມປ້າຍຊື່ຂອງມັນເປັນພາລາມິເຕີໃນ bootstrap script. ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານໃຊ້ປ້າຍຊື່ຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ bootstrap script. ເມື່ອ bootstrap script ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້, ທຸກການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບປ້າຍຊື່ນັ້ນຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບລະບົບທີ່ script ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:4
msgid "An activation key can specify:"
msgstr "ຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ສາມາດລະບຸ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:5
msgid "Channel assignment"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດຊ່ອງທາງ (Channel)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:6
msgid "System types or add-on entitlements"
msgstr "ປະເພດລະບົບ ຫຼື ສິດການນຳໃຊ້ສ່ວນເສີມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:7
msgid "Contact method"
msgstr "ວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:8
msgid "Configuration files"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:9
msgid "Packages to be installed"
msgstr "ແພັກເກດທີ່ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:10
msgid "AppStreams to be enabled"
msgstr "AppStreams ທີ່ຈະເປີດໃຊ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:11
msgid "System group assignment"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດກຸ່ມລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Activation keys are used at the time a client is registered, and not used "
"again.  After the client has been registered, the client can be changed in "
"any way, regardless of what the activation key specifies.  The association "
"between the activation key and the client is recorded only for historical "
"purposes."
msgstr "ຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ແມ່ນຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນເວລາທີ່ລູກຂ່າຍລົງທະບຽນເທົ່ານັ້ນ ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ຄືນອີກ. ຫຼັງຈາກລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວ, ລູກຂ່າຍສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ທຸກຮູບແບບ ໂດຍບໍ່ຂຶ້ນກັບສິ່ງທີ່ຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ລະບຸໄວ້. ການເຊື່ອມໂຍງລະຫວ່າງຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ ແລະ ລູກຂ່າຍແມ່ນຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ເພື່ອຈຸດປະສົງທາງປະຫວັດສາດເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "provision-config-keys.png"
msgstr "provision-config-keys.png"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:14
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:15
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating an Activation Key"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ (Activation Key)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:15
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, as an administrator, navigate to "
"menu:Systems[Activation Keys]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃນຖານະຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Activation Keys]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:16
msgid "Click the btn:[Create Key] button."
msgstr "ກົດປຸ່ມ btn:[Create Key]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:17
msgid ""
"On the [guimenu]``Activation Key Details`` page, in the "
"[guimenu]``Description`` field, enter a description of the activation key."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:18
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Key`` field, enter a name for the activation key.  For "
"example, ``SLES15-{sp-version}`` for {sles}{nbsp}15{nbsp}{sp-version}."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Do not use commas or double quotes in the [guimenu]``Key`` field for any "
"{suse} products.  However, you *must* use commas for Red Hat Products."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:20
msgid ""
"All other characters are allowed, but ``<> (){}`` (this includes the space) "
"are removed automatically."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:21
msgid "If the field is left empty, a random string is generated."
msgstr "ຖ້າຫ້ອງນີ້ຖືກປະຫວ່າງໄວ້, ລະບົບຈະສ້າງຂໍ້ຄວາມແບບສຸ່ມຂຶ້ນມາເອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:22
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Base Channels`` drop-down box, select the appropriate base "
"software channel, and allow the relevant child channels to populate.  For "
"more information, see "
"xref:reference:admin/setup-wizard.adoc#vle.webui.admin.wizard.products[] and "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Select the child channels you need (for example, the mandatory {susemgr} "
"tools and updates channels)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Check the [guimenu]``Add-On System Types`` check box if you need to enable "
"any of the options."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:25
msgid ""
"We recommend you leave the [guimenu]``Contact Method`` set to "
"[guimenu]``Default``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:26
msgid "We recommend you leave the [guimenu]``Universal Default`` setting unchecked."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:27
msgid "Click btn:[Create Activation Key] to create the activation key."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Create Activation Key] ເພື່ອສ້າງຄີການເປີດໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Check the [guimenu]``Configuration File Deployment`` check box to enable "
"configuration management for this key, and click btn:[Update Activation Key] "
"to save this change."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:29
msgid ""
"The [guimenu]``Configuration File Deployment`` check box does not appear "
"until after you have created the activation key.  Ensure you go back and "
"check the box if you need to enable configuration management."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:30
msgid "When created, tabs such as"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:31
msgid "[guimenu]``Packages``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:32
msgid "[guimenu]``Configuration``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:33
msgid "[guimenu]``Groups``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:34
msgid "[guimenu]``Activated Systems``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:35
msgid ""
"[guimenu]``AppStreams`` (available whenever a modular channel is associated "
"with the activation key)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:36
msgid "allow you to check and set additional features."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reactivation Keys"
msgstr "ຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ຄືນໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:38
msgid ""
"Reactivation keys can be used once only to re-register a client and regain "
"all {productname} settings.  Reactivation keys are client-specific, and "
"include the system ID, history, groups, and channels."
msgstr "ຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ຄືນໃໝ່ (Reactivation keys) ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ພຽງຄັ້ງດຽວເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍຄືນໃໝ່ ແລະ ກູ້ຄືນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ທັງໝົດ. ຄີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນສະເພາະສຳລັບແຕ່ລະລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ລວມມີ System ID, ປະຫວັດ, ກຸ່ມ, ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງຕ່າງໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:39
msgid ""
"To create a reactivation key, navigate to [guimenu]``Systems``, click the "
"client to create a reactivation key for, and navigate to the "
"menu:Details[Reactivation] tab.  Click btn:[Generate New Key] to create the "
"reactivation key.  Record the details of the key for later use.  Unlike "
"typical activation keys, which are not associated with a specific system ID, "
"keys created here do not show up on the menu:Systems[Activation Keys] page."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:40
msgid ""
"After you have created a reactivation key, you can use it as the "
"``management_key`` grain in [path]``/etc/salt/minion.d/susemanager.conf``.  "
"For example:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"grains:\n"
"    susemanager:\n"
"        management_key: \"re-1-daf44db90c0853edbb5db03f2b37986e\"\n"
msgstr ""
"grains:\n"
"    susemanager:\n"
"        management_key: \"re-1-daf44db90c0853edbb5db03f2b37986e\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:42
msgid ""
"Restart the [command]``venv-salt-minion`` or [command]``salt-minion`` "
"process to apply the reactivation key."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:43
msgid ""
"You can use a reactivation key with a bootstrap script.  For more "
"information about bootstrap scripts, see "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ຄືນໃໝ່ຮ່ວມກັບ bootstrap script ໄດ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ bootstrap scripts, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:44
msgid ""
"If you autoinstall a client with its existing {productname} profile, the "
"profile uses the reactivation key to re-register the system and restore its "
"settings.  Do not regenerate, delete, or use this key while a profile-based "
"autoinstallation is in progress.  Doing so causes the autoinstallation to "
"fail."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງລູກຂ່າຍແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດດ້ວຍໂປຣໄຟລ໌ {productname} ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຈະໃຊ້ຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ຄືນໃໝ່ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນລະບົບຄືນ ແລະ ກູ້ຄືນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ. ຫ້າມສ້າງໃໝ່, ລຶບ, ຫຼື ໃຊ້ຄີນີ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດຕາມໂປຣໄຟລ໌ກຳລັງດຳເນີນຢູ່ ເພາະຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການຕິດຕັ້ງຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activation Key Best Practices"
msgstr "ແນວທາງການປະຕິບັດທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບຄີການເປີດໃຊ້"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "Default Parent Channel"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (Default Parent Channel)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:47
msgid ""
"Avoid using the [systemitem]``{productname} Default`` parent channel.  This "
"setting forces {productname} to choose a parent channel that best "
"corresponds to the installed operating system, which can sometimes lead to "
"unexpected behavior.  Instead, we recommend you create activation keys "
"specific to each distribution and architecture."
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:48
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bootstrapping With Activation Keys"
msgstr "ການເຮັດ Bootstrapping ດ້ວຍຄີການເປີດໃຊ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:49
msgid ""
"If you are using bootstrap scripts, consider creating an activation key for "
"each script.  This helps you align channel assignments, package "
"installation, system group memberships, and configuration channel "
"assignments.  You also need less manual interaction with your system after "
"registration."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ bootstrap scripts, ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາສ້າງຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະ script. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຈັດການການກຳນົດຊ່ອງທາງ, ການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ, ການເປັນສະມາຊິກກຸ່ມລະບົບ, ແລະ ການກຳນົດຊ່ອງທາງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ກົງກັນ. ນອກຈາກນີ້ ທ່ານຍັງບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມາຕັ້ງຄ່າດ້ວຍຕົນເອງຫຼາຍຫຼັງຈາກການລົງທະບຽນ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bootstrapping LTSS Clients"
msgstr "ການເຮັດ Bootstrapping ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍ LTSS"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:51
msgid ""
"If you are boostrapping clients with LTSS subscription, include the LTSS "
"channels during activation key creation."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງເຮັດ bootstrapping ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ມີການສະໝັກໃຊ້ LTSS, ໃຫ້ລວມເອົາຊ່ອງທາງ LTSS ເຂົ້າໃນຂະນະທີ່ສ້າງຄີການເປີດໃຊ້."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bandwidth Requirements"
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການແບນວິດ (Bandwidth)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:53
msgid ""
"Using activation keys might result in automatic downloading of software at "
"registration time, which might not be desirable in environments where "
"bandwidth is constrained."
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ມີການດາວໂຫຼດຊອບແວແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນເວລາລົງທະບຽນ, ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະບໍ່ເໝາະສົມໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດດ້ານແບນວິດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:54
msgid "These options create bandwidth usage:"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການໃຊ້ແບນວິດ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:55
msgid ""
"Assigning a SUSE Product Pool channel results in the automatic installation "
"of the corresponding product descriptor package."
msgstr "ການກຳນົດຊ່ອງທາງ SUSE Product Pool ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ມີການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດລາຍລະອຽດຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:56
msgid "Any package in the [guimenu]``Packages`` section is installed."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:57
msgid ""
"Any Salt state from the [guimenu]``Configuration`` section might trigger "
"downloads depending on its contents."
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "Key Label Naming"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຊື່ປ້າຍຊື່ຄີ (Key Label)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:59
msgid ""
"If you do not enter a human-readable name for your activation keys, the "
"system automatically generates a number string, which can make it difficult "
"to manage your keys."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ປ້ອນຊື່ທີ່ຄົນເຮົາສາມາດອ່ານ ແລະ ເຂົ້າໃຈໄດ້ງ່າຍສຳລັບຄີການເປີດໃຊ້, ລະບົບຈະສ້າງຂໍ້ຄວາມເປັນຕົວເລກໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການຈັດການຄີຂອງທ່ານມີຄວາມຫຍຸ້ງຍາກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:60
msgid ""
"Consider a naming scheme for your activation keys to help you keep track of "
"them.  Creating names which are associated with your organization's "
"infrastructure makes it easier for you when performing more complex "
"operations."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາຮູບແບບການຕັ້ງຊື່ສຳລັບຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຕິດຕາມພວກມັນໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ. ການສ້າງຊື່ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບໂຄງລ່າງພື້ນຖານຂອງອົງກອນຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເຮັດວຽກທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:61
msgid "When creating key labels, consider these tips:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອສ້າງປ້າຍຊື່ຄີ, ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາເຄັດລັບເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:62
msgid ""
"OS naming (mandatory): Keys should always refer to the OS they provide "
"settings for"
msgstr "ຊື່ OS (ຈຳເປັນ): ຄີຄວນຈະອ້າງອີງເຖິງ OS ທີ່ພວກມັນສະໜອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ສະເໝີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:63
msgid ""
"Architecture naming (recommended): Unless your company is running on one "
"architecture only, for example x86_64, then providing labels with an "
"architecture type is a good idea."
msgstr "ຊື່ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ (ແນະນຳ): ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ວ່າບໍລິສັດຂອງທ່ານໃຊ້ພຽງສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳດຽວ ເຊັ່ນ x86_64, ການລະບຸປະເພດສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳໃນປ້າຍຊື່ແມ່ນເປັນຄວາມຄິດທີ່ດີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:64
msgid "Server type naming: What is this server being used for?"
msgstr "ຊື່ປະເພດເຊີເວີ: ເຊີເວີນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອຫຍັງ?"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:65
msgid "Location naming: Where is the server located? Room, building, or department?"
msgstr "ຊື່ສະຖານທີ່: ເຊີເວີຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃສ? ຫ້ອງ, ອາຄານ, ຫຼື ພະແນກ?"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:66
msgid "Date naming: Maintenance windows, quarter, etc."
msgstr "ຊື່ວັນທີ: ຊ່ວງເວລາບຳລຸງຮັກສາ, ໄຕມາດ, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:67
msgid "Custom naming: What naming scheme suits your organizations needs?"
msgstr "ຊື່ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ: ຮູບແບບການຕັ້ງຊື່ໃດທີ່ເໝາະກັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ?"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:68
msgid "Example activation key label names:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງຊື່ປ້າຍຊື່ຄີການເປີດໃຊ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "sles15-sp4-web_server-room_129-x86_64\n"
msgstr "sles15-sp4-web_server-room_129-x86_64\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:70
#, no-wrap
msgid "sles15-sp4-test_packages-blg_502-room_21-ppc64le\n"
msgstr "sles15-sp4-test_packages-blg_502-room_21-ppc64le\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "Included Channels"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ລວມຢູ່ນຳ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/activation-keys.adoc:72
msgid ""
"When creating activation keys you also need to keep in mind which software "
"channels are associated with it.  Keys should have a specific base channel "
"assigned to them.  Using the default base channel is not recommended.  For "
"more information, see the client operating system you are installing at "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-overview.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອສ້າງຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ ທ່ານຕ້ອງຄຳນຶງເຖິງຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບມັນນຳ. ຄີຄວນຈະມີຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ສະເພາະ. ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:registration-overview.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/appstreams.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "AppStream Modules"
msgstr "ໂມດູນ AppStream"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/appstreams.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you are managing a client that is subscribed to an AppStream channel, "
"{productname} will filter packages available to the client depending on its "
"currently enabled set of AppStream modules."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງຈັດການລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ສະໝັກໃຊ້ຊ່ອງທາງ AppStream, {productname} ຈະກັ່ນຕອງແພັກເກດທີ່ມີໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍໂດຍຂຶ້ນກັບຊຸດໂມດູນ AppStream ທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install via a CD-ROM or a USB Key"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງຜ່ານ CD-ROM ຫຼື USB Key"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:2
msgid ""
"For clients that are not yet registered to {productname}, and if network "
"boot over PXE is not an option, a bootable CD-ROM or USB key can be used to "
"install the system."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນກັບ {productname}, ແລະ ຖ້າການບູດຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍ (PXE) ບໍ່ແມ່ນທາງເລືອກ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ CD-ROM ຫຼື USB key ທີ່ບູດໄດ້ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:3
msgid ""
"One option to prepare such a removable medium is to use {cobbler}.  For "
"information about using {cobbler} to prepare an ISO image, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-cdrom.adoc#build-iso-with-cobbler[Build "
"an ISO Image With {cobbler}]."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງໃນການຕຽມສື່ທີ່ຖອດອອກໄດ້ແມ່ນການໃຊ້ {cobbler}. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ {cobbler} ເພື່ອຕຽມໄຟລ໌ ISO, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-cdrom.adoc#build-iso-with-cobbler[Build an ISO Image With {cobbler}]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For {suse} systems, it is often recommended to prepare an ISO image using "
"KIWI.  For more information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-cdrom.adoc#build-iso-with-kiwi[Build a "
"SUSE ISO Image With KIWI]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລະບົບ {suse}, ມັກຈະແນະນຳໃຫ້ຕຽມໄຟລ໌ ISO ໂດຍໃຊ້ KIWI. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-cdrom.adoc#build-iso-with-kiwi[Build a SUSE ISO Image With KIWI]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:5
msgid ""
"In all cases, you use the resulting image to burn a CD-ROM or prepare a USB "
"key."
msgstr "ໃນທຸກກໍລະນີ, ທ່ານຈະໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ໄດ້ມາເພື່ອເບີນລົງ CD-ROM ຫຼື ຕຽມໃສ່ USB key."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build an ISO Image With {cobbler}"
msgstr "ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ ISO ດ້ວຍ {cobbler}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:7
msgid ""
"{cobbler} can create ISO boot images that contain a set of distributions, "
"kernels, and a menu that works in a similar way to a PXE installation."
msgstr "{cobbler} ສາມາດສ້າງໄຟລ໌ ISO ສຳລັບບູດທີ່ບັນຈຸຊຸດດິສທຣິບິວຊັນ, ເຄີເນລ (Kernel), ແລະ ເມນູທີ່ເຮັດວຽກໃນຮູບແບບທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງຜ່ານ PXE."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:8
msgid "Building ISOs with {cobbler} is not supported on {ibmz}."
msgstr "ການສ້າງໄຟລ໌ ISO ດ້ວຍ {cobbler} ແມ່ນບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໃນ {ibmz}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:9
msgid ""
"In order to prepare an ISO image with {cobbler}, you need to prepare a "
"distribution and a profile, similar to using network boot over PXE.  For "
"information about creating a distribution, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-distributions.adoc[Autoinstallable "
"Distributions].  For information about creating a profile, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc[Autoinstallation Profiles]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕຽມໄຟລ໌ ISO ດ້ວຍ {cobbler}, ທ່ານຕ້ອງຕຽມດິສທຣິບິວຊັນ ແລະ ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ ຄ້າຍຄືກັບການໃຊ້ບູດຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍ PXE. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການສ້າງດິສທຣິບິວຊັນ, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-distributions.adoc[Autoinstallable Distributions]. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc[Autoinstallation Profiles]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:10
msgid ""
"The {cobbler} [command]``buildiso`` command takes parameters to define the "
"name and output location of the boot ISO.  Specifying the distribution with "
"[option]``--distro`` is mandatory when running [command]``buildiso`` "
"command.  [option]``--iso`` is the output location:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -- cobbler buildiso --iso=/path/to/boot.iso "
"--distro=<your-distro-label>\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -- cobbler buildiso --iso=/path/to/boot.iso --distro=<your-distro-label>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:12
msgid ""
"You must use distribution and profile labels as listed by {cobbler}, and not "
"simply as shown in the {webui}.  To list the names of distributions and "
"profiles stored by {cobbler}, run the commands:"
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງໃຊ້ປ້າຍຊື່ດິສທຣິບິວຊັນ ແລະ ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຕາມທີ່ {cobbler} ສະແດງໄວ້, ບໍ່ແມ່ນພຽງແຕ່ຕາມທີ່ເຫັນໃນ {webui}. ເພື່ອສະແດງລາຍຊື່ດິສທຣິບິວຊັນ ແລະ ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ໂດຍ {cobbler}, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -- cobbler distro list\n"
"mgrctl exec -- cobbler profile list\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl exec -- cobbler distro list\n"
"mgrctl exec -- cobbler profile list\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:14
msgid ""
"The boot ISO includes all profiles and systems by default.  You can limit "
"which profiles and systems are used with the [option]``--profiles`` and "
"[option]``--systems`` options:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -- cobbler buildiso --systems=\"system1 system2 system3\" \\\n"
"  --profiles=\"<your-profile1-label> <your-profile2-label> "
"<your-profile3-label>\" \\\n"
"  --distro=<your-distro-label>\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl exec -- cobbler buildiso --systems=\"system1 system2 system3\" \\\n"
"  --profiles=\"<your-profile1-label> <your-profile2-label> <your-profile3-label>\" \\\n"
"  --distro=<your-distro-label>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:16
msgid ""
"With [option]``--esp`` you can enable the built boot ISOs with Secure Boot.  "
"You explicitly specify the EFI System Partition (ESP).  By default, "
"{cobbler} generates the ESP partition, which disables Secure Boot."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -- cobbler buildiso \\\n"
"  "
"--esp=\"/usr/share/tftpboot-installation/SLE-15-SP6-x86_64/boot/x86_64/efi\" "
"\\\n"
"  --iso=/path/to/boot.iso --distro=<your-distro-label>\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl exec -- cobbler buildiso \\\n"
"  --esp=\"/usr/share/tftpboot-installation/SLE-15-SP6-x86_64/boot/x86_64/efi\" \\\n"
"  --iso=/path/to/boot.iso --distro=<your-distro-label>\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Finding [literal]``efi``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:19
msgid ""
"On the container host, execute the following command to get the "
"[option]``distro`` name:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -- cobbler distro list\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -- cobbler distro list\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:21
msgid "This command outputs strings such as [literal]``sles15-sp6:1:SUSE``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:22
msgid ""
"On the container host, execute the following command to get information "
"about the [option]``distro`` files location:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -- cobbler distro report --name sles15-sp6:1:SUSE\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -- cobbler distro report --name sles15-sp6:1:SUSE\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:24
msgid "This command outputs a report such as the following:"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະສະແດງລາຍງານດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Name                  : sles15-sp6:1:SUSE\n"
"Architecture          : x86_64\n"
"...output omitted...\n"
"Initrd                : "
"/usr/share/tftpboot-installation/SLE-15-SP6-x86_64/boot/x86_64/loader/initrd\n"
"Kernel                : "
"/usr/share/tftpboot-installation/SLE-15-SP6-x86_64/boot/x86_64/loader/linux\n"
"...output omitted...\n"
msgstr ""
"Name                  : sles15-sp6:1:SUSE\n"
"Architecture          : x86_64\n"
"...output omitted...\n"
"Initrd                : /usr/share/tftpboot-installation/SLE-15-SP6-x86_64/boot/x86_64/loader/initrd\n"
"Kernel                : /usr/share/tftpboot-installation/SLE-15-SP6-x86_64/boot/x86_64/loader/linux\n"
"...output omitted...\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:26
msgid ""
"See the contents of the boot directory.  In the example above, the boot "
"partition is the "
"[path]``/usr/share/tftpboot-installation/SLE-15-SP6-x86_64/boot/x86_64/efi`` "
"file, but this can differ based on the ISO distributor."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:27
msgid ""
"If you cannot write an ISO image to a public [path]``tmp`` directory, check "
"your systemd settings in [path]``/usr/lib/systemd/system/cobblerd.service``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build a SUSE ISO Image With KIWI"
msgstr "ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ ISO ຂອງ SUSE ດ້ວຍ KIWI"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:29
msgid ""
"KIWI is an image creation system.  You can use KIWI to create a bootable ISO "
"image to be used by the target system for installation of a {suse} system.  "
"When the system is rebooted or switched on, it boots from the image, loads "
"the {ay} configuration from your {productname}, and installs {sles} "
"according to the {ay} profile."
msgstr "KIWI ແມ່ນລະບົບການສ້າງໄຟລ໌ Image. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ KIWI ເພື່ອສ້າງໄຟລ໌ ISO ສຳລັບບູດເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບ {suse}. ເມື່ອລະບົບຖືກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃໝ່ ຫຼື ເປີດເຄື່ອງ, ມັນຈະບູດຈາກ Image, ໂຫຼດການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {ay} ຈາກ {productname} ຂອງທ່ານ, ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງ {sles} ຕາມໂປຣໄຟລ໌ {ay}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:30
msgid ""
"To use the ISO image, boot the system and type `autoyast` at the prompt "
"(assuming you left the label for the {ay} boot as ``autoyast``).  Press "
"kbd:[Enter] to begin the {ay} installation."
msgstr ""

#. we would love a bit more details - ebischoff
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:31
msgid ""
"For more information about KIWI, see "
"http://doc.opensuse.org/projects/kiwi/doc/."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ KIWI, ເບິ່ງ http://doc.opensuse.org/projects/kiwi/doc/."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build a Red Hat ISO Image With {cobbler}"
msgstr "ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ ISO ຂອງ Red Hat ດ້ວຍ {cobbler}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-cdrom.adoc:33
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-cdrom.adoc#build-iso-with-cobbler[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-cdrom.adoc#build-iso-with-cobbler[]."

#
#
#
#
#. [[build-iso-with-mkisofs]]
#. == Build a RedHat ISO Image With mkisofs
#. You can use [command]``mkisofs`` to create a bootable ISO image to be used by the target system for installation of a {redhat} system.
#. When the system is rebooted or switched on, it boots from the image, loads the {kickstart} configuration from your {productname}, and installs {rhel} according to the {kickstart} profile.
#. .Procedure: Building a Bootable ISO With mkisofs
#. . Copy the contents of [path]``/isolinux`` from the first CD-ROM of the target distribution.
#. . Edit the [path]``isolinux.cfg`` file to default to 'ks'.
#.   Change the 'ks' section to read:
#. +
#. ----
#. label ks
#. kernel vmlinuz
#.   append text ks=`url` initrd=initrd.img lang= devfs=nomount \
#.     ramdisk_size=16438 `ksdevice`
#. ----
#. +
#. IP address-based {kickstart} URLs look like this:
#. +
#. ----
#. http://`my.manager.server`/kickstart/ks/mode/ip_range
#. ----
#. +
#. The {kickstart} distribution defined via the IP range should match the distribution from which you are building, to prevent errors occurring.
#. . OPTIONAL: If you want to use the [replaceable]``ksdevice``, it looks like this:
#. +
#. ----
#. ksdevice=eth0
#. ----
#. +
#. It is possible to change the distribution for a Kickstart profile within a family, such as {rhel} AS 4 to {rhel} ES 4, by specifying the new distribution label.
#. Note that you cannot move between versions (4 to 5) or between updates (U1 to U2).
#. . Customize [path]``isolinux.cfg`` further as required.
#.   For example, you can add multiple options, different boot messages, or shorter timeout periods.
#. . Create the ISO with this command:
#. +
#. ----
#. mkisofs -o file.iso -b isolinux.bin -c boot.cat -no-emul-boot \
#.   -boot-load-size 4 -boot-info-table -R -J -v -T isolinux/
#. ----
#. +
#. Note that [path]``isolinux/`` is the relative path to the directory containing the modified isolinux files copied from the distribution CD, while [path]``file.iso`` is the output ISO file, which is placed into the current directory.
#. . Burn the ISO to CD-ROM and insert the disk.
#.   Alternatively prepare an USB key and insert it.
#. . Boot the system and type [command]``ks`` at the prompt (if you left the label for the Kickstart boot as 'ks').
#. . Press kbd:[Enter] to start {kickstart}.
#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Autoinstallable Distributions"
msgstr "ດິສທຣິບິວຊັນທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The autoinstallation process relies on an several files to initiate the "
"installation.  These files include the Linux kernel, an initial RAM disk, "
"and other files required to boot the operating system in installation mode."
msgstr "ຂະບວນການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດອາໄສຫຼາຍໄຟລ໌ເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການຕິດຕັ້ງ. ໄຟລ໌ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ລວມມີ Linux kernel, initial RAM disk, ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ອື່ນໆທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃນການບູດລະບົບປະຕິບັດການເຂົ້າສູ່ໂໝດການຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{productname} uses the [systemitem]``mgradm`` tool to copy the installation "
"file from the source to the server container."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:4
msgid ""
"You can extract the needed files from a DVD image.  For information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-distributions.adoc#based-on-iso-image[Distribution "
"Based on an ISO Image]."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດດຶງເອົາໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈຳເປັນອອກຈາກ DVD Image ໄດ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-distributions.adoc#based-on-iso-image[Distribution Based on an ISO Image]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can install the [package]``tftpboot-installation`` "
"package.  For information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-distributions.adoc#based-on-rpm-package[Distribution "
"Based on a RPM Package]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:6
msgid ""
"You must also have a base channel synchronized on your {productname} Server "
"for the same operating system version as those files."
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງມີຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ (Base channel) ທີ່ຊິ້ງຂໍ້ມູນ (Synchronized) ແລ້ວໃນ {productname} Server ສຳລັບເວີຊັນຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ກົງກັບໄຟລ໌ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:7
msgid ""
"When you have the files ready, and the base channel synchronized, you need "
"to declare the distribution.  This operation associates the installation "
"files to the base channel.  The distribution can be referred to by one or "
"more installation profiles.  For information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-distributions.adoc#declare-distribution[Declare "
"an Autoinstallable Distribution]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານຕຽມໄຟລ໌ພ້ອມແລ້ວ ແລະ ຊິ້ງຂໍ້ມູນຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປະກາດດິສທຣິບິວຊັນ. ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ຈະເຊື່ອມໂຍງໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງເຂົ້າກັບຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ. ດິສທຣິບິວຊັນສາມາດຖືກອ້າງອີງໂດຍໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍໂປຣໄຟລ໌. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-distributions.adoc#declare-distribution[Declare an Autoinstallable Distribution]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Distribution Based on an ISO Image"
msgstr "ດິສທຣິບິວຊັນທີ່ອີງຕາມໄຟລ໌ ISO"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:9
msgid ""
"This method assumes you have installation media for the operating system you "
"want to install on the clients.  This is usually a DVD [path]``.iso`` image "
"that contains the Linux kernel, an [path]``initrd`` file, and other files "
"required to boot the operating system in installation mode."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Importing Files from Installation Media"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ຈາກສື່ການຕິດຕັ້ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:11
msgid "Use [command]``mgradm`` to import installation data from the ISO image:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "# mgradm distribution copy <image_name>.iso <image_name>\n"
msgstr "# mgradm distribution copy <image_name>.iso <image_name>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:13
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Take a note of the distribution path reported by [command]``mgradm``.  You "
"will need it when you declare the distribution to {productname}."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Distribution autodetection and registration"
msgstr "ການກວດຫາ ແລະ ລົງທະບຽນດິສທຣິບິວຊັນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:15
msgid ""
"[systemitem]``mgradm`` is able to automatically detect distribution name and "
"register it to the server.  Provided ISO image needs to contain a "
"[path]``.treeinfo`` file."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Import distribution file with autodetection and registration"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ດິສທຣິບິວຊັນດ້ວຍການກວດຫາ ແລະ ລົງທະບຽນອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:17
msgid "Use [command]``mgradm``:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# mgradm distribution copy --api-user <username> --api-password <password> "
"<image_name>.iso\n"
msgstr "# mgradm distribution copy --api-user <username> --api-password <password> <image_name>.iso\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Distribution Based on a RPM Package"
msgstr "ດິສທຣິບິວຊັນທີ່ອີງຕາມແພັກເກດ RPM"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:20
msgid ""
"This method works on {suse} systems.  It is simpler than importing contents "
"from an installation media, because it uses prepackaged files for your "
"installation system."
msgstr "ວິທີນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບລະບົບ {suse}. ມັນງ່າຍກວ່າການນຳເຂົ້າເນື້ອໃນຈາກສື່ການຕິດຕັ້ງ ເພາະວ່າມັນໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກແພັກໄວ້ໃຫ້ແລ້ວສຳລັບລະບົບການຕິດຕັ້ງຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Extracting Files from an Installation Package"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແຍກໄຟລ໌ອອກຈາກແພັກເກດການຕິດຕັ້ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:22
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, install the package whose name starts with "
"[package]``tftpboot-installation``.  You can determine its exact name with "
"the command [command]``zypper se tftpboot-installation``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:23
msgid ""
"You can install the package to different root to avoid need for restart "
"using following command:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດລົງໃນ root ອື່ນເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການ restart ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# mkdir /opt/tftpinstall\n"
"# zypper --installroot /opt/tftpinstall install "
"tftpboot-installation-SLE-Micro-5.5-x86_64\n"
msgstr ""
"# mkdir /opt/tftpinstall\n"
"# zypper --installroot /opt/tftpinstall install tftpboot-installation-SLE-Micro-5.5-x86_64\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Find the installation files with the command [command]``ls -d "
"/opt/tftpinstall/usr/share/tftpboot-installation/*``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:26
msgid "Copy installation files using [command]``mgradm``:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# mgradm distribution copy "
"/opt/tftpinstall/usr/share/tftpboot-installation/SLE-Micro-5.5-x86_64 "
"SLE-Micro-5.5-x86_64\n"
msgstr "# mgradm distribution copy /opt/tftpinstall/usr/share/tftpboot-installation/SLE-Micro-5.5-x86_64 SLE-Micro-5.5-x86_64\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Take a note of the distribution path reported by [systemitem]``mgradm`` "
"tool.  You will need it when you declare the distribution to {productname}."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:29
msgid ""
"After [systemitem]``mgradm`` tool finishes, you can remove "
"[path]``/opt/tftpinstall`` directory."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:30
msgid ""
"This procedure prepares the installation of the same operating system "
"version as the one that powers your {productname} Server.  If you want to "
"install a different operating system or version on the client, you need to "
"manually get the package [package]``tftpboot-installation-*`` from the "
"distribution it belongs to.  In the [menu]``Package Search`` input box "
"{productname}, search the packages whose names start with "
"[package]``tftpboot-installation``, then look at the package's details.  "
"They show the local path below [path]``/var/spacewalk/``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Declare an Autoinstallable Distribution"
msgstr "ປະກາດດິສທຣິບິວຊັນທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:32
msgid ""
"The next step after extracting the autoinstallation files is to declare an "
"autoinstallable distribution."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປຫຼັງຈາກການແຍກໄຟລ໌ຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດແລ້ວ ແມ່ນການປະກາດດິສທຣິບິວຊັນທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Declaring an Autoinstallable Distribution"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປະກາດດິສທຣິບິວຊັນທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:34
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:20
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > "
"Distributions]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Distributions]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:35
msgid "Click [guimenu]``Create Distribution``, and complete these fields:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:36
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Distribution Label`` field, enter a name to identify your "
"autoinstallable distribution."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:37
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Tree Path`` field, enter the path to the installation "
"media saved on your {productname} Server."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:38
msgid ""
"Select the matching [guimenu]``Base Channel``.  This must match the "
"installation media."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:39
msgid ""
"Select the [guimenu]``Installer Generation``.  This must match the "
"installation media."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:40
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: Specify kernel options to use when booting this distribution.  "
"There are multiple ways to provide kernel options.  Only add options here "
"that are generic for the distribution."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ລະບຸ kernel options ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນເວລາບູດດິສທຣິບິວຊັນນີ້. ມີຫຼາຍວິທີໃນການລະບຸ kernel options. ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມສະເພາະຕົວເລືອກທີ່ເປັນຄ່າທົ່ວໄປສຳລັບດິສທຣິບິວຊັນນີ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:41
msgid "Click btn:[Create Autoinstallable Distribution]."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Create Autoinstallable Distribution]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:42
msgid ""
"The installation files that you prepared might not contain the packages you "
"need to install.  If they are not included, add [option]``useonlinerepo=1`` "
"to the [guimenu]``Kernel Options`` field."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:43
msgid ""
"The package repositories contain metadata that can be unsigned.  If the "
"metadata is unsigned, add [option]``insecure=1`` to the [guimenu]``Kernel "
"Options`` field, or use your own GPG key as explained in "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc[Use Your Own GPG Key]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:44
msgid ""
"These kernel options are needed for example when you use the \"online "
"installer\" ISO images instead of the full DVD, or when you use the "
"[package]``tpboot-installation`` package."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:45
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Distributions] to manage your "
"autoinstallable distributions."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Distributions] ເພື່ອຈັດການດິສທຣິບິວຊັນທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:46
msgid ""
"You can autoinstall {productname} Proxy 4.3 in the same way as {sle} "
"clients.  Make sure you use the {sle} installation media, and choose the "
"[guimenu]``SLE-Product-SUSE-Manager-Proxy-4.3-Pool for x86_64`` base "
"channel."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "Handling Kernel Options for Distributions and Profiles"
msgstr "ການຈັດການ Kernel Options ສຳລັບດິສທຣິບິວຊັນ ແລະ ໂປຣໄຟລ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:48
msgid ""
"{productname} is able to combine the kernel options that you assign.  This "
"is done using a special inheritance logic.  There are three object types "
"that are relevant for this:"
msgstr "{productname} ສາມາດລວມ kernel options ທີ່ທ່ານກຳນົດໄດ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕັກກະການສືບທອດ (Inheritance logic) ແບບພິເສດ. ມີ 3 ປະເພດວັດຖຸທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບເລື່ອງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:49
msgid "Distributions (or short \"Distros\")"
msgstr "ດິສທຣິບິວຊັນ (ຫຼື ເອີ້ນສັ້ນໆວ່າ \"Distros\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:50
msgid "Profiles"
msgstr "ໂປຣໄຟລ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:51
msgid "Systems"
msgstr "ລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:52
msgid ""
"As a fourth special point of influence on the final kernel options is the "
"Cobbler settings file [path]``/etc/cobbler/settings.yaml``.  The Cobbler "
"settings file defines default kernel options for all distributions.  This is "
"not supported in the context of {productname}."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:53
msgid ""
"Understanding raw and resolved values is crucial for managing kernel options "
"effectively."
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າໃຈກ່ຽວກັບຄ່າ Raw ແລະ ຄ່າ Resolved ແມ່ນສິ່ງສຳຄັນໃນການຈັດການ kernel options ໃຫ້ມີປະສິດທິພາບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Raw values**: These refer to values attached directly to a specific "
"Cobbler item and stored as-is in Cobbler's internal database.\n"
msgstr "**Raw values**: ໝາຍເຖິງຄ່າທີ່ຕິດກັບລາຍການ Cobbler ໃດໜຶ່ງໂດຍກົງ ແລະ ຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ຕາມນັ້ນໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນພາຍໃນຂອງ Cobbler.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Resolved values**: These values are dynamically generated at runtime, "
"respecting the inheritance hierarchy of Cobbler items.\n"
msgstr "**Resolved values**: ຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນເວລາເຮັດວຽກ (Runtime) ໂດຍອີງຕາມລຳດັບຂັ້ນການສືບທອດຂອງລາຍການ Cobbler.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:56
msgid ""
"If you prefix an option with [literal]``!`` then the option will be removed "
"from the final kernel command line."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/autoinst-distributions.adoc:57
msgid ""
"{productname} will manage the kernel options for both Profiles and Systems "
"for you.  As such you may only edit the kernel options for Distros."
msgstr "{productname} ຈະຈັດການ kernel options ທັງສຳລັບ Profiles ແລະ Systems ໃຫ້ທ່ານເອງ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ທ່ານອາດຈະແກ້ໄຂ kernel options ໄດ້ສະເພາະສຳລັບ Distros ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

