#.  PDF Publication
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-config-overview.adoc:2
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-config-overview.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Publication Date:** {docdate}\n"
msgstr "**ວັນທີເຜີຍແຜ່:** {docdate}\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-config-overview.adoc:3
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-config-overview.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Preface"
msgstr "ຄຳນຳ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-config-overview.adoc:4
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-config-overview.adoc:15
msgid ""
"After installing {productname}, the first step is registering "
"clients. Managing these clients will be a key part of your workflow."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ແລ້ວ, ຂັ້ນຕອນທຳອິດແມ່ນການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍ. ການຈັດການລູກຂ່າຍເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະເປັນພາກສ່ວນສຳຄັນໃນຂະບວນການເຮັດວຽກຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-config-overview.adoc:5
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-config-overview.adoc:16
msgid ""
"{productname} supports {sle} and other Linux distributions, offering "
"compatibility across various hardware options."
msgstr "{productname} ຮອງຮັບ {sle} ແລະ ຊຸດການຕິດຕັ້ງ Linux ອື່ນໆ, ໂດຍຮອງຮັບການເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັບຮາດແວທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-config-overview.adoc:6
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-config-overview.adoc:17
msgid ""
"For a complete list of supported clients and features, refer to "
"xref:client-configuration:supported-features.adoc[Supported Clients and "
"Features]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລາຍຊື່ລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ຟີເຈີທັງໝົດທີ່ຮອງຮັບ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:client-configuration:supported-features.adoc[Supported Clients and Features]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-config-overview.adoc:7
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-config-overview.adoc:18
msgid ""
"This guide covers both manual and automated client registration and "
"configuration."
msgstr "ຄູ່ມືນີ້ກວມເອົາທັງການລົງທະບຽນ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າລູກຂ່າຍແບບເຮັດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ ແລະ ແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

