#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-operations.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client Operations"
msgstr "ການດຳເນີນງານຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-operations.adoc:2
msgid ""
"In addition to registering, upgrading, installing software, or deleting "
"clients other operations can be performed.  {productname} clients can be "
"managed individually or as a set of clients.  A set of clients can grouped "
"with System Set Manager for a one time action or permanently with System "
"Groups."
msgstr "ນອກຈາກການລົງທະບຽນ, ການອັບເກຣດ, ການຕິດຕັ້ງຊອບແວ ຫຼື ການລົບລູກຂ່າຍແລ້ວ, ຍັງສາມາດດຳເນີນການອື່ນໆໄດ້ອີກ. ລູກຂ່າຍຂອງ {productname} ສາມາດຈັດການແບບແຍກແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງ ຫຼື ຈັດການເປັນກຸ່ມກໍໄດ້. ກຸ່ມຂອງລູກຂ່າຍສາມາດຖືກຈັດກຸ່ມດ້ວຍ System Set Manager ສຳລັບການດຳເນີນການຄັ້ງດຽວ ຫຼື ຈັດກຸ່ມແບບຖາວອນດ້ວຍ System Groups."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-operations.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For advanced client configuratin options general Configuration Management is "
"available.  You can obtain Custom System Information, power on or off, and "
"reboot clients using the {productname} {webui}."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຕົວເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າລູກຂ່າຍຂັ້ນສູງ, ມີລະບົບການຈັດການການຕັ້ງຄ່າທົ່ວໄປໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານ. ທ່ານສາມາດດຶງຂໍ້ມູນລະບົບທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດເຄື່ອງ, ແລະ ບູດລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່ໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ {productname} {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-operations.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The following sections contain detailed descriptions for each of these "
"operations."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍລາຍລະອຽດສຳລັບແຕ່ລະການດຳເນີນງານເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-cli.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register Clients to a Proxy on the Command Line"
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍກັບພຣັອກຊີຜ່ານໜ້າຈໍຄຳສັ່ງ"

#.  FIXME: 2023-10-24, ke: is preinstalled Salt still required?  Salt bundle?
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-cli.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Instead of the {webui}, you can use the command line to register a client to "
"a proxy.  This procedure requires that you have installed the Salt package "
"on the client before registration.  For SLE 12 based clients, you also must "
"have activated the [systemitem]``Advanced Systems Management`` module."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-cli.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Registering Clients to a Proxy Using the Command Line"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍກັບພຣັອກຊີໂດຍໃຊ້ໜ້າຈໍຄຳສັ່ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-cli.adoc:4
msgid "Choose a client configuration file located at:"
msgstr "ເລືອກໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຕັ້ງຢູ່ທີ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-cli.adoc:5
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "/etc/salt/minion\n"
msgstr "/etc/salt/minion\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-cli.adoc:6
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:20
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:39
msgid "or:"
msgstr "ຫຼື:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-cli.adoc:7
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "/etc/salt/minion.d/NAME.conf\n"
msgstr "/etc/salt/minion.d/NAME.conf\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-cli.adoc:8
msgid "This is sometimes also called a minion file."
msgstr "ບາງຄັ້ງໄຟລ໌ນີ້ກໍຖືກເອີ້ນວ່າ ໄຟລ໌ minion."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-cli.adoc:9
msgid "Add the proxy FQDN as the `master` to the client configuration file:"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມ FQDN ຂອງພຣັອກຊີເປັນ `master` ໃນໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າລູກຂ່າຍ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-cli.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "master: PROXY123.EXAMPLE.COM\n"
msgstr "master: PROXY123.EXAMPLE.COM\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-cli.adoc:11
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:45
msgid "Restart the [systemitem]``salt-minion`` service:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-cli.adoc:12
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:46
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl restart salt-minion\n"
msgstr "systemctl restart salt-minion\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-cli.adoc:13
msgid ""
"On the server, accept the new client key; replace [systemitem]``<client>`` "
"with the name of your client:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-cli.adoc:14
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:29
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:48
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-key -a '<client>'\n"
msgstr "salt-key -a '<client>'\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Clients can be registered through the {productname} Proxy with a bootstrap "
"script.  This is done almost the same way as registering clients directly "
"with the {productname} Server."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍສາມາດລົງທະບຽນຜ່ານ {productname} Proxy ດ້ວຍສະຄຣິບ bootstrap ໄດ້. ວິທີນີ້ເຮັດຄ້າຍຄືກັນກັບການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍໂດຍກົງກັບ {productname} Server."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Create the bootstrap script in the {productname} Server container with the "
"[command]``mgr-bootstrap`` command line tool.  [command]``mgr-bootstrap`` "
"requires parameters such as the fully qualified domain name (FQDN) of the "
"proxy, activation keys, or GPG keys.  FQDN of the proxy is mandatory.  All "
"other parameters depend on the specific setup."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:4
msgid "The bootstrap script then deploys all necessary information to the clients."
msgstr "ຈາກນັ້ນ ສະຄຣິບ bootstrap ຈະສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈຳເປັນທັງໝົດໄປຫາລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Create a client activation key on the {productname} Server using the "
"{webui}.  For more information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສ້າງຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ງານລູກຂ່າຍຢູ່ທີ່ {productname} Server ໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui}. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:7
msgid "On the container host of the server, start a terminial in the container:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ຕົວໂຮສຄອນເທນເນີຂອງເຊີບເວີ, ໃຫ້ເປີດເທີມິນໍ (terminal) ໃນຄອນເທນເນີ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:8
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:43
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:17
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:42
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl term\n"
msgstr "mgrctl term\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:9
msgid ""
"In the container, to create the bootstrap script, execute the "
"[command]``mgr-bootstrap`` command, for example, with these options:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgr-bootstrap --hostname=SUMA_PROXY --activation-keys=ACTIVATION_KEY \\\n"
"  --script bootstrap-SUMA_PROXY.sh\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:11
msgid "Replace [literal]``SUMA_PROXY`` with the host name of your proxy."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"With the [option]``--script`` option you save the bootstrap script with a "
"descriptive name.\n"
"   If needed, use additional command line options to customize your "
"bootstrap script.\n"
"   To view available options type [command]``mgr-bootstrap --help`` from the "
"command line.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:14
msgid "Execute the bootstrap script.  There are two options:"
msgstr "ລັນສະຄຣິບ bootstrap. ມີສອງທາງເລືອກ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Transfer the script to the client and run it directly on the clients.  "
"Alternatively, because the proxy forwards requests to the server, the client "
"can download it from http://SUMA_PROXY/pub/bootstrap-SUMA_PROXY.sh.  Replace "
"[literal]``SUMA_PROXY`` with the host name of your proxy."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Execute the script from the proxy with [command]``ssh``.  Replace "
"[literal]``SUMA_PROXY`` with the host name of the proxy and [systemitem]`` "
"<client.example.com>`` with the host name of the client:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-script.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cat /srv/www/htdocs/pub/bootstrap/bootstrap-SUMA_PROXY.sh | ssh "
"root@<client.example.com> /bin/bash\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register Clients to a Proxy With the {webui}"
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍກັບພຣັອກຊີດ້ວຍ {webui}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:2
msgid "You can register clients to the {productname} Proxy using the {webui}."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍກັບ {productname} Proxy ໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui} ໄດ້."

#. A bootstrap repository offers packages for installing {salt} on clients and for registering {salt} clients.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:3
msgid ""
"A bootstrap repository is needed for non-SLE clients in general and for SLE "
"clients before version 15."
msgstr "ຄັງ bootstrap ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ SLE ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປ ແລະ ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍ SLE ທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າເວີຊັນ 15."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For information about creating a bootstrap repository, see "
"xref:client-configuration:bootstrap-repository.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການສ້າງຄັງ bootstrap, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:bootstrap-repository.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Registering Clients to a Proxy with the {webui}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍກັບພຣັອກຊີດ້ວຍ {webui}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:6
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:9
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Bootstrapping]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[Bootstrapping]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:7
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:10
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Host`` field, type the fully qualified domain name (FQDN) "
"of the client to be bootstrapped."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:8
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:11
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``SSH Port`` field, type the SSH port number to use to "
"connect and bootstrap the client."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:9
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:12
msgid "By default, the SSH port is [systemitem]``22``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:10
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:13
msgid "In the [guimenu]``User`` field, type the username to log in to the client."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:11
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:14
msgid "By default, the username is [systemitem]``root``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:12
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Authentication Method`` field, select the authentication "
"method to use for bootstrapping the client."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:13
msgid ""
"For password authentication, in the [guimenu]``Password`` field, type "
"password to log in to the client."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:14
msgid ""
"For SSH Private key authentication, enter the private key and the associated "
"passphrase."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນດ້ວຍ SSH Private key, ໃຫ້ໃສ່ຄີສ່ວນຕົວ (private key) ແລະ ລະຫັດຜ່ານທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:15
msgid ""
"The key is only stored for as long as the bootstrapping process takes to "
"complete."
msgstr "ຄີຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ສະເພາະໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ຂະບວນການ bootstrapping ດຳເນີນການເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:16
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:19
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Activation Key`` field, select the activation key that is "
"associated with the software channel you want to use to bootstrap the "
"client."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:17
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Proxy`` field, select the proxy server you want to "
"register to."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:18
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:22
msgid ""
"By default, the [guimenu]``Disable SSH Strict Key Host Checking`` checkbox "
"is selected."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:19
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:23
msgid ""
"This allows the bootstrap process to automatically accept SSH host keys "
"without requiring you to manually authenticate."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຂະບວນການ bootstrap ຍອມຮັບ SSH host keys ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງໃຫ້ທ່ານຢືນຢັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:20
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:24
msgid "OPTIONAL: Check the [guimenu]``Manage System Completely via SSH`` checkbox."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:21
msgid ""
"If you check this option, the client is configured to use SSH for its "
"connection to the server, and no other connection method is configured."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້, ລູກຂ່າຍຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ໃຊ້ SSH ສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເຊີບເວີ, ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າວິທີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອື່ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:22
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:17
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:27
msgid "Click btn:[Bootstrap] to begin registration."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Bootstrap] ເພື່ອເລີ່ມການລົງທະບຽນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy-webui.adoc:23
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:28
msgid ""
"When the bootstrap process has completed, your client is listed at "
"menu:Systems[System List]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຂະບວນການ bootstrap ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານຈະສະແດງຢູ່ໃນລາຍຊື່ທີ່ menu:Systems[System List]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client Registration to a Proxy"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍກັບພຣັອກຊີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Proxy servers can act as a broker and package cache for clients.  "
"Registering clients to a proxy is similar to registering them directly to "
"the {productname} Server, with a few key differences."
msgstr "ພຣັອກຊີເຊີບເວີສາມາດເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນຕົວແທນ ແລະ ຄັງເກັບແພັກເກັດ (package cache) ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍ. ການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍກັບພຣັອກຊີແມ່ນຄ້າຍຄືກັນກັບການລົງທະບຽນໂດຍກົງກັບ {productname} Server, ແຕ່ມີຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງທີ່ສຳຄັນບາງຢ່າງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:3
msgid ""
"These sections contain information on registering clients to a proxy using "
"the {webui}, commands on the command line, or a bootstrap script.  There are "
"also procedures how you can move clients from one {productname} Proxy to "
"another one or to the {productname} Server."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍກັບພຣັອກຊີໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui}, ຄຳສັ່ງຜ່ານໜ້າຈໍຄຳສັ່ງ, ຫຼື ສະຄຣິບ bootstrap. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ ຍັງມີຂັ້ນຕອນການຍ້າຍລູກຂ່າຍຈາກ {productname} Proxy ໜຶ່ງໄປຫາອີກອັນໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຍ້າຍໄປຫາ {productname} Server."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Within the {webui}, proxy pages show information about clients.  You can see "
"a list of clients that are connected to a proxy by clicking the name of the "
"proxy in menu:Systems[System List > Proxy], then select the "
"[guimenu]``Proxy`` subtab of the [guimenu]``Details`` tab."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:5
msgid ""
"A list of chained proxies for a client can be seen by clicking the name of "
"the client in menu:Systems[All], then select the [guimenu]``Connection`` "
"subtab of the [guimenu]``Details`` tab."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Move Clients Between Proxies"
msgstr "ຍ້າຍລູກຂ່າຍລະຫວ່າງພຣັອກຊີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:7
msgid ""
"You can move clients ({salt}) and {salt} SSH push clients between proxies "
"without the need to repeat the registration process."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຍ້າຍລູກຂ່າຍ ({salt}) ແລະ ລູກຂ່າຍ {salt} SSH push ລະຫວ່າງພຣັອກຊີໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເຮັດຂັ້ນຕອນການລົງທະບຽນໃໝ່."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:8
msgid ""
"You cannot move chained proxies.  Instead of moving a chained proxy, create "
"a new proxy, move the clients, and delete the old proxy."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດຍ້າຍພຣັອກຊີທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັນ (chained proxy) ໄດ້. ແທນທີ່ຈະຍ້າຍ, ໃຫ້ສ້າງພຣັອກຊີໃໝ່, ຍ້າຍລູກຂ່າຍໄປ, ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງລົບພຣັອກຊີເກົ່າຖິ້ມ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Moving Clients or {salt} SSH Push Client Between Proxies"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຍ້າຍລູກຂ່າຍ ຫຼື ລູກຂ່າຍ {salt} SSH Push ລະຫວ່າງພຣັອກຊີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:10
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to the [guimenu]``System Details`` "
"page for the client you want to move between proxies."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Navigate to the [guimenu]``Connection`` tab.  Then follow the "
"[guimenu]``Change proxy`` link to see the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:12
msgid ""
"From the [guimenu]``New Proxy`` drop-down menu select the proxy you want the "
"client to move to, and click btn:[Change Proxy]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Moving Multiple Clients or {salt} SSH Push Clients Between "
"Proxies with SSM"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຍ້າຍລູກຂ່າຍຫຼາຍເຄື່ອງ ຫຼື ລູກຂ່າຍ {salt} SSH Push ລະຫວ່າງພຣັອກຊີດ້ວຍ SSM"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:14
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[System List] and "
"check each client to move, this adds the clients to the system set manager."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[System List] ແລະ ໝາຍເລືອກລູກຂ່າຍແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງທີ່ຕ້ອງການຍ້າຍ, ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເພີ່ມລູກຂ່າຍເຂົ້າໃນ system set manager (SSM)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Systems[System Set Manager], and go to the "
"menu:Misc[Proxy]`` tab."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:16
msgid ""
"From the [guimenu]``New Proxy`` drop-down menu select the proxy you want the "
"clients to move to, and click btn:[Change Proxy]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:17
msgid ""
"The same functionality is also available with the "
"[systemitem]``system.changeProxy`` API call."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:18
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slemicro.adoc:36
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slmicro.adoc:33
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Background Information"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນພື້ນຖານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:19
msgid ""
"The effect of this function differs between normal Salt clients and Salt SSH "
"push clients."
msgstr "ຜົນກະທົບຂອງຟັງຊັນນີ້ຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນລະຫວ່າງລູກຂ່າຍ Salt ປົກກະຕິ ແລະ ລູກຂ່າຍ Salt SSH push."

#. type: Title ====
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Default Clients"
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍມາດຕະຖານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:21
msgid ""
"The function schedules a {salt} state action, which modifies "
"[literal]``master:`` setting in the [path]``susemanager.conf`` {salt} client "
"configuration file to point to the new proxy.  Then the function restarts "
"the {salt} client."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Changing [literal]``master:`` by manually editing the "
"[path]``susemanager.conf`` file has the same effect and is supported, too."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:23
msgid ""
"When the client restarts and reconnects via the new proxy, the server "
"updates the proxy path in the database and schedules another action for "
"refreshing the channel URLs."
msgstr "ເມື່ອລູກຂ່າຍເລີ່ມໃໝ່ ແລະ ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຄືນຜ່ານພຣັອກຊີໃໝ່, ເຊີບເວີຈະອັບເດດເສັ້ນທາງພຣັອກຊີໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຕາຕະລາງການເຮັດວຽກອື່ນເພື່ອຣີເຟຣຊ URL ຂອງຊ່ອງທາງ."

#. type: Title ====
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "{salt} SSH Push Clients"
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍ {salt} SSH Push"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:25
msgid ""
"The function updates the proxy path immediately in the database and new "
"action for refreshing the channel URLs is scheduled."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນຈະອັບເດດເສັ້ນທາງພຣັອກຊີໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນທັນທີ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຕາຕະລາງການເຮັດວຽກໃໝ່ເພື່ອຣີເຟຣຊ URL ຂອງຊ່ອງທາງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Move Clients from Proxies to the Server"
msgstr "ຍ້າຍລູກຂ່າຍຈາກພຣັອກຊີໄປຫາເຊີບເວີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-proxy.adoc:27
msgid ""
"If you want to move a client from a proxy to the server, select "
"[literal]``None`` from proxy list."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upgrade Using the Content Lifecycle Manager"
msgstr "ອັບເກຣດໂດຍໃຊ້ Content Lifecycle Manager"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:2
msgid ""
"When you have many {sles} clients to manage, you can automate in-place "
"upgrades using the content lifecycle manager."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານມີລູກຂ່າຍ {sles} ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍທີ່ຕ້ອງຈັດການ, ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດການອັບເກຣດແບບທັບບ່ອນເກົ່າ (in-place) ແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ content lifecycle manager."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:3
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare to Upgrade"
msgstr "ກຽມການອັບເກຣດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:4
msgid "Before you can upgrade your clients, you need to make these preparations:"
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະອັບເກຣດລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກຽມການດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:5
msgid "Create a content lifecycle project"
msgstr "ສ້າງໂຄງການ content lifecycle"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:6
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:8
msgid "Create an activation key"
msgstr "ສ້າງຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ງານ (activation key)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:7
msgid "Create an autoinstallable distribution"
msgstr "ສ້າງຊຸດການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:8
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:9
msgid "Create an autoinstallation profile"
msgstr "ສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a Content Lifecycle Project"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງໂຄງການ Content Lifecycle"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:10
msgid "Create a content lifecycle project for your distribution."
msgstr "ສ້າງໂຄງການ content lifecycle ສຳລັບຊຸດການຕິດຕັ້ງຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:11
msgid "For more information, see xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:12
msgid "Ensure you a choose a short but descriptive name for your project."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານເລືອກຊື່ໂຄງການທີ່ສັ້ນແຕ່ສື່ຄວາມໝາຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:13
msgid "Include all source channel modules that you require for your distribution."
msgstr "ລວມເອົາທຸກໂມດູນຊ່ອງທາງຕົ້ນທາງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການສຳລັບຊຸດການຕິດຕັ້ງຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:14
msgid "Add filters as required, and set up at least one environment."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຕົວຕອງ (filters) ຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ, ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (environment)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:16
msgid "Create an activation key for your distribution."
msgstr "ສ້າງຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ງານສຳລັບຊຸດການຕິດຕັ້ງຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:18
msgid "Ensure your activation key includes all filtered project channels."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ງານຂອງທ່ານລວມເອົາທຸກຊ່ອງທາງໂຄງການທີ່ຜ່ານການຕອງແລ້ວ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:19
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/virt-xenkvm.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating an Autoinstallable Distribution"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງຊຸດການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Create an autoinstallable distribution for every base channel you want to "
"migrate."
msgstr "ສ້າງຊຸດການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້ ສຳລັບທຸກຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຍ້າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:21
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:17
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-distributions.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-distributions.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Give your distribution a label that references the name of the content "
"lifecycle project."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງປ້າຍຊື່ (label) ໃຫ້ຊຸດການຕິດຕັ້ງຂອງທ່ານໂດຍອ້າງອີງເຖິງຊື່ຂອງໂຄງການ content lifecycle."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:23
msgid ""
"In the ``Installer Generation`` field, select the SLES version you are "
"using."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:24
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating an Autoinstallation Profile"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Create an autoinstallation profile for every target distribution and service "
"pack you want to upgrade to."
msgstr "ສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳລັບທຸກຊຸດການຕິດຕັ້ງເປົ້າໝາຍ ແລະ service pack ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການອັບເກຣດໄປຫາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:26
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-profiles.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:27
msgid ""
"You can use variables in the profile to distinguish between the different "
"lifecycle environments."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຕົວປ່ຽນ (variables) ໃນໂປຣໄຟລ໌ເພື່ອແຍກລະຫວ່າງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມວົງຈອນຊີວິດທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:28
msgid ""
"For example autoinstallation profiles, see "
"https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles/tree/master/AutoYaST."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles/tree/master/AutoYaST."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Use these variables in your autointallation profiles for automating in-place "
"upgrades:"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຕົວປ່ຽນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃນໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອເຮັດການອັບເກຣດແບບທັບບ່ອນເກົ່າໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: Variables for Use in Autoinstallation Profiles"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຕົວປ່ຽນສຳລັບໃຊ້ໃນໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

