#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:34
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upgrade"
msgstr "ອັບເກຣດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:35
msgid ""
"When you have prepared the server for the upgrade, you can provision the "
"clients."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານກຽມເຊີບເວີສຳລັບການອັບເກຣດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດເລີ່ມຈັດສັນ (provision) ລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Provisioning the Clients"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຈັດສັນ (Provisioning) ລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:37
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[System List], and "
"select the clients you want to provision to add them to the system set "
"manager."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[System List], ແລະ ເລືອກລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຈັດສັນເພື່ອເພີ່ມພວກມັນເຂົ້າໃນ system set manager."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:38
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Systems[System Set Manager > Overview] and click the "
"[guimenu]``Provisioning`` tab."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:39
msgid "Select the autoinstallation profile to use."
msgstr "ເລືອກໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດທີ່ຈະໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:40
msgid ""
"For clients that are able to use PXE, the migration is automated as soon as "
"you have provisioned them.  For all other clients, you can use {cobbler} to "
"perform the upgrade."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ PXE ໄດ້, ການຍ້າຍລະບົບຈະເປັນແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດທັນທີທີ່ທ່ານຈັດສັນພວກມັນ. ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍອື່ນໆທັງໝົດ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ {cobbler} ເພື່ອເຮັດການອັບເກຣດໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Using {cobbler} to Upgrade Clients"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການໃຊ້ {cobbler} ເພື່ອອັບເກຣດລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:42
msgid "At the command prompt, as root, to get to a shell inside the container, run:"
msgstr "ທີ່ໜ້າຈໍຄຳສັ່ງ, ໃນຖານະ root, ເພື່ອເຂົ້າໄປໃນ shell ພາຍໃຕ້ຄອນເທນເນີ, ໃຫ້ລັນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:44
msgid "Check the available {cobbler} profiles:"
msgstr "ກວດເບິ່ງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ {cobbler} ທີ່ມີຢູ່:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "cobbler profile list\n"
msgstr "cobbler profile list\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:46
msgid "Build the ISO file with your chosen profile and distribution:"
msgstr "ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ ISO ດ້ວຍໂປຣໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ຊຸດການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ເລືອກ:"

#.  FIXME: 2024-05-06, ke: Do we want to use /tmp here within the container?
#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cobbler buildiso --iso=/tmp/SLE_15-sp1.iso --profiles=SLE_15-sp1:1:Example "
"--distro=SLE_15-sp1\n"
msgstr "cobbler buildiso --iso=/tmp/SLE_15-sp1.iso --profiles=SLE_15-sp1:1:Example --distro=SLE_15-sp1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc:48
msgid ""
"For more information about using CD-ROMs to provision clients, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-cdrom.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ CD-ROMs ເພື່ອຈັດສັນລູກຂ່າຍ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:autoinst-cdrom.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Major Version Upgrade"
msgstr "ການອັບເກຣດເວີຊັນຫຼັກ (Major Version Upgrade)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The clients must have the latest available service pack (SP) for the "
"installed operating system, with all the latest updates applied.  Before you "
"start, ensure that the system is up to date and all updates have been "
"installed successfully."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍຕ້ອງມີ service pack (SP) ລ້າສຸດສຳລັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້, ພ້ອມທັງໄດ້ຮັບການອັບເດດລ້າສຸດທັງໝົດແລ້ວ. ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າລະບົບເປັນເວີຊັນລ້າສຸດ ແລະ ການອັບເດດທັງໝົດໄດ້ຮັບການຕິດຕັ້ງສຳເລັດແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:3
msgid "The upgrade is controlled by {yast} and {ay}, it does not use Zypper."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare to Migrate"
msgstr "ກຽມການຍ້າຍລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Before you can migrate your client from SLE{nbsp}12 to SLE{nbsp}15, you need "
"to:"
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະຍ້າຍລູກຂ່າຍຈາກ SLE{nbsp}12 ໄປເປັນ SLE{nbsp}15, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:6
msgid "Prepare installation media"
msgstr "ກຽມສື່ການຕິດຕັ້ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:7
msgid "Declare an autoinstallation distribution"
msgstr "ປະກາດຊຸດການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare Installation Media"
msgstr "ກຽມສື່ການຕິດຕັ້ງ"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Preparing Installation Media"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຽມສື່ການຕິດຕັ້ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:12
msgid "On the container host, download an ISO image with the installation sources."
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ຕົວໂຮສຄອນເທນເນີ, ໃຫ້ດາວໂຫລດໄຟລ໌ ISO ທີ່ມີແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນການຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:13
msgid "Use [command]``mgradm`` to import the installation data from the ISO image:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm distribution copy <image_name>.iso <image_name>\n"
msgstr "mgradm distribution copy <image_name>.iso <image_name>\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:16
msgid "This image can be used for multiple autoinstallation distributions."
msgstr "ອິເມຈ (image) ນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ສຳລັບຫຼາຍຊຸດການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Declare an Autoinstallation Distribution"
msgstr "ປະກາດຊຸດການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Declaring an Autoinstallation Distribution"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປະກາດຊຸດການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:21
msgid "Click [guimenu]``Create Distribution`` , and complete these fields:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Distribution Label`` field, enter a name to identify your "
"autoinstallation distribution.\n"
"  For example, ``sles15sp6-x86_64``.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Tree Path`` field, enter the path to the installation "
"media you already saved.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Select the matching [guimenu]``Base Channel``.\n"
"This must match the installation media.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Select the [guimenu]``Installer Generation``.\n"
"This must match the installation media.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: Specify kernel options to use when booting this distribution.\n"
"There are multiple ways to provide kernel options.\n"
"Only add options here that are generic for the distribution.\n"
msgstr ""
"ທາງເລືອກ: ລະບຸຕົວເລືອກ kernel ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເມື່ອບູດຊຸດການຕິດຕັ້ງນີ້.\n"
"ມີຫຼາຍວິທີໃນການກຳນົດຕົວເລືອກ kernel.\n"
"ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມສະເພາະຕົວເລືອກທີ່ເປັນຄ່າທົ່ວໄປສຳລັບຊຸດການຕິດຕັ້ງນີ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click btn:[Create Autoinstallable Distribution].\n"
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Create Autoinstallable Distribution].\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:28
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-alibaba.adoc:20
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-almalinux.adoc:25
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-amazon.adoc:24
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:25
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-openeuler.adoc:12
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-oracle.adoc:24
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:21
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rocky.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create an Activation Key"
msgstr "ສ້າງຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ງານ (Activation Key)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:29
msgid ""
"For example, to switch from the old SLE{nbsp}12 base channel to the new "
"SLE{nbsp}15 channel, you need an activation key."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ, ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຈາກຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານ SLE{nbsp}12 ເກົ່າ ໄປເປັນຊ່ອງທາງ SLE{nbsp}15 ໃໝ່, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີຄີການເປີດໃຊ້ງານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:31
msgid ""
"In the {productname} Server {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Activation "
"Keys] and click [guimenu]``Create Key``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:32
msgid "Enter a description for your key."
msgstr "ໃສ່ລາຍລະອຽດສຳລັບຄີຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:33
msgid "Enter a key or leave it blank to generate an automatic key."
msgstr "ໃສ່ຄີ ຫຼື ປະວ່າງໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ລະບົບສ້າງຄີອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:34
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: If you want to limit the usage, enter your value in the "
"[guimenu]``Usage`` text field."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Select the [systemitem]``SLE-Product-SLES15-SP6-Pool for x86_64`` base "
"channel."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:36
msgid "OPTIONAL: Select any [guimenu]``Add-On System Types``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:37
msgid "For more information, see {sles-base-os-documentation}/article-modules.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ {sles-base-os-documentation}/article-modules.html."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:38
msgid "Click btn:[Create Activation Key]."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Create Activation Key]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:39
msgid "Click the [guimenu]``Child Channels`` tab and select the required channels."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:40
msgid "Click btn:[Update Key]."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Update Key]."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create an Autoinstallation Profile"
msgstr "ສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:42
msgid ""
"Autoinstallation profiles contain all the installation and configuration "
"data needed to install a system.  They can also contain scripts to be "
"executed after the installation is complete.  For example scripts that you "
"can use as a starting point, see "
"https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles/tree/master/AutoYaST."
msgstr "ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທັງໝົດທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບ. ພວກມັນຍັງສາມາດມີສະຄຣິບທີ່ຈະລັນຫຼັງຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງສຳເລັດ. ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງສະຄຣິບທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles/tree/master/AutoYaST."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:43
msgid ""
"For valid {ay} upgrade settings, see "
"https://doc.opensuse.org/projects/autoyast/#CreateProfile-upgrade."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າການອັບເກຣດ {ay} ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ https://doc.opensuse.org/projects/autoyast/#CreateProfile-upgrade."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:45
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > "
"Profiles] and upload your autoinstallation profile script."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[Autoinstallation > Profiles] ແລະ ອັບໂຫລດສະຄຣິບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:46
msgid "For example scripts that you can use as a starting point, see:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງສະຄຣິບທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:47
msgid "https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles/tree/master/AutoYaST."
msgstr "https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles/tree/master/AutoYaST."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:48
msgid "In the ``Kernel Options`` field, type ``autoupgrade=1``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:49
msgid ""
"Optionally, you can also include the ``Y2DEBUG=1`` option.  The debug "
"setting is not required but can help with investigating any future problems "
"you might encounter."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:50
msgid ""
"Clients running in Azure cloud must add ``textmode=1 console=ttyS0`` to "
"``Kernel Options``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:51
msgid "Paste the autoinstallation profile or use the file upload field."
msgstr "ວາງເນື້ອຫາໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ຊ່ອງອັບໂຫລດໄຟລ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:52
msgid "Click btn:[Create] to save."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Create] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:53
msgid ""
"When the uploaded profile requires variables to be set, navigate to "
"menu:Systems[Autoinstallation > Profiles], select the profile to edit, and "
"navigate to the [guimenu]``Variables`` tab."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:54
msgid "Specify the required variables, using this format:"
msgstr "ລະບຸຕົວປ່ຽນທີ່ຈຳເປັນ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຮູບແບບນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "<key>=<value>\n"
msgstr "<key>=<value>\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:56
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migration"
msgstr "ການຍ້າຍລະບົບ (Migration)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:57
msgid ""
"Before you begin, check that all the channels referenced in the "
"autoinstallation profile are available and fully synchronized."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມ, ໃຫ້ກວດເບິ່ງວ່າທຸກຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ອ້າງອີງໃນໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຕິດຕັ້ງອັດຕະໂນມັດນັ້ນມີຢູ່ ແລະ ໄດ້ຮັບການຊິງໂຄຣໄນສຳເລັດສົມບູນແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:58
msgid ""
"You can monitor the mirroring progress in "
"[path]``/var/log/rhn/reposync/<channel-label>.log``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Migrating"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຍ້າຍລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:60
msgid ""
"In the {productname} Server {webui}, navigate to [guimenu]``Systems`` and "
"select the client to be upgraded."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:61
msgid ""
"Navigate to the [guimenu]``Provisioning`` tab, and select the "
"autoinstallation profile you uploaded."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:62
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Schedule Autoinstallation and Finish].  The system downloads the "
"required files, change the bootloader entries, reboot, and start the "
"upgrade."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Schedule Autoinstallation and Finish]. ລະບົບຈະດາວໂຫລດໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈຳເປັນ, ປ່ຽນລາຍການໃນ bootloader, ບູດເຄື່ອງໃໝ່, ແລະ ເລີ່ມການອັບເກຣດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:63
msgid ""
"Next time the client synchronizes with the {productname} Server, it receives "
"a re-installation job.  The re-installation job fetches the new kernel and "
"initrd packages.  It also writes a new [path]``/boot/grub/menu.lst`` (GRUB "
"Legacy) or [path]``/boot/grub2/grub.cfg`` (GRUB 2), containing pointers to "
"the new kernel and initrd packages."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:64
msgid ""
"When the client next boots, it uses grub to boot the new kernel with its "
"initrd.  PXE booting is not used during this process."
msgstr "ເມື່ອລູກຂ່າຍບູດຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປ, ມັນຈະໃຊ້ grub ເພື່ອບູດ kernel ໃໝ່ພ້ອມກັບ initrd ຂອງມັນ. ຈະບໍ່ມີການໃຊ້ການບູດຜ່ານ PXE ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂະບວນການນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:65
msgid ""
"Approximately three minutes after the job was fetched, the client goes down "
"for reboot."
msgstr "ປະມານສາມນາທີຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບໜ້າວຽກ, ລູກຂ່າຍຈະປິດເຄື່ອງເພື່ອບູດໃໝ່."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-major.adoc:66
msgid ""
"For clients, use the ``spacewalk/minion_script`` snippet to register the "
"client again after migration has completed."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Product Migration"
msgstr "ການຍ້າຍຜະລິດຕະພັນ (Product Migration)"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:2
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/power-management.adoc:2
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:2
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:2
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:2
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-set-manager.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "ບົດນຳ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Product migration allows you to upgrade SLE-based client systems from an "
"Service Pack (SP) level to a later one.  For example, you can migrate "
"{sles}{nbsp}15{nbsp}SP5 to {sles}{nbsp}15{nbsp}SP6.  You can also upgrade "
"clients such as {rhel} or {centos} to {sll}."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Product migration requires that all repositories which are enabled on the "
"client and which should be migrated must be valid, otherwise the migration "
"will abort."
msgstr "ການຍ້າຍຜະລິດຕະພັນຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ທຸກຄັງເກັບຊອບແວທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ງານໃນລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ທີ່ຄວນຈະຖືກຍ້າຍນັ້ນຕ້ອງຖືກຕ້ອງ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນການຍ້າຍລະບົບຈະຖືກຍົກເລີກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Product migration is for upgrading within the same major version.  You "
"cannot use product migration to migrate from {sles}{nbsp}12 to "
"{sles}{nbsp}15.  For more information about major upgrades, see "
"xref:client-configuration:client-upgrades-major.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:6
msgid ""
"You can also migrate {leap} to a later minor version or to the corresponding "
"{sles} SP level, for example:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:7
msgid "{leap} 15.5 to 15.6"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:8
msgid "{leap} 15.6 to {sles} 15 SP6"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:9
msgid ""
"In {sles}{nbsp}12 and later, {suse} supports service pack skipping if "
"{scclongform} provides it.  For example, you can upgrade from {sles}{nbsp}15 "
"to SP2, without installing SP1."
msgstr "ໃນ {sles}{nbsp}12 ແລະ ເວີຊັນທີ່ໃໝ່ກວ່າ, {suse} ຮອງຮັບການຂ້າມ Service Pack ຖ້າ {scclongform} ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ທ່ານສາມາດອັບເກຣດຈາກ {sles}{nbsp}15 ໄປເປັນ SP2 ໄດ້ເລີຍ ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງ SP1."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:10
msgid ""
"For supported {sles} upgrade paths, see "
"link:https://documentation.suse.com/en-us/sles/15-SP4/html/SLES-all/cha-upgrade-paths.html#sec-upgrade-paths-supported[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:11
msgid "All recommended extensions are automatically enabled when you migrate."
msgstr "ສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍທີ່ແນະນຳທັງໝົດຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອທ່ານຍ້າຍລະບົບ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:12
msgid ""
"During migration, {productname} automatically accepts any required licenses "
"(EULAs) before installation."
msgstr "ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຍ້າຍລະບົບ, {productname} ຈະຍອມຮັບໃບອະນຸຍາດ (EULAs) ທີ່ຈຳເປັນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດກ່ອນການຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Single System Migration"
msgstr "ການຍ້າຍລະບົບແບບເຄື່ອງດຽວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:14
msgid "Before starting the product migration:"
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມການຍ້າຍຜະລິດຕະພັນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Ensure there are no pending updates or patches.  Check the [guimenu]``System "
"Status`` on the client system's menu:Details[Overview] page, and install all "
"offered updates or patches.  If your client system is not up to date, "
"product migration may fail."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Make sure all the channels of the target product are fully synchronized.  To "
"check the synchronization status in the {webui}, navigate to the "
"menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Products] page."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າທຸກຊ່ອງທາງຂອງຜະລິດຕະພັນເປົ້າໝາຍໄດ້ຮັບການຊິງໂຄຣໄນສຳເລັດສົມບູນແລ້ວ. ເພື່ອກວດເບິ່ງສະຖານະການຊິງໂຄຣໄນໃນ {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ໜ້າ menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Products]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Ensure you have a working system backup available, in case of an emergency.  "
"Product migration does not have a rollback feature.  When the migration "
"procedure has begun, rolling back is not possible."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນລະບົບທີ່ໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ ໃນກໍລະນີສຸກເສີນ. ການຍ້າຍຜະລິດຕະພັນບໍ່ມີຟີເຈີການຍ້ອນກັບ (rollback). ເມື່ອຂະບວນການຍ້າຍລະບົບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແລ້ວ, ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຍ້ອນກັບຄືນໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Performing a Single System Migration"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການດຳເນີນການຍ້າຍລະບົບແບບເຄື່ອງດຽວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:19
msgid "From the menu:Systems[Overview] page, select a client."
msgstr "ຈາກໜ້າ menu:Systems[Overview], ໃຫ້ເລືອກລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:20
msgid ""
"From the system details page of the client, navigate to the "
"menu:Software[Product Migration] tab."
msgstr "ຈາກໜ້າລາຍລະອຽດລະບົບຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Software[Product Migration]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:21
msgid "Select the target migration path and click btn:[Select Channels]."
msgstr "ເລືອກເສັ້ນທາງການຍ້າຍເປົ້າໝາຍ ແລະ ກົດ btn:[Select Channels]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:22
msgid ""
"From the [guimenu]``Product Migration - Channels`` page select the correct "
"base channel, including ``Mandatory Child Channels`` and any additional "
"``Optional Child Channels``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:23
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: Check [guimenu]``Allow Vendor Change`` to allow packages that have "
"changed vendors to be installed.  If this occurs, a notification is shown "
"with details before the migration is started."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:24
msgid ""
"To migrate openSUSE Leap to {sles}, you must check the [guimenu]``Allow "
"Vendor Change`` option."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Schedule Migration] when your channels have been configured "
"properly."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Schedule Migration] ເມື່ອຊ່ອງທາງຂອງທ່ານຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງແລ້ວ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Product Mass Migration"
msgstr "ການຍ້າຍຜະລິດຕະພັນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ (Product Mass Migration)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:27
msgid ""
"If you want to migrate a large number of clients to the next SP version, you "
"can use {productname} API calls."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:28
msgid ""
"The [command]``spacecmd`` commandline tool provides a "
"[systemitem]``system_scheduleproductmigration`` sub command, which can be "
"used to schedule a migration for a large number of clients to the next minor "
"version."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Perform a Product Mass Migration"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:30
msgid ""
"The product mass migration operation is dangerous and the process should be "
"tested thoroughly.  At least, do a dry-run first."
msgstr "ການດຳເນີນການຍ້າຍຜະລິດຕະພັນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍແມ່ນມີຄວາມສ່ຽງ ແລະ ຂະບວນການຄວນໄດ້ຮັບການທົດສອບຢ່າງລະອຽດ. ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ, ຄວນເຮັດ dry-run ກ່ອນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:31
msgid "Be careful not to upgrade systems unintentionally."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ລະວັງ ຢ່າອັບເກຣດລະບົບໂດຍບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງໃຈ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Performing a Product Mass Migration"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:33
msgid ""
"List available migration targets, and take note of the system IDs you want "
"to migrate:"
msgstr "ສະແດງລາຍຊື່ເປົ້າໝາຍການຍ້າຍລະບົບທີ່ມີຢູ່, ແລະ ຈົດບັນທຶກ system IDs ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຍ້າຍ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacecmd api -- system.listMigrationTargets -A 1000010001\n"
msgstr "spacecmd api -- system.listMigrationTargets -A 1000010001\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:35
msgid ""
"For each system ID, call [systemitem]``listMigrationTarget`` and check that "
"the desired target product is available."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:36
msgid ""
"If the system ID has an available target, call "
"[systemitem]``system.scheduleProductMigration``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:37
msgid "If the desired target is not available, skip the system."
msgstr "ຖ້າເປົ້າໝາຍທີ່ຕ້ອງການບໍ່ມີ, ໃຫ້ຂ້າມລະບົບນັ້ນໄປ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:38
msgid "Adapt this template for your environment:"
msgstr "ປັບແຕ່ງແມ່ແບບ (template) ນີ້ສຳລັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"target = '[....]'\n"
"basechannel = 'channel-label'\n"
"system_ids = [1, 2, 3]\n"
msgstr ""
"target = '[....]'\n"
"basechannel = 'channel-label'\n"
"system_ids = [1, 2, 3]\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"session = auth.login(user, pass)\n"
"for system in system_ids\n"
"  if system.listMigrationTargets(session, system).ident == target\n"
"    system.scheduleProductMigration(session, system, target, basechannel, "
"[], False, <now>)\n"
"  else\n"
"    print \"Cannot migrate to requested target -- skipping system\"\n"
"  endif\n"
"endfor\n"
msgstr ""
"session = auth.login(user, pass)\n"
"for system in system_ids\n"
"  if system.listMigrationTargets(session, system).ident == target\n"
"    system.scheduleProductMigration(session, system, target, basechannel, [], False, <now>)\n"
"  else\n"
"    print \"Cannot migrate to requested target -- skipping system\"\n"
"  endif\n"
"endfor\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: SLES 15 SP2 to SLES 15 SP3"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: SLES 15 SP2 ໄປເປັນ SLES 15 SP3"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:42
msgid ""
"For this example, a group will be created temporarily to facilitate the mass "
"migration."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ຈະມີການສ້າງກຸ່ມຂຶ້ນຊົ່ວຄາວເພື່ອອຳນວຍຄວາມສະດວກໃນການຍ້າຍລະບົບຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a Mass Product Migration Group"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງກຸ່ມສຳລັບການຍ້າຍຜະລິດຕະພັນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:44
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[System Groups], and "
"click btn:[Create Group]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[System Groups], ແລະ ກົດ btn:[Create Group]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:45
msgid "Name the group [literal]``mpm-target-sles15sp3``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:46
msgid ""
"Only systems subscribed to the same base channel should be added to the "
"created group.  In the example, only systems subscribed to "
"[literal]``SLE-Product-SLES15-SP2-Pool for x86_64`` should be added to the "
"group."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:47
msgid ""
"For more information about adding clients to groups, see "
"xref:client-configuration:system-groups.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການເພີ່ມລູກຂ່າຍເຂົ້າໃນກຸ່ມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:system-groups.adoc[]."

#. Note or warning about taking normal precautions (backups, make sure fully patched, etc)
#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:48
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding Systems to the Group"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເພີ່ມລະບົບເຂົ້າໃນກຸ່ມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:49
msgid "Get the targets for all the systems in the group by running:"
msgstr "ດຶງຂໍ້ມູນເປົ້າໝາຍສຳລັບທຸກລະບົບໃນກຸ່ມໂດຍການລັນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:50
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacecmd -- system_listmigrationtargets group:mpm-target-sles15sp3\n"
msgstr "spacecmd -- system_listmigrationtargets group:mpm-target-sles15sp3\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:51
msgid "The command output a string of \"IDs.\""
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງຈະສະແດງຜົນເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມຂອງ \"IDs.\""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:52
msgid "Only select a target, which is reported for *all* systems."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ເລືອກສະເພາະເປົ້າໝາຍທີ່ມີລາຍງານສຳລັບ *ທຸກໆ* ລະບົບເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:53
msgid ""
"The string is the identifier for the [literal]``MIGRATIONTARGET`` of the "
"other command."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:54
msgid ""
"The [command]``spacecmd`` sub-commands "
"[literal]``system_scheduleproductmigration`` and "
"[command]``system_listmigrationtargets`` are looping over all systems that "
"are part of the group."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:55
msgid "If there are 100 systems in the group, you will see 100 actions scheduled."
msgstr "ຖ້າມີ 100 ລະບົບໃນກຸ່ມ, ທ່ານຈະເຫັນ 100 ການດຳເນີນງານທີ່ຖືກຕັ້ງຕາຕະລາງໄວ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:56
msgid "All systems in the group must support the same migration target."
msgstr "ທຸກລະບົບໃນກຸ່ມຕ້ອງຮອງຮັບເປົ້າໝາຍການຍ້າຍລະບົບອັນດຽວກັນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Running the Mass Migration Command"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລັນຄຳສັ່ງຍ້າຍລະບົບຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:58
msgid ""
"The syntax for the [command]``system_scheduleproductmigration`` command is "
"as follows:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"spacecmd -- system_scheduleproductmigration <SYSTEM> <BASE_CHANNEL_LABEL> "
"\\\n"
"    <MIGRATION_TARGET> [options]\n"
msgstr ""
"spacecmd -- system_scheduleproductmigration <SYSTEM> <BASE_CHANNEL_LABEL> \\\n"
"    <MIGRATION_TARGET> [options]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:60
msgid ""
"For this example to upgrade all systems in the group "
"[literal]``mpm-target-sles15sp3`` from SLES 12 SP2 to SLES 15 SP, enter on "
"the command line:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:61
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"spacecmd -- system_scheduleproductmigration group:mpm-target-sles15sp3 \\\n"
"    sle-product-sles15-sp3-pool-x86_64 \"[190,203,195,1242]\" -d\n"
msgstr ""
"spacecmd -- system_scheduleproductmigration group:mpm-target-sles15sp3 \\\n"
"    sle-product-sles15-sp3-pool-x86_64 \"[190,203,195,1242]\" -d\n"

#. type: Title ====
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mandatory Syntax Explained"
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍໄວຍາກອນທີ່ບັງຄັບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:63
msgid ""
"To see syntax usage and options for "
"[command]``system_scheduleproductmigration``, run:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacecmd system_scheduleproductmigration help\n"
msgstr "spacecmd system_scheduleproductmigration help\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "<SYSTEM>"
msgstr "<SYSTEM>"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:66
msgid ""
"For this example we will use the group we created to select all of the "
"systems from that group:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ ພວກເຮົາຈະໃຊ້ກຸ່ມທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນເພື່ອເລືອກທຸກລະບົບຈາກກຸ່ມນັ້ນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "group:mpm-target-sles15sp3\n"
msgstr "group:mpm-target-sles15sp3\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:68
#, no-wrap
msgid "<BASE_CHANNEL_LABEL>"
msgstr "<BASE_CHANNEL_LABEL>"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:69
msgid ""
"This is the label for the target base channel.  In this case, the system is "
"being upgraded to SLES 15 SP3, and the label is "
"[literal]``sle-product-sles15-sp3-pool-x86_64``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:70
msgid "To see a list of all base channels currently mirrored, run:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານທັງໝົດທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດ mirror ຢູ່, ໃຫ້ລັນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacecmd softwarechannel_listbasechannels.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:72
msgid ""
"Keep in mind you cannot upgrade to a channel unless it is an available "
"target for your current base channel."
msgstr "ກະລຸນາຈື່ໄວ້ວ່າ ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດອັບເກຣດໄປຫາຊ່ອງທາງໃດໜຶ່ງໄດ້ ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ວ່າມັນເປັນເປົ້າໝາຍທີ່ມີໃຫ້ສຳລັບຊ່ອງທາງພື້ນຖານປັດຈຸບັນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:73
#, no-wrap
msgid "<MIGRATION_TARGET>"
msgstr "<MIGRATION_TARGET>"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:74
msgid ""
"To identify this value for systems in the group "
"[literal]``group:mpm-target-sles15sp3``, run:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:76
msgid ""
"The [literal]``MIGRATION_TARGET`` parameter must be passed in the following "
"format; note necessary shell quotation to prevent sideeffects with brackets:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:77
#, no-wrap
msgid "\"[190,203,195,1242]\"\n"
msgstr "\"[190,203,195,1242]\"\n"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:78
#, no-wrap
msgid "Options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:79
msgid "[literal]``-s`` START_TIME"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:80
msgid ""
"[literal]``-d`` pass this flag, if you want to do a dry run (it is "
"recommended to run a dry run before the actual migration)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:81
msgid ""
"[literal]``-c`` CHILD_CHANNELS (comma-separated child channels labels with "
"no spaces)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:82
msgid ""
"In this case we included the [literal]``-d`` option, which can be removed "
"after a successful dry run."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:83
msgid ""
"If successful, the command output for each scheduled system will look like "
"this:"
msgstr "ຖ້າສຳເລັດ, ຜົນຂອງຄຳສັ່ງສຳລັບແຕ່ລະລະບົບທີ່ຕັ້ງຕາຕະລາງໄວ້ຈະເປັນແບບນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:84
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Scheduling Product migration for system mpm-sles152-1\n"
"Scheduled action ID: 66\n"
msgstr ""
"Scheduling Product migration for system mpm-sles152-1\n"
"Scheduled action ID: 66\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:85
msgid ""
"You can also track the action, in this case the dry run, in the {webui} for "
"a given system in the group.  From the system details page of the client, "
"navigate to menu:Events[History].  If there are any failures during the dry "
"run, the system should be investigated."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດຕິດຕາມການດຳເນີນງານ, ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ແມ່ນ dry run, ໄດ້ໃນ {webui} ສຳລັບລະບົບໃນກຸ່ມ. ຈາກໜ້າລາຍລະອຽດລະບົບຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Events[History]. ຖ້າມີຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນລະຫວ່າງ dry run, ຄວນກວດສອບລະບົບນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc:86
msgid ""
"If all is well, the [literal]``-d`` option can be removed from the command "
"to run the real migration.  After the migration is complete, you can reboot "
"the system from the {productname} {webui}."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upgrade Uyuni Clients"
msgstr "ອັບເກຣດລູກຂ່າຍ Uyuni"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:2
msgid "In this section, we use openSUSE Leap as an example."
msgstr "ໃນພາກນີ້, ພວກເຮົາໃຊ້ openSUSE Leap ເປັນຕົວຢ່າງ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Preparing the Client Upgrade"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຽມການອັບເກຣດລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:5
msgid ""
"At the command prompt on the {productname} Server, as root, use the "
"[command]``spacewalk-common-channels`` command to add the appropriate "
"channels."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"spacewalk-common-channels \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4 \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4-non-oss \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4-non-oss-updates \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4-updates \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4-uyuni-client\n"
msgstr ""
"spacewalk-common-channels \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4 \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4-non-oss \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4-non-oss-updates \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4-updates \\\n"
"opensuse_leap15_4-uyuni-client\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Fully synchronize all channels with [command]``spacewalk-repo-sync``.  In "
"case of already defined repository URLs, continue with "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:proxy-uyuni.adoc#uyuni-202007-channeldupes[]."
msgstr ""

#.  These are custom channels.
#.  For more information, see xref:client-configuration:clients-opensuse.adoc[].
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:8
msgid ""
"In the {productname} Server {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > "
"Channels] and click the [systemitem]``Uyuni Client Tools for openSUSE Leap "
"15.4 (x86_64)`` channel name."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:9
msgid "In the upper right corner, click btn:[Manage Channel]."
msgstr "ຢູ່ມຸມຂວາເທິງ, ໃຫ້ກົດ btn:[Manage Channel]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Click the [guimenu]``Repositories`` tab, and select [systemitem]``External - "
"Uyuni Client Tools for openSUSE Leap 15.3 (x86_64)``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:11
msgid "Click btn:[Update Repositories]."
msgstr "ກົດ btn:[Update Repositories]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:12
msgid "Navigate to menu:Repositories[Sync] subtab, and click btn:[Sync Now]."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບຍ່ອຍ menu:Repositories[Sync], ແລະ ກົດ btn:[Sync Now]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Do the same with [systemitem]``openSUSE Leap 15.4 (x86_64)`` and "
"[systemitem]``External - openSUSE Leap 15.3 (x86_64)``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Unfold [systemitem]``openSUSE Leap 15.4 (x86_64)`` to see all child channels "
"populated with packages."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:16
msgid ""
"To upgrade a client you replace the software repositories and update the "
"software, and finally reboot the client."
msgstr "ເພື່ອອັບເກຣດລູກຂ່າຍ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງປ່ຽນຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ ແລະ ອັບເດດຊອບແວ, ຈາກນັ້ນຈຶ່ງບູດລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Upgrading the Client"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການອັບເກຣດລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:18
msgid ""
"In the {productname} Server {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[] and click "
"the name of the client."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} Server {webui}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[] ແລະ ກົດທີ່ຊື່ຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Click menu:Software[Software Channels], and as the base channel select the "
"openSUSE Leap {opensuse-version} channel that is listed in the "
"[systemitem]``Customs Channels`` list."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ menu:Software[Software Channels], ແລະ ເລືອກຊ່ອງ openSUSE Leap {opensuse-version} ທີ່ຢູ່ໃນລາຍການ [systemitem]``Customs Channels`` ໃຫ້ເປັນ base channel."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:20
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Child Channels`` pane, select the {opensuse-version} child "
"channels."
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Child Channels``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ {opensuse-version} child channels."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Next], and [guimenu]``Confirm Software Channel Change`` with "
"btn:[Confirm]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Next], ແລະ ຢືນຢັນການປ່ຽນແປງດ້ວຍ btn:[Confirm] ໃນໜ້າຈໍ [guimenu]``Confirm Software Channel Change``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Click menu:Software[Packages > Upgrade], and select all the packages to be "
"updated on the client, and then apply the selection.  Click btn:[Upgrade "
"Packages], check the details, and click btn:[Confirm] to complete the "
"update."
msgstr "ກົດເມນູ: Software[Packages > Upgrade], ແລະ ເລືອກແພັກເກັດທັງໝົດທີ່ຕ້ອງການອັບເດດໃນລູກຂ່າຍ, ແລ້ວກົດໃຊ້ການເລືອກ. ກົດ btn:[Upgrade Packages], ກວດເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດ, ແລະ ກົດ btn:[Confirm] ເພື່ອເຮັດການອັບເດດໃຫ້ສຳເລັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:23
msgid "Reboot the client."
msgstr "ບູດລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc:24
msgid ""
"If you need to update many clients, you can create an action chain of this "
"command sequence on the {productname} Server.  You can use the action chain "
"to perform updates on multiple clients at the same time."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງອັບເດດລູກຂ່າຍຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ, ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງລະບົບຕ່ອງໂສ້ການດຳເນີນງານ (action chain) ຂອງລຳດັບຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ໃນ {productname} Server ໄດ້. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ action chain ເພື່ອດຳເນີນການອັບເດດໃນລູກຂ່າຍຫຼາຍເຄື່ອງພ້ອມກັນໄດ້."

#
#
#. . Assign the new channels to the clients instead of the old channels.
#. . Update all the packages.  This can either be done with the {webui} or better run [command]``zypper dup`` manually on the command line local on the systems or remotely as a Salt command.
#. I think the better way to document this is if giving it a try. Create an Uyuni server, sync Leap 15.1 (spacewalk-common-channels), create a Leap 15.1, onboard it, sync Leap 15.2 (spacewalk-common-channels), and then try to adjust the channels and trying to upgrade. I recommend you use VMs and take snapshots of the VMs so you can repeat steps as needed.
#. But for now you need to create and mirror at least the target channels with spacewalk-common-channels.
#. You adjust the channels for the client and best is to call "zypper dup". Either from the commandline on that system or using remote command.
#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client Upgrades"
msgstr "ການອັບເກຣດ Client"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Clients use the versioning system of their underlying operating system, and "
"require regular upgrades."
msgstr "Client ໃຊ້ລະບົບເວີຊັນຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການພື້ນຖານຂອງພວກເຂົາ, ແລະ ຕ້ອງການການອັບເກຣດເປັນປະຈຳ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For {scc} registered clients using {suse} operating systems, you can perform "
"upgrades within the {productname} {webui}.  For supported {sle}{nbsp}15 "
"upgrade paths, see {sles-base-os-documentation}/cha-upgrade-paths.html"
msgstr "ສຳລັບ client ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນ {scc} ໂດຍໃຊ້ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ {suse}, ທ່ານສາມາດດຳເນີນການອັບເກຣດພາຍໃນ {productname} {webui} ໄດ້. ສຳລັບເສັ້ນທາງການອັບເກຣດ {sle}{nbsp}15 ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ {sles-base-os-documentation}/cha-upgrade-paths.html"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To upgrade clients running SLE{nbsp}12 to SLE{nbsp}15, the upgrade is "
"automated, but you need to do some preparation steps before you begin.  For "
"more information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:client-upgrades-major.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອອັບເກຣດ client ທີ່ລັນ SLE{nbsp}12 ໄປເປັນ SLE{nbsp}15, ການອັບເກຣດແມ່ນເປັນແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ແຕ່ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ກຽມຂັ້ນຕອນບາງຢ່າງກ່ອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:client-upgrades-major.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades.adoc:5
msgid ""
"You can also automate client upgrades using the content lifecycle manager.  "
"For more information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc[]."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ການອັບເກຣດ client ເປັນແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ content lifecycle manager. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:client-upgrades-lifecycle.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades.adoc:6
msgid ""
"For more information about product migration such as service pack upgrades, "
"openSUSE Leap minor version upgrades, or openSUSE Leap to {sle} migrations, "
"see xref:client-configuration:client-upgrades-product-migration.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/client-upgrades.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For more information about upgrading unregistered openSUSE Leap clients, see "
"xref:client-configuration:client-upgrades-uyuni.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

