"For supported products, see the release notes and the support table at "
"xref:client-configuration:supported-features-almalinux.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ຮອງຮັບ, ເບິ່ງບັນທຶກການປ່ອຍ ແລະ ຕາຕະລາງການຮອງຮັບໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:supported-features-almalinux.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-almalinux.adoc:6
msgid ""
"When created at AWS, {almalinux} instances always have the same `machine-id` "
"id at `/etc/machine-id`.  Make sure you regenerate the `machine-id` after "
"the instance is created.  For more information, see "
"xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອສ້າງຢູ່ AWS, instance ຂອງ {almalinux} ຈະມີ `machine-id` ດຽວກັນສະເໝີຢູ່ທີ່ `/etc/machine-id`. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ສ້າງ `machine-id` ໃໝ່ຫຼັງຈາກສ້າງ instance ແລ້ວ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-almalinux.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Registering {almalinux} clients to {productname} is tested with the default "
"SELinux configuration of ``enforcing`` with a ``targeted`` policy.  You do "
"not need to disable SELinux to register {almalinux} clients to "
"{productname}."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-almalinux.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Before you can register {almalinux} clients to your {productname} Server, "
"you need to add the required software channels, and synchronize them."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະລົງທະບຽນ client {almalinux} ເຂົ້າກັບ {productname} Server ຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວທີ່ຕ້ອງການ ແລະ ຊິງໂຄຣໄນພວກມັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-almalinux.adoc:10
msgid ""
"The architectures currently supported are: `x86_64` and `aarch64`, on "
"version 9 additionally {ppc64le} and {s390x}.  For full list of supported "
"products and architectures, see "
"xref:client-configuration:supported-features.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳທີ່ຮອງຮັບໃນປັດຈຸບັນຄື: `x86_64` ແລະ `aarch64`, ໃນເວີຊັນ 9 ຍັງຮອງຮັບ {ppc64le} ແລະ {s390x} ເພີ່ມຕື່ມ. ສຳລັບລາຍຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນ ແລະ ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳທັງໝົດທີ່ຮອງຮັບ, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:supported-features.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-almalinux.adoc:11
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-amazon.adoc:11
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-opensuseleap.adoc:10
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rocky.adoc:10
msgid "For example, when working with `x86_64` architecture, you need this product:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, ເມື່ອເຮັດວຽກກັບສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ `x86_64`, ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຜະລິດຕະພັນນີ້:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-almalinux.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "{almalinux} Products - WebUI"
msgstr "ຜະລິດຕະພັນ {almalinux} - WebUI"

#. type: Table
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-almalinux.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| OS Version    | Product Name\n"
"| {almalinux} 9 | {almalinux} 9 x86_64\n"
"| {almalinux} 8 | {almalinux} 8 x86_64\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-almalinux.adoc:15
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-almalinux.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "{almalinux} Channels - CLI"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງ {almalinux} - CLI"

#. type: Table
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-almalinux.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| OS Version | Base Channel\n"
"| {almalinux} 9 | almalinux9-x86_64\n"
"| {almalinux} 8 | almalinux8-x86_64\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-almalinux.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| OS Version    | Base Channel | Client Channel          | AppStream "
"Channel\n"
"| {almalinux} 9 | almalinux9   | almalinux9-uyuni-client | "
"almalinux9-appstream\n"
"| {almalinux} 8 | almalinux8   | almalinux8-uyuni-client | "
"almalinux8-appstream\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-almalinux.adoc:21
msgid ""
"For {almalinux} 9 and {almalinux} 8 clients, add both the Base and AppStream "
"channels.  You require packages from both channels.  If you do not add both "
"channels, you cannot create the bootstrap repository, due to missing "
"packages."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-almalinux.adoc:22
msgid ""
"If you are using modular channels, you must enable the Python 3.6 module "
"stream on the {almalinux} 8 client.  If you do not provide Python 3.6, the "
"installation of the [package]``spacecmd`` package will fail."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-almalinux.adoc:23
msgid ""
"You might notice some disparity in the number of packages available in the "
"AppStream channel between upstream and the {productname} channel.  You might "
"also see different numbers if you compare the same channel added at a "
"different point in time.  This is due to the way that {almalinux} manages "
"their repositories.  {almalinux} removes older version of packages when a "
"new version is released, while {productname} keeps all of them, regardless "
"of age."
msgstr "ທ່ານອາດຈະສັງເກດເຫັນຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງຂອງຈຳນວນ package ໃນຊ່ອງທາງ AppStream ລະຫວ່າງ upstream ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງຂອງ {productname}. ນີ້ແມ່ນຍ້ອນວິທີທີ່ {almalinux} ຈັດການ repository ຂອງພວກເຂົາ ໂດຍການລຶບເວີຊັນເກົ່າອອກເມື່ອມີເວີຊັນໃໝ່, ແຕ່ {productname} ຈະເກັບຮັກສາທັງໝົດໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-almalinux.adoc:26
msgid ""
"You need to create an activation key that is associated with your "
"{almalinux} channels."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງ activation key ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຊ່ອງທາງ {almalinux} ຂອງທ່ານ."

