#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage GPG Keys"
msgstr "ຈັດການ GPG Keys"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-almalinux.adoc:29
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-amazon.adoc:28
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:29
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:25
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-oes.adoc:21
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-opensuseleap.adoc:19
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-oracle.adoc:28
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:25
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:123
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:72
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rocky.adoc:28
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sle.adoc:27
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:45
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/gpg-keys.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Clients use GPG keys to check the authenticity of software packages before "
"they are installed.  Only trusted software can be installed on clients."
msgstr "Client ໃຊ້ GPG keys ເພື່ອກວດສອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງ package ຊອບແວກ່ອນການຕິດຕັ້ງ. ສະເພາະຊອບແວທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຄວາມເຊື່ອຖືເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-almalinux.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Trusting a GPG key is important for security on clients.  It is the task of "
"the adminstrator to decide which keys are needed and can be trusted.  "
"Because a software channel cannot be used when the GPG key is not trusted, "
"the decision of assigning a channel to a client depends on the decision of "
"trusting the key."
msgstr "ການໃຫ້ຄວາມເຊື່ອຖື GPG key ແມ່ນສຳຄັນຕໍ່ຄວາມປອດໄພ. ມັນເປັນໜ້າທີ່ຂອງຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບທີ່ຈະຕັດສິນໃຈວ່າ key ໃດທີ່ຈຳເປັນ ແລະ ເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-almalinux.adoc:31
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-amazon.adoc:30
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:31
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:27
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-oes.adoc:23
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-opensuseleap.adoc:21
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-oracle.adoc:30
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:27
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:125
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:74
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rocky.adoc:30
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sle.adoc:29
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:47
msgid ""
"For more information about GPG keys, see "
"xref:client-configuration:gpg-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ GPG keys, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:gpg-keys.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
