#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:39
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rocky.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage Errata"
msgstr "ຈັດການ Errata"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-almalinux.adoc:34
msgid ""
"When you update {almalinux} clients, the packages include metadata about the "
"updates."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານອັບເດດ client {almalinux}, package ຈະລວມມີ metadata ກ່ຽວກັບການອັບເດດນັ້ນ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-amazon.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registering {amazon} Clients"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນ Client {amazon}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-amazon.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section contains information about registering clients running {amazon} "
"operating systems."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການລົງທະບຽນ client ທີ່ລັນລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ {amazon}."

#.  Use list format: repository URLs / packages and metadata / version info
#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-amazon.adoc:3
msgid "{amazon} repository URLs are available from {scclongform}."
msgstr "URL ຂອງ repository {amazon} ແມ່ນມີໃຫ້ຈາກ {scclongform}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-amazon.adoc:4
msgid "Packages and metadata are provided by Amazon, not by {suse}."
msgstr "Package ແລະ metadata ແມ່ນສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍ Amazon, ບໍ່ແມ່ນໂດຍ {suse}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-amazon.adoc:5
msgid ""
"For supported products, see the release notes and the support table at "
"xref:client-configuration:supported-features-amazon.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ຮອງຮັບ, ເບິ່ງບັນທຶກການປ່ອຍ ແລະ ຕາຕະລາງການຮອງຮັບໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:supported-features-amazon.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-amazon.adoc:6
msgid ""
"When created at {aws}, {amazon} 2 instances always have the same "
"`machine-id` id at `/etc/machine-id`.  If you are creating {amazon} 2 "
"instances, make sure you regenerate the `machine-id` after the instances are "
"created.  For more information, see "
"xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອສ້າງຢູ່ {aws}, instance ຂອງ {amazon} 2 ຈະມີ `machine-id` ດຽວກັນສະເໝີ. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ສ້າງ `machine-id` ໃໝ່ຫຼັງຈາກສ້າງ instance."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-amazon.adoc:7
msgid "{amazon} 2023 is not affected by this."
msgstr "{amazon} 2023 ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກບັນຫານີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-amazon.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Before you register {amazon} clients to your {productname} Server, you need "
"to add the required software channels, and synchronize them."
msgstr "ກ່ອນລົງທະບຽນ client {amazon}, ທ່ານຕ້ອງເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວທີ່ຕ້ອງການ ແລະ ຊິງໂຄຣໄນພວກມັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-amazon.adoc:10
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:11
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-openeuler.adoc:6
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-oracle.adoc:10
msgid ""
"The architectures currently supported are: `x86_64` and `aarch64`.  For full "
"list of supported products and architectures, see "
"xref:client-configuration:supported-features.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳທີ່ຮອງຮັບຄື: `x86_64` ແລະ `aarch64`."

