"patches at your {amazon} instances."
msgstr "ສຳລັບ {amazon} 2023, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງ `amazonlinux2023-kernel-livepatch` ຖ້າຈະໃຊ້ Kernel Live patches."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-amazon.adoc:25
