#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sle.adoc:28
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:46
msgid ""
"Trusting a GPG key is important for security on clients.  It is the task of "
"the administrator to decide which keys are needed and can be trusted.  "
"Because a software channel cannot be used when the GPG key is not trusted, "
"the decision of assigning a channel to a client depends on the decision of "
"trusting the key."
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອຖື GPG key ແມ່ນສຳຄັນຕໍ່ຄວາມປອດໄພ. ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຕ້ອງຕັດສິນໃຈວ່າ key ໃດທີ່ຄວນເຊື່ອຖື."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registering {centos} Clients"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນ Client {centos}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section contains information about registering clients running {centos} "
"operating systems."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການລົງທະບຽນ client ທີ່ລັນລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ {centos}."

#.  Use list format: repository URLs / packages and metadata / version info
#.  Do we need to provide special info for uyuni users?
#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:3
msgid "{centos} repository URLs are available from {scclongform}."
msgstr "URL ຂອງ repository {centos} ແມ່ນມີໃຫ້ຈາກ {scclongform}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:4
msgid "Packages and metadata are provided by CentOS, not by {suse}."
msgstr "Package ແລະ metadata ແມ່ນສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍ CentOS, ບໍ່ແມ່ນໂດຍ {suse}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:5
msgid ""
"For supported products, see the release notes and the support table at "
"xref:client-configuration:supported-features-centos.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ຮອງຮັບໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:supported-features-centos.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:6
msgid ""
"{centos} clients are based on {centos} and are unrelated to {sleses}, RES, "
"{redhat}, or {es}."
msgstr "client {centos} ແມ່ນອີງໃສ່ {centos} ແລະ ບໍ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ {sleses}, RES, {redhat}, ຫຼື {es}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:7
msgid ""
"You are responsible for arranging access to {centos} base media repositories "
"and {centos} installation media, as well as connecting {productname} Server "
"to the {centos} content delivery network."
msgstr "ທ່ານມີໜ້າທີ່ຮັບຜິດຊອບໃນການຈັດການການເຂົ້າເຖິງ repository ຫຼັກຂອງ {centos} ແລະ ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ {productname} Server ເຂົ້າກັບເຄືອຂ່າຍເນື້ອຫາຂອງ {centos}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Registering {centos} clients to {productname} is tested with the default "
"SELinux configuration of ``enforcing`` with a ``targeted`` policy.  You do "
"not need to disable SELinux to register {centos} clients to {productname}."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Before you can register {centos} clients to your {productname} Server, you "
"need to add the required software channels, and synchronize them."
msgstr "ກ່ອນລົງທະບຽນ client {centos}, ທ່ານຕ້ອງເພີ່ມ ແລະ ຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#. The products you need for this procedure are:
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:12
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-oracle.adoc:11
msgid ""
"For example, when working with `x86_64` architecture, you need this "
"products:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, ສຳລັບສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ `x86_64`, ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຜະລິດຕະພັນເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "CentOS Products - WebUI"
msgstr "ຜະລິດຕະພັນ CentOS - WebUI"

#. type: Table
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| OS Version | Product Name\n"
"| {centos} 7 | CentOS 7 x86_64\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"| ເວີຊັນ OS | ຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນ\n"
"| {centos} 7 | CentOS 7 x86_64\n"
"\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:16
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "CentOS Channels - CLI"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງ CentOS - CLI"

#. type: Table
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| OS Version | Base Channel\n"
"| {centos} 7 | centos7-x86_64\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"| ເວີຊັນ OS | ຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ\n"
"| {centos} 7 | centos7-x86_64\n"
"\n"

#. type: Table
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| OS Version | Base Channel | Client Channel       | Updates/Appstream "
"Channel\n"
"| {centos} 7 | centos7      | centos7-uyuni-client | centos7-updates\n"
msgstr ""
"| ເວີຊັນ OS | ຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ | ຊ່ອງທາງ Client | ຊ່ອງທາງ Updates/Appstream\n"
"| {centos} 7 | centos7 | centos7-uyuni-client | centos7-updates\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:22
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-oracle.adoc:22
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:78
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:33
msgid ""
"If you are using modular channels, you must enable the Python 3.6 module "
"stream on the client.  If you do not provide Python 3.6, the installation of "
"the [package]``spacecmd`` package will fail."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:23
msgid ""
"You might notice some disparity in the number of packages available in the "
"AppStream channel between upstream and the {productname} channel.  You might "
"also see different numbers if you compare the same channel added at a "
"different point in time.  This is due to the way that {centos} manages their "
"repositories.  {centos} removes older version of packages when a new version "
"is released, while {productname} keeps all of them, regardless of age."
msgstr "{productname} ຈະເກັບຮັກສາທຸກເວີຊັນຂອງ package ໄວ້ ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເກົ່າສຳໃດກໍຕາມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:26
msgid ""
"You need to create an activation key that is associated with your {centos} "
"channels."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງ activation key ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຊ່ອງທາງ {centos} ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:33
msgid ""
"CentOS 7 will fail to onboard due to the fact that the "
"[path]``/etc/yum.repos.d/CentOS-Base.repo`` has URLs enabled, and thus "
"causing [command]``yum`` to attempt to find the repositories using "
"fastmirror.  This will cause the bootstrap to fail with the error message:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Could not resolve host: mirrorlist.centos.org; Unknown error\n"
msgstr "Could not resolve host: mirrorlist.centos.org; Unknown error\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:35
msgid ""
"To avoid the issue you can remove the [path]``CentOS-Base.repo`` file with "
"the command:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "rm -f /etc/yum.repos.d/CentOS-Base.repo\n"
msgstr "rm -f /etc/yum.repos.d/CentOS-Base.repo\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:37
msgid ""
"Or, if the file needs to remain, you can add [literal]``enabled=0`` to each "
"of the URL sections."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:38
msgid "In either case, then rebootstrap."
msgstr "ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເລືອກວິທີໃດ, ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນໃຫ້ເຮັດ rebootstrap ໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:40
msgid ""
"This section is only applicable to non-containerized Uyuni and it will be "
"removed after {centos} 7 will go end-of-life."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະກັບ Uyuni ແບບບໍ່ແມ່ນ container ແລະ ຈະຖືກລຶບອອກຫຼັງຈາກ {centos} 7 ໝົດອາຍຸການໃຊ້ງານ (EOL)."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:41
msgid ""
"When you update {centos} clients, the packages do not include metadata about "
"the updates.  You can use a third-party errata service to obtain this "
"information."
msgstr "ເມື່ອອັບເດດ client {centos}, package ຈະບໍ່ມີ metadata ກ່ຽວກັບການອັບເດດ. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ບໍລິການ errata ຈາກພາຍນອກເພື່ອດຶງຂໍ້ມູນນີ້."

#
#
#.  ifeval::[{suma-content} == true]
#.  The third-party errata service described here, CEFS, is provided and maintained by the community.
#.  It is not supported by {suse}.
#.  endif::[]
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:42
msgid ""
"The authors of CEFS provide patches or errata on a best-effort basis, in the "
"hope they are useful but with no guarantees of correctness or currency.  "
"This could mean that the patch dates could be incorrect, and in at least one "
"case, the published data was shown to be more than a month old.  For more "
"information on these cases, see "
"https://github.com/stevemeier/cefs/issues/28#issuecomment-656579382 and "
"https://github.com/stevemeier/cefs/issues/28#issuecomment-656573607."
msgstr "ຜູ້ຂຽນ CEFS ສະໜອງ patch ຕາມຄວາມສາມາດ ໂດຍບໍ່ມີການຮັບປະກັນຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:43
msgid ""
"Any problems or delays with the patch data might result in unreliable patch "
"information being imported to your {productname} Server.  This would cause "
"reports, audits, CVE updates, or other patch-related information to also be "
"incorrect.  Please consider alternatives to using this service, such as "
"independently verifying patch data, or choosing a different operating "
"system, depending on your security-related requirements and certifications "
"criteria."
msgstr "ບັນຫາໃດໜຶ່ງກັບຂໍ້ມູນ patch ອາດສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນໃນ {productname} Server ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing an Errata Service"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງບໍລິການ Errata"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:45
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, from the command prompt, as root, add the "
"``sle-module-development-tools`` module:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "SUSEConnect --product sle-module-development-tools/15.2/x86_64\n"
msgstr "SUSEConnect --product sle-module-development-tools/15.2/x86_64\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:47
msgid "Install errata service dependencies:"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ dependency ຂອງບໍລິການ errata:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:48
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in  perl-Text-Unidecode\n"
msgstr "zypper in  perl-Text-Unidecode\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:49
msgid "Add or edit this line in [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"java.allow_adding_patches_via_api = "
"centos7-x86_64-updates,centos7-x86_64,centos7-x86_64-extras\n"
msgstr "java.allow_adding_patches_via_api = centos7-x86_64-updates,centos7-x86_64,centos7-x86_64-extras\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:51
msgid "Restart Tomcat:"
msgstr "ຣີສະຕາດ Tomcat:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl restart tomcat\n"
msgstr "systemctl restart tomcat\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:53
msgid "Create a file for your errata script:"
msgstr "ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ສຳລັບ errata script ຂອງທ່ານ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "touch /usr/local/bin/cent-errata.sh\n"
msgstr "touch /usr/local/bin/cent-errata.sh\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:55
msgid ""
"Edit the new file to include this script, editing the repository details as "
"required."
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ໃໝ່ເພື່ອໃສ່ script ນີ້, ພ້ອມແກ້ໄຂລາຍລະອຽດ repository ຕາມຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:56
msgid ""
"This script fetches the errata details from an external errata service, "
"unpacks it, and publishes the details:"
msgstr "script ນີ້ຈະດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ errata ຈາກບໍລິການພາຍນອກ, ແຕກໄຟລ໌ອອກ ແລະ ເຜີຍແຜ່ລາຍລະອຽດ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"#!/bin/bash\n"
"mkdir -p /usr/local/centos\n"
"cd /usr/local/centos\n"
"rm *.xml\n"
"wget -c http://cefs.steve-meier.de/errata.latest.xml\n"
"wget -c "
"https://www.redhat.com/security/data/oval/v2/RHEL7/rhel-7.oval.xml.bz2\n"
"bzip2 -d rhel-7.oval.xml.bz2\n"
"wget -c http://cefs.steve-meier.de/errata-import.tar\n"
"tar xvf errata-import.tar\n"
"chmod +x /usr/local/centos/errata-import.pl\n"
"export SPACEWALK_USER='<adminname>';export SPACEWALK_PASS='<password>'\n"
"/usr/local/centos/errata-import.pl --server '<servername>' \\\n"
"--errata /usr/local/centos/errata.latest.xml  \\\n"
"--include-channels=centos7-x86_64-updates,centos7-x86_64,centos7-x86_64-extras "
"\\\n"
"--publish --rhsa-oval /usr/local/centos/rhel-7.oval.xml\n"
msgstr ""
"#!/bin/bash\n"
"mkdir -p /usr/local/centos\n"
"cd /usr/local/centos\n"
"rm *.xml\n"
"wget -c http://cefs.steve-meier.de/errata.latest.xml\n"
"wget -c https://www.redhat.com/security/data/oval/v2/RHEL7/rhel-7.oval.xml.bz2\n"
"bzip2 -d rhel-7.oval.xml.bz2\n"
"wget -c http://cefs.steve-meier.de/errata-import.tar\n"
"tar xvf errata-import.tar\n"
"chmod +x /usr/local/centos/errata-import.pl\n"
"export SPACEWALK_USER='<adminname>';export SPACEWALK_PASS='<password>'\n"
"/usr/local/centos/errata-import.pl --server '<servername>' \\\n"
"--errata /usr/local/centos/errata.latest.xml  \\\n"
"--include-channels=centos7-x86_64-updates,centos7-x86_64,centos7-x86_64-extras \\\n"
"--publish --rhsa-oval /usr/local/centos/rhel-7.oval.xml\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:58
msgid "Set up a cron job to run the script daily:"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ cron job ເພື່ອລັນ script ນີ້ເປັນປະຈຳທຸກມື້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "ln -s /usr/local/bin/cent-errata.sh /etc/cron.daily\n"
msgstr "ln -s /usr/local/bin/cent-errata.sh /etc/cron.daily\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-centos.adoc:60
msgid "For more information on this tool, see https://cefs.steve-meier.de/."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບເຄື່ອງມືນີ້, ເບິ່ງ https://cefs.steve-meier.de/."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registering {debian} Clients"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນ Client {debian}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section contains information about registering clients running {debian} "
"operating systems."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການລົງທະບຽນ client ທີ່ລັນລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ {debian}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Bootstrapping can be used with {debian} clients for performing initial state "
"runs, and for profile updates."
msgstr "ສາມາດໃຊ້ Bootstrapping ກັບ client {debian} ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ອັບເດດ profile."

#.  Use list format: repository URLs / packages and metadata / version info
#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:4
msgid "{debian} repository URLs are available from {scclongform}."
msgstr "URL ຂອງ repository {debian} ແມ່ນມີໃຫ້ຈາກ {scclongform}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:5
msgid "Packages and metadata are provided by Debian, not by {suse}."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:6
msgid ""
"For supported products, see the release notes and the support table at "
"xref:client-configuration:supported-features-debian.adoc[]."
