#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Some preparation is required before you can register {debian} clients to the "
"{productname} Server:"
msgstr "ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີການກຽມຕົວບາງຢ່າງກ່ອນລົງທະບຽນ client {debian}:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:9
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Ensure DNS is correctly configured and provides an entry for the client.  "
"Alternatively, you can configure the ``/etc/hosts`` files on both the "
"{productname} Server and the client with the appropriate entries."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:10
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:10
msgid ""
"The client must have the date and time synchronized with the {productname} "
"Server before registration."
msgstr "client ຕ້ອງມີການຊິງໂຄຣໄນວັນທີ ແລະ ເວລາກັບ {productname} Server ກ່ອນການລົງທະບຽນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Before you can register {debian} clients to your {productname} Server, you "
"need to add the required software channels, and synchronize them."
msgstr "ກ່ອນລົງທະບຽນ client {debian}, ທ່ານຕ້ອງເພີ່ມ ແລະ ຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

