msgid ""
"{debian} channels can be very large.  Synchronization can sometimes take "
"several hours."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງ {debian} ອາດມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຫຼາຍ. ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນອາດໃຊ້ເວລາຫຼາຍຊົ່ວໂມງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:28
msgid "{debian} clients can require multiple GPG keys to be installed."
msgstr "client {debian} ອາດຈະຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງ GPG keys ຫຼາຍອັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:29
msgid ""
"When synchronizing third-party {debian} repositories, you will need to "
"import the appropriate GPG key on the server.  If the GPG key is missing, "
"synchronization will fail."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຊິງໂຄຣໄນ repository ຂອງພາຍນອກ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງນຳເຂົ້າ GPG key ທີ່ເໝາະສົມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:30
msgid ""
"For {debian} repositories, only the metadata is signed. Therefore importing "
"a GPG key for the software channel is not needed.  Packages will not be "
"re-signed by Uyuni."
msgstr "ສຳລັບ repository ຂອງ {debian}, ມີພຽງ metadata ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຖືກເຊັນ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງນຳເຂົ້າ GPG key ສຳລັບຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:31
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:31
msgid ""
"To see which GPG keys are already imported to {productname} Server, run the "
"following command:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເບິ່ງວ່າ GPG keys ໃດແດ່ທີ່ຖືກນຳເຂົ້າ {productname} Server ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:32
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -- gpg --homedir /var/lib/spacewalk/gpgdir --list-keys\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -- gpg --homedir /var/lib/spacewalk/gpgdir --list-keys\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:33
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:33
msgid "To import a new GPG key, run the following command:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອຮຳເຂົ້າ GPG key ໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:34
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm gpg add <filename>.gpg\n"
msgstr "mgradm gpg add <filename>.gpg\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:35
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:35
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:48
#, no-wrap
msgid "Root Access"
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າເຖິງ Root"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:36
msgid "The root user on {debian} is disabled by default for SSH access."
msgstr "ຕາມຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, root user ເທິງ {debian} ຈະຖືກປິດການເຂົ້າເຖິງຜ່ານ SSH."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:37
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:37
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:50
msgid ""
"To be able to onboard using a regular user, you need to edit the "
"[filename]``sudoers`` file."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:38
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:38
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:53
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Granting Root User Access"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການໃຫ້ສິດເຂົ້າເຖິງ Root User"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:39
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:39
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:54
msgid "On the client, edit the [filename]``sudoers`` file:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:40
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:40
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:55
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh-tunnel.adoc:16
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo visudo\n"
msgstr "sudo visudo\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:41
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:41
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:56
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh-tunnel.adoc:17
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Grant [command]``sudo`` access to the user by adding this line at the end of "
"the [filename]``sudoers`` file.  Replace [systemitem]``<user>`` with the "
"name of the user that is bootstrapping the client in the {webui}:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:42
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:42
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<user>  ALL=NOPASSWD: /usr/bin/python, /usr/bin/python2, /usr/bin/python3, "
"/var/tmp/venv-salt-minion/bin/python\n"
msgstr "<user>  ALL=NOPASSWD: /usr/bin/python, /usr/bin/python2, /usr/bin/python3, /var/tmp/venv-salt-minion/bin/python\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-debian.adoc:43
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:43
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:58
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh-tunnel.adoc:19
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:37
msgid ""
"This procedure grants root access without requiring a password, which is "
"required for registering the client.  When the client is successfully "
"installed it runs with root privileges, so the access is no longer "
"required.  We recommend that you remove the line from the [path]``sudoers`` "
"file after the client has been successfully installed."
msgstr ""

