#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-opensuseleapmicro.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registering {leapmicro} Clients"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນ Client {leapmicro}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-opensuseleapmicro.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section contains information about registering clients running "
"{leapmicro} operating systems on {x86_64} and {aarch64} architectures."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການລົງທະບຽນ client {leapmicro}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-opensuseleapmicro.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The {leapmicro} is an ultra-reliable, lightweight operating system purpose "
"built for edge computing.  It leverages the enterprise hardened security and "
"compliance components of SUSE Linux Enterprise and merges them with a "
"modern, immutable, developer-friendly OS platform."
msgstr "{leapmicro} ແມ່ນລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ມີນ້ຳໜັກເບົາ ແລະ ມີຄວາມໜ້າເຊື່ອຖືສູງ ອອກແບບມາສຳລັບ edge computing."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-opensuseleapmicro.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The {leapmicro} uses transactional updates.  Transactional updates are "
"atomic (all updates are applied only if all updates succeed) and support "
"rollbacks.  They do not affect the running system because no changes are "
"activated until the system is rebooted.  This information is displayed in "
"the menu:Systems[Details > Overview] subtab."
msgstr "{leapmicro} ໃຊ້ transactional updates ເຊິ່ງເປັນແບບ atomic ແລະ ຮອງຮັບ rollbacks."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-opensuseleapmicro.adoc:5
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slemicro.adoc:4
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slmicro.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For more information on transactional updates and rebooting, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sles/html/SLES-all/cha-transactional-updates.html."
msgstr ""

