#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-opensuseleapmicro.adoc:16
msgid "{leapmicro} clients require reboot after registering."
msgstr "client {leapmicro} ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຣີບູດຫຼັງຈາກການລົງທະບຽນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-opensuseleapmicro.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Following the bootstrapping process, automatic booting is disabled on "
"{leapmicro}. This change was implemented due to intermittent automatic "
"reboots, which could occurr before Salt could relay the results of applying "
"the bootstrap salt state."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-opensuseleapmicro.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Reboot is automatically scheduled after registration is completed, but it is "
"respecting the default reboot manager maintenance window.  This window may "
"be several hours after the client is registered.  To speed up {leapmicro} "
"registration, manually reboot the client after the registration script "
"finishes."
msgstr "ການຣີບູດຈະຖືກກຳນົດເວລາໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຫຼັງຈາກລົງທະບຽນສຳເລັດ. ເພື່ອຄວາມໄວ, ທ່ານສາມາດຣີບູດເຄື່ອງເອງໄດ້ຫຼັງຈາກ script ການລົງທະບຽນເຮັດວຽກສຳເລັດ."

