"https://docs.oracle.com/en/operating-systems/oracle-linux/software-management/sfw-mgmt-UseSoftwareDistributionMirrors.html#local-uln-mirror."
msgstr "ໃນປັດຈຸບັນຍັງບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ ULN ໂດຍກົງ. ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ Oracle Local Distribution ສຳລັບ ULN ແທນ."

