#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registering Clients on a Public Cloud"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນ Client ເທິງ Public Cloud"

#.  2024-04-04 OM: It had been decided in the conversation with the SUMA PO 
#.  that this Public Cloud related file can stay in the Uyuni books
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:2
msgid ""
"When you have your {productname} Server set up, you are ready to start "
"registering clients."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} Server ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານກໍພ້ອມທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມລົງທະບຽນ client ໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add Products and Synchronize Repositories"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຜະລິດຕະພັນ ແລະ ຊິງໂຄຣໄນ Repositories"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Ensure you have already added the corresponding products for your clients "
"and synced the repositories to {productname}.  This is required to create "
"the bootstrap repositories used for registering clients."
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ເພີ່ມຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ກົງກັນ ແລະ ຊິງໂຄຣໄນ repository ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:5
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:public-cloud-guide/overview.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:public-cloud-guide/overview.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare On-demand Images"
msgstr "ກຽມ On-demand Images"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:7
msgid ""
"An instance started from an on-demand image provided by {suse} is "
"automatically registered, and the update infrastructure and {sle} modules "
"are activated.  To use your on-demand image as a {productname} client, you "
"need to disable this automation before you begin."
msgstr "image ແບບ on-demand ຈາກ {suse} ຈະລົງທະບຽນອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ເພື່ອໃຊ້ເປັນ client ຂອງ {productname}, ທ່ານຕ້ອງປິດການເຮັດວຽກນີ້ກ່ອນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Preparing On-demand Images"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຽມ On-demand Images"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:9
msgid "Log in to the on-demand instance."
msgstr "ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ on-demand instance."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:10
msgid ""
"At the command prompt, as root, remove the registration data and "
"repositories:"
msgstr "ຢູ່ທີ່ command prompt, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ລຶບຂໍ້ມູນການລົງທະບຽນ ແລະ repository:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "registercloudguest --clean\n"
msgstr "registercloudguest --clean\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:12
msgid "Remove the trigger service for automatic registration:"
msgstr "ລຶບ trigger service ສຳລັບການລົງທະບຽນອັດຕະໂນມັດ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl disable guestregister.service\n"
msgstr "systemctl disable guestregister.service\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:14
msgid ""
"in Microsoft Azure, there is an additional service that needs to be "
"disabled:"
msgstr "ໃນ Microsoft Azure, ມີ service ເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ຕ້ອງປິດໃຊ້ງານ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl disable regionsrv-enabler-azure.timer\n"
msgstr "systemctl disable regionsrv-enabler-azure.timer\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:17
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Bootstrapping], then "
"fill in the ``Host``, ``SSH Port``, ``User``, and ``Password`` fields.  Make "
"sure you use stable FQDNs for the ``Host`` field, or {productname} cannot "
"find your host when your Public Cloud gives you a different short-lived "
"FQDNS."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Public cloud images usually do not allow SSH login with username and "
"password, but only SSH with a certificate.  If you want to use bootstrap "
"from the {webui}, you need to enable SSH login with username and SSH key.  "
"You can do this by navigating to menu:Systems[Bootstrapping] and changing "
"the authentication method."
msgstr "image ເທິງ public cloud ສ່ວນຫຼາຍບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ SSH ດ້ວຍລະຫັດຜ່ານ. ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງປ່ຽນວິທີການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:19
msgid ""
"If your cloud provider is Microsoft Azure, you can log in with username and "
"password.  To do this, you need to allow the AzureUser to run commands as "
"root without a password.  To do this, open the "
"[path]``/etc/sudoers.d/waagent`` file, and add or edit this line:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "AzureUser ALL=(ALL) NOPASSWD: ALL\n"
msgstr "AzureUser ALL=(ALL) NOPASSWD: ALL\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Allowing the AzureUser to run commands as root without a password carries a "
"security risk.  Use this method for testing only.  Do not do this for "
"production systems."
msgstr "ການອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ AzureUser ລັນ root ໂດຍບໍ່ມີລະຫັດຜ່ານມີຄວາມສ່ຽງດ້ານຄວາມປອດໄພ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ວິທີນີ້ເພື່ອການທົດສອບເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:22
msgid ""
"When the bootstrap process has completed successfully, your client is listed "
"at menu:Systems[System List]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຂັ້ນຕອນ bootstrap ສຳເລັດ, client ຂອງທ່ານຈະປະກົດຢູ່ໃນ menu:Systems[System List]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:23
msgid ""
"If you want more control over the process or have to register many clients, "
"create a bootstrap script.  For more information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຄວບຄຸມຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ ຫຼື ຕ້ອງການລົງທະບຽນ client ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ, ໃຫ້ສ້າງ bootstrap script."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:24
msgid ""
"For Salt clients and even more control over the process, executing single "
"commands on the command line can be useful.  For more information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-cli.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບ Salt clients, ການໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງຜ່ານ command line ຈະມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:25
msgid ""
"When registering clients launched from a public cloud image (for example, "
"AWS AMI), you need to do some additional configuration to prevent them from "
"over-writing each other.  For more information about registering clones, see "
"xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອລົງທະບຽນ client ຈາກ public cloud image, ທ່ານຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າເພີ່ມເຕີມເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນຂຽນທັບກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-pubcloud.adoc:28
msgid ""
"For more on activation keys, see "
"xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ activation keys, ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registering {raspberrypios} Clients"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນ Client {raspberrypios}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section contains information about registering clients running "
"{raspberrypios} operating systems."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການລົງທະບຽນ client {raspberrypios}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Bootstrapping can be used with {raspberrypios} clients for performing "
"initial state runs, and for profile updates."
msgstr "ສາມາດໃຊ້ Bootstrapping ກັບ client {raspberrypios} ໄດ້."

#.  Use list format: repository URLs / packages and metadata / version info
#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:4
msgid "{raspberrypios} repository URLs are available from {scclongform}"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:5
msgid "Packages and metadata are provided by Raspberry Pi OS, not by {suse}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Some preparation is required before you can register {raspberrypios} clients "
"to the {productname} Server:"
msgstr "ຕ້ອງມີການກຽມຕົວບາງຢ່າງກ່ອນລົງທະບຽນ client {raspberrypios}:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Before you register {raspberrypios} clients to your {productname} Server, "
"you need to add the required software channels, and synchronize them."
msgstr "ກ່ອນລົງທະບຽນ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງເພີ່ມ ແລະ ຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:13
msgid ""
"The architectures currently supported are: {arm64} and {armhf}.  For full "
"list of supported products and architectures, see "
"xref:client-configuration:supported-features.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Raspberry Pi OS Channels - CLI"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງ Raspberry Pi OS - CLI"

