#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:18
msgid ""
"You need all the new channels fully synchronized before bootstrapping any "
"{raspberrypios} client."
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງຊິງໂຄຣໄນທຸກຊ່ອງທາງໃໝ່ໃຫ້ສຳເລັດກ່ອນເຮັດ bootstrap."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:20
msgid ""
"{raspberrypios} channels can be very large.  Synchronization can sometimes "
"take several hours."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງ {raspberrypios} ອາດມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຫຼາຍ. ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນອາດໃຊ້ເວລາຫຼາຍຊົ່ວໂມງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:22
msgid ""
"You need to create an activation key that is associated with your "
"{raspberrypios} channels."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງ activation key ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຊ່ອງທາງ {raspberrypios} ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:28
msgid "{raspberrypios} clients can require multiple GPG keys to be installed."
msgstr "client {raspberrypios} ອາດຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງ GPG keys ຫຼາຍອັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:29
msgid ""
"When synchronizing third-party {raspberrypios} repositories, you will need "
"to import the appropriate GPG key on the server.  If the GPG key is missing, "
"synchronization will fail."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຊິງໂຄຣໄນ repository ພາຍນອກ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງນຳເຂົ້າ GPG key ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:30
msgid ""
"For {raspberrypios} repositories, only the metadata is signed.  Therefore "
"importing a GPG key for the software channel is not needed.  Packages will "
"not be re-signed by {productname}."
msgstr "ສຳລັບ repository ຂອງ {raspberrypios}, ມີພຽງ metadata ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຖືກເຊັນ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງນຳເຂົ້າ GPG key ສຳລັບຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-raspberrypios.adoc:36
msgid "The root user on {raspberrypios} is disabled by default for SSH access."
msgstr "Root user ເທິງ {raspberrypios} ຖືກປິດການເຂົ້າເຖິງຜ່ານ SSH ຕາມຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registering {rhel} Clients with CDN"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນ Client {rhel} ດ້ວຍ CDN"

#.  SUSE Liberty Linux not available at Uyuni for now
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you are running {rhel} clients directly, rather than using {sleses}, you "
"need to use {redhat} sources to retrieve and update packages."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານລັນ client {rhel} ໂດຍກົງ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງໃຊ້ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຈາກ {redhat} ເພື່ອອັບເດດ package."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:3
msgid ""
"This section contains information about using the {redhat} content delivery "
"network (CDN) to register clients running {rhel} operating systems."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ {redhat} CDN ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນ client {rhel}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:4
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:17
msgid ""
"For information about using {redhat} update infrastructure (RHUI) instead, "
"see xref:client-configuration:clients-rh-rhui.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການໃຊ້ RHUI ແທນ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:clients-rh-rhui.adoc[]."

#.  SUSE Liberty Linux not available at Uyuni for now
#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:5
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:6
msgid ""
"{rhel} clients are based on {redhat} and are unrelated to {sleses}, RES, or "
"{sles}."
msgstr "client {rhel} ແມ່ນອີງໃສ່ {redhat} ແລະ ບໍ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ {sleses}, RES, ຫຼື {sles}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:6
msgid ""
"You are responsible for arranging access to {redhat} base media repositories "
"and {rhela} installation media, as well as connecting {productname} Server "
"to the {redhat} content delivery network.  You must obtain support from "
"{redhat} for all your {rhela} systems.  If you do not do this, you might be "
"violating your terms with {redhat}."
msgstr "ທ່ານມີໜ້າທີ່ຮັບຜິດຊອບໃນການຈັດການການເຂົ້າເຖິງ repository ຂອງ {redhat}."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Import Entitlements and Certificates"
msgstr "ນຳເຂົ້າ Entitlements ແລະ ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ (Certificates)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:8
msgid ""
"{redhat} clients require a {redhat} certificate authority (CA) and "
"entitlement certificate, and an entitlement key."
msgstr "client {redhat} ຕ້ອງການ {redhat} CA, entitlement certificate, ແລະ entitlement key."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:9
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Entitlement certificates are embedded with expiration dates, which match the "
"length of the support subscription.  To avoid disruption, you need to repeat "
"this process at the end of every support subscription period."
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ entitlement ມີວັນໝົດອາຍຸ. ທ່ານຕ້ອງເຮັດຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ໃໝ່ເມື່ອໝົດອາຍຸ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:10
msgid ""
"{redhat} supplies a subscription manager tool to manage subscription "
"assignments.  It runs locally to track installed products and "
"subscriptions.  Clients must be registered with the subscription manager to "
"obtain certificates."
msgstr "{redhat} ມີເຄື່ອງມື subscription manager ເພື່ອຈັດການການສະໝັກໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:11
msgid ""
"{redhat} clients use a URL to replicate repositories.  The URL changes "
"depending on where the {redhat} client is registered."
msgstr "client {redhat} ໃຊ້ URL ເພື່ອຄັດລອກ repository. URL ຈະປ່ຽນແປງຕາມບ່ອນທີ່ລົງທະບຽນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:12
msgid "{redhat} clients can be registered in three different ways:"
msgstr "client {redhat} ສາມາດລົງທະບຽນໄດ້ໃນ 3 ວິທີ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:13
msgid "{redhat} content delivery network (CDN) at redhat.com"
msgstr "{redhat} content delivery network (CDN) ທີ່ redhat.com"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:14
msgid "{redhat} Satellite Server"
msgstr "{redhat} Satellite Server"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:15
msgid "{redhat} update infrastructure (RHUI) in the cloud"
msgstr "{redhat} update infrastructure (RHUI) ເທິງ cloud"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:16
msgid ""
"This guide covers clients registered to {redhat} CDN.  You must have at "
"least one system registered to the CDN, with an authorized subscription for "
"repository content."
msgstr "ຄູ່ມືນີ້ກວມເອົາ client ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນກັບ {redhat} CDN."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:18
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Satellite certificates for client systems require a Satellite server and "
"subscription.  Clients using Satellite certificates are not supported with "
"{productname} Server."
msgstr "Satellite certificates ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບກັບ {productname} Server."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:20
msgid ""
"{redhat} supplies the subscription-manager tool to manage subscription "
"assignments.  It runs locally on the client system to track installed "
"products and subscriptions.  Register to redhat.com with "
"subscription-manager, then follow this procedure to obtain certificates."
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນກັບ redhat.com ດ້ວຍ subscription-manager ເພື່ອຂໍໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Registering Clients to Subscription Manager"
