#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:63
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare Custom Repositories and Channels"
msgstr "ກຽມ Custom Repositories ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:64
msgid ""
"To mirror the software from the {redhat} CDN, you need to create custom "
"channels and repositories in {productname} that are linked to the CDN by a "
"URL.  You must have entitlements to these products in your {redhat} Portal "
"for this to work correctly.  You can use the subscription manager tool to "
"get the URLs of the repositories you want to mirror:"
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງສ້າງ custom channels ແລະ repositories ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ CDN ຜ່ານ URL."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "subscription-manager repos\n"
msgstr "subscription-manager repos\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:66
msgid ""
"You can use these repository URLs to create custom repositories.  This "
"allows you to mirror only the content you need to manage your clients."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ URL ຂອງ repository ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເພື່ອສ້າງ custom repositories."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:67
msgid ""
"You can only create custom versions of {redhat} repositories if you have the "
"correct entitlements in your {redhat} Portal."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງ custom versions ໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອມີສິດ (entitlements) ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໃນ {redhat} Portal."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:68
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:47
