msgid "Click btn:[Confirm]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Confirm]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:114
msgid ""
"If you already have RHEL systems added to {productname}, assign them to the "
"new system group, and then apply the highstate."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານມີລະບົບ RHEL ໃນ {productname} ຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດພວກມັນເຂົ້າໃນກຸ່ມໃໝ່."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:115
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding the System Group to Activation Keys"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເພີ່ມ System Group ເຂົ້າໃນ Activation Keys"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:116
msgid ""
"You need to modify the activation keys you used for RHEL systems to include "
"the system group created above."
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງແກ້ໄຂ activation keys ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບລະບົບ RHEL ເພື່ອລວມເອົາ system group ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນຂ້າງເທິງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:117
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Activation "
"Keys]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} Server {webui}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Activation Keys]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:118
msgid "For each the Activation Keys you used for RHEL systems, click on it and:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະ Activation Key ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ RHEL, ໃຫ້ຄລິກໃສ່ມັນ ແລະ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:119
msgid "Navigate to the [guimenu]``Groups`` tab, and the [guimenu]``Join`` subtab."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:120
msgid "Check [systemitem]``Select rhel-systems``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:121
msgid "Click btn:[Join Selected Groups]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Join Selected Groups]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:126
msgid ""
"For the {redhat} custom channels, if you want to check the [guimenu]``Enable "
"GPG Check`` field, you need to populate the [guimenu]``GPG Key URL`` field.  "
"You can use the file URL of the GPG key stored in the directory "
"[systemitem]``/etc/pki/rpm-gpg`` of the {redhat} minion."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:127
msgid "Example: [systemitem]``file:///etc/pki/rpm-gpg/RPM-GPG-KEY-redhat-release``"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-cdn.adoc:128
msgid ""
"For the complete list of the {redhat} product signing keys, see "
"https://access.redhat.com/security/team/key."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລາຍຊື່ທັງໝົດຂອງ key ທີ່ໃຊ້ເຊັນຜະລິດຕະພັນ {redhat}, ເບິ່ງ https://access.redhat.com/security/team/key."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registering {rhel} clients with RHUI"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນ Client {rhel} ດ້ວຍ RHUI"

#.  SUSE Liberty Linux not available at Uyuni for now
#.  2024-04-04 OM: It had been decided in the conversation with the SUMA PO 
#.  that this Public Cloud related file can stay in the Uyuni books
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section contains information about using {redhat} update infrastructure "
"(RHUI) to register clients running {rhel} operating systems."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ RHUI ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນ client {rhel}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:3
msgid ""
"If you are running {rhel} clients directly, rather than using {sleses}, you "
"need to use Red Hat sources to retrieve and update packages."
msgstr "ຖ້າລັນ client {rhel} ໂດຍກົງ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງໃຊ້ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຈາກ Red Hat."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:4
msgid ""
"If you are running clients in a public cloud, such as Amazon EC2, use this "
"method."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານ clients ໃນ public cloud ເຊັ່ນ Amazon EC2, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ວິທີນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:5
msgid ""
"It is possible to use RHUI in conjunction with the {redhat} content delivery "
"network (CDN) to manage your {rhel} subscriptions.  For information about "
"using {redhat} CDN, see xref:client-configuration:clients-rh-cdn.adoc[]."
msgstr "ມັນເປັນໄປໄດ້ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ RHUI ຮ່ວມກັບເຄືອຂ່າຍການຈັດສົ່ງເນື້ອຫາ (CDN) ຂອງ {redhat} ເພື່ອຈັດການການສະໝັກໃຊ້ (subscriptions) {rhel} ຂອງທ່ານ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ {redhat} CDN, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:clients-rh-cdn.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:7
msgid ""
"You are responsible for connecting {productname} Server to the {redhat} "
"update infrastructure.  All clients that get updates using this RHUI "
"certificate need to be correctly licensed, please check with your cloud "
"provider and the {redhat} terms of service for more information."
msgstr "ທ່ານມີໜ້າທີ່ຮັບຜິດຊອບໃນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ {productname} Server ເຂົ້າກັບໂຄງສ້າງພື້ນຖານການອັບເດດຂອງ {redhat}. Clients ທັງໝົດທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບການອັບເດດໂດຍໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ RHUI ນີ້ ຕ້ອງມີໃບອະນຸຍາດ (license) ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ກະລຸນາກວດສອບກັບຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ cloud ຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ເງື່ອນໄຂການໃຫ້ບໍລິການຂອງ {redhat} ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:8
msgid ""
"When {rhel} clients registered with RHUI are switched off, {redhat} might "
"declare the certificate invalid.  In this case, you need to turn the client "
"on again, or get a new RHUI certificate."
msgstr "ເມື່ອ clients {rhel} ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນກັບ RHUI ຖືກປິດໄວ້, {redhat} ອາດຈະປະກາດວ່າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນນັ້ນໃຊ້ການບໍ່ໄດ້. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ນ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເປີດ client ຄືນໃໝ່, ຫຼື ຂໍໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ RHUI ໃໝ່."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Import entitlements and certificates"
msgstr "ນໍາເຂົ້າສິດການໃຊ້ງານ (entitlements) ແລະ ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:10
msgid ""
"In the past it was required to import the certificates and entitlement data "
"manual into {productname} Server.  This task has been automated by using the "
"same mechanism as for SUSE {payg} instances.  For more information, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc[]."
msgstr "ໃນເມື່ອກ່ອນ, ການນໍາເຂົ້າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນສິດການໃຊ້ງານເຂົ້າໃນ {productname} Server ຕ້ອງເຮັດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ວຽກນີ້ໄດ້ຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ເປັນແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍໃຊ້ກົນໄກດຽວກັນກັບ SUSE {payg} instances. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:specialized-guides:public-cloud-guide/payg/payg-overview.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:11
msgid ""
"This guide covers clients registered to {redhat} update infrastructure "
"(RHUI).  You must have at least one system registered to RHUI, with an "
"authorized subscription for repository content."
msgstr "ຄູ່ມືນີ້ກວມເອົາ clients ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນກັບໂຄງສ້າງພື້ນຖານການອັບເດດຂອງ {redhat} (RHUI). ທ່ານຕ້ອງມີຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງລະບົບທີ່ລົງທະບຽນກັບ RHUI ພ້ອມກັບການສະໝັກໃຊ້ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດສຳລັບເນື້ອຫາໃນ repository."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:12
msgid ""
"For information about using {redhat} content delivery network (CDN) instead, "
"see xref:client-configuration:clients-rh-cdn.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ເຄືອຂ່າຍການຈັດສົ່ງເນື້ອຫາ (CDN) ຂອງ {redhat} ແທນ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:clients-rh-cdn.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:14
msgid ""
"The {payg} connection regular checks with the client to get the latest "
"authentication data.  It is important that the client stays running and is "
"regular updated.  If this does not happen, repository synchronization will "
"fail with authentication errors at some point in time."
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ {payg} ຈະກວດສອບກັບ client ເປັນປະຈຳເພື່ອຮັບຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຫຼ້າສຸດ. ມັນເປັນສິ່ງສຳຄັນທີ່ client ຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ສະເໝີ ແລະ ໄດ້ຮັບການອັບເດດເປັນປະຈຳ. ຫາກບໍ່ເປັນເຊັ່ນນັ້ນ, ການຊິງຄ໌ (synchronization) ຂອງ repository ຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວດ້ວຍຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນໃນເວລາໃດໜຶ່ງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:15
msgid "Update any {redhat} 7 instance before connecting it."
msgstr "ອັບເດດ instance ຂອງ {redhat} 7 ໃດໆກໍຕາມກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ມັນ."

#.  mc: this depends on the version of Jsch we use. The current version 0.1.55 only support rsa-ssh auth
#.      which is forbidden with the DEFAULT policy. If we decide to switch to a different implementation
#.      of Jsch (0.2.9 or higher) this limitation is gone and the note can be removed
#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:16
msgid ""
"A {redhat} 9 instance needs to be configured with the crypto policy "
"[literal]``LEGACY`` to be able to connect it.  Execute [command]``sudo "
"update-crypto-policies --set LEGACY`` to configure it accordingly."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Connecting to {redhat} update infrastructure"
msgstr "ກຳລັງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບໂຄງສ້າງພື້ນຖານການອັບເດດຂອງ {redhat}"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Connecting new {redhat} instance"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ instance ໃໝ່ຂອງ {redhat}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:19
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > {payg}], "
"and click btn:[Add {payg}]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > {payg}], ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Add {payg}]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:20
msgid "Start with the page section [guimenu]``{payg} connection Description``."
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຈາກພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``{payg} connection Description``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:21
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Description`` field, add the description."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Description``, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມຄຳອະທິບາຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:22
msgid "Move to the page section [guimenu]``Instance SSH connection data``."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Instance SSH connection data``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:23
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Host`` field, enter the instance DNS or IP address to "
"connect from {productname}."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Host``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ DNS ຫຼື ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຂອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ ເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈາກ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:24
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``SSH Port`` field, enter the port number or use default "
"value 22."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``SSH Port``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນໝາຍເລກພອດ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ 22."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:25
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``User`` field, enter the username as specified in the "
"cloud."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``User``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕາມທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນ Cloud."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:26
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Password`` field, enter the password."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Password``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນລະຫັດຜ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:27
msgid "In the [guimenu]``SSH Private Key`` field, enter the instance key."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``SSH Private Key``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນກະແຈຂອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:28
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``SSH Private Key Passphrase`` field, enter the key "
"passphrase."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``SSH Private Key Passphrase``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນລະຫັດຜ່ານຂອງກະແຈ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:29
msgid "Authentication keys must always be in PEM format."
msgstr "ກະແຈການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ PEM ສະເໝີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:30
msgid ""
"If you are not connecting directly to the instance, but via SSH bastion, "
"proceed with <<proc-adding-ssh-bastion-connection-data>>."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍກົງກັບອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ ແຕ່ຜ່ານ SSH bastion, ໃຫ້ດຳເນີນການຕໍ່ໃນ <<proc-adding-ssh-bastion-connection-data>>."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:31
msgid "Otherwise, continue with <<proc-finishing-rhui-connecting>>."
msgstr "ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ດຳເນີນການຕໍ່ໃນ <<proc-finishing-rhui-connecting>>."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding SSH bastion connection data"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເພີ່ມຂໍ້ມູນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH bastion"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:33
msgid "Navigate to the page section [guimenu]``Bastion SSH connection data``."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ພາກສ່ວນ [guimenu]``Bastion SSH connection data``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:34
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Host`` field, enter the bastion hostname."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Host``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ໂຮສ (hostname) ຂອງ bastion."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:35
msgid "In the [guimenu]``SSH Port`` field, enter the bastion port number."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``SSH Port``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນໝາຍເລກພອດຂອງ bastion."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:36
msgid "In the [guimenu]``User`` field, enter the bastion username."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``User``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂອງ bastion."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:37
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Password`` field, enter the bastion password."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``Password``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນລະຫັດຜ່ານຂອງ bastion."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:38
msgid "In the [guimenu]``SSH Private Key`` field, enter the bastion key."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``SSH Private Key``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນກະແຈຂອງ bastion."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:39
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``SSH Private Key Passphrase`` field, enter the bastion key "
"passphrase."
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງ [guimenu]``SSH Private Key Passphrase``, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນລະຫັດຜ່ານຂອງກະແຈ bastion."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:40
msgid "Complete the setup with <<proc-finishing-rhui-connecting>>."
msgstr "ສຳເລັດການຕັ້ງຄ່າດ້ວຍ <<proc-finishing-rhui-connecting>>."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Finishing {redhat} connecting"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສິ້ນສຸດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ {redhat}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:42
msgid "To complete adding new {redhat} connection data, click btn:[Create]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອສຳເລັດການເພີ່ມຂໍ້ມູນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ {redhat} ໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Create]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:43
msgid "Return to {payg} connection data [guimenu]``Details`` page."
msgstr "ກັບໄປທີ່ໜ້າ [guimenu]``Details`` ຂອງຂໍ້ມູນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ {payg}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:44
msgid ""
"The updated connection status is displayed on the top section named "
"[guimenu]``Information``."
msgstr "ສະຖານະການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ອັບເດດແລ້ວ ຈະສະແດງຢູ່ໃນພາກສ່ວນເທິງສຸດທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ [guimenu]``Information``."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:45
msgid ""
"Connection status is shown in [guimenu]``Admin > Setup Wizard > "
"Pay-as-you-go`` screen, too."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:46
msgid ""
"If the authentication data for the instance is correct, the column "
"[guimenu]``Status`` shows [literal]``Credentials successfully updated.``"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:47
msgid ""
"If invalid data is entered at any point, the newly created instance is shown "
"in [guimenu]``Admin > Setup Wizard > {payg}``, with column "
"[guimenu]``Status`` displaying an error message."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:48
msgid ""
"As soon as the authentication data is available on the server, repositories "
"were added for all available repositories on the connected instance.  The "
"repositories can be seen in [guimenu]``Software > Manage > Repositories``"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:49
msgid ""
"A {redhat} connection will create custom repositories which are owned by "
"organization 1 by default.  If a different organization should own the "
"autogenerated repositories, configure "
"[systemitem]``java.rhui_default_org_id`` in ``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rh-rhui.adoc:50
msgid ""
"This only defines and updates the repositories.  If you want to use a "
"repository for a managed client, you need to specify a Software Channel and "
"connect the repositories to it."
msgstr "ອັນນີ້ເປັນພຽງການກຳນົດ ແລະ ອັບເດດ repositories ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ repository ສຳລັບ client ທີ່ຢູ່ພາຍໃຕ້ການຈັດການ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງລະບຸ Software Channel ແລະ ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ repositories ເຂົ້າກັບມັນ."

