msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນ clients"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rocky.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registering {rocky} Clients"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນ {rocky} Clients"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rocky.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section contains information about registering clients running {rocky} "
"operating systems."
msgstr "ສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການລົງທະບຽນ clients ທີ່ໃຊ້ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ {rocky}."

#.  Use list format: repository URLs / packages and metadata / version info
#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rocky.adoc:3
msgid "{rocky} repository URLs are available from {scclongform}."
msgstr "URL ຂອງ {rocky} repository ແມ່ນມີໃຫ້ຈາກ {scclongform}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rocky.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Packages and metadata are provided by Rocky Enterprise Software Foundation, "
"not by {suse}."
msgstr "Packages ແລະ metadata ແມ່ນສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍ Rocky Enterprise Software Foundation, ບໍ່ແມ່ນໂດຍ {suse}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rocky.adoc:5
msgid ""
"For supported products, see the release notes and the support table at "
"xref:client-configuration:supported-features-rocky.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ຮອງຮັບ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ release notes ແລະ ຕາຕະລາງການຮອງຮັບທີ່ xref:client-configuration:supported-features-rocky.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rocky.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Registering {rocky} clients to {productname} is tested with the default "
"SELinux configuration of ``enforcing`` with a ``targeted`` policy.  You do "
"not need to disable SELinux to register {rocky} clients to {productname}."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rocky.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Before you can register {rocky} clients to your {productname} Server, you "
"need to add the required software channels, and synchronize them."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະສາມາດລົງທະບຽນ {rocky} clients ກັບ {productname} Server ຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເພີ່ມ software channels ທີ່ຕ້ອງການ ແລະ ຊິງຄ໌ພວກມັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rocky.adoc:9
msgid ""
"The architectures currently supported are: `x86_64` and `aarch64`, on "
"version 9 additionally {ppc64le} and {s390x}.  For full list of supported "
"products and architectures, see "
"xref:client-configuration:supported-features.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳທີ່ຮອງຮັບໃນປັດຈຸບັນແມ່ນ: `x86_64` ແລະ `aarch64`, ໃນເວີຊັນ 9 ຍັງຮອງຮັບ {ppc64le} ແລະ {s390x} ເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ສຳລັບລາຍຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນ ແລະ ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳທີ່ຮອງຮັບທັງໝົດ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:supported-features.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rocky.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "{rocky} Products - WebUI"
msgstr "{rocky} Products - WebUI"

#. type: Table
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rocky.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| OS Version | Product Name\n"
"| {rocky} 9  | {rocky} 9 x86_64\n"
"| {rocky} 8  | {rocky} 8 x86_64\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rocky.adoc:14
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rocky.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "{rocky} Channels - CLI"
msgstr "{rocky} Channels - CLI"

#. type: Table
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rocky.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| OS Version | Base Channel\n"
"| {rocky} 9  | rockylinux9-x86_64\n"
"| {rocky} 8  | rockylinux8-x86_64\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Table
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rocky.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| OS Version | Base Channel | Client Channel           | AppStream Channel\n"
"| {rocky} 9  | rockylinux9  | rockylinux9-uyuni-client | "
"rockylinux9-appstream\n"
"| {rocky} 8  | rockylinux8  | rockylinux8-uyuni-client | "
"rockylinux8-appstream\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rocky.adoc:20
msgid ""
"For {rocky}{nbsp}9 and {rocky}{nbsp}8 clients, add both the Base and "
"AppStream channels.  You require packages from both channels.  If you do not "
"add both channels, you cannot create the bootstrap repository, due to "
"missing packages."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rocky.adoc:21
msgid ""
"You might notice some disparity in the number of packages available in the "
"AppStream channel between upstream and the {productname} channel.  You might "
"also see different numbers if you compare the same channel added at a "
"different point in time.  This is due to the way that {rocky} manages their "
"repositories.  {rocky} removes older version of packages when a new version "
"is released, while {productname} keeps all of them, regardless of age."
msgstr "ທ່ານອາດຈະສັງເກດເຫັນຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງຂອງຈຳນວນ packages ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ AppStream channel ລະຫວ່າງ upstream ແລະ {productname} channel. ທ່ານອາດຈະເຫັນຕົວເລກທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນຫາກປຽບທຽບ channel ດຽວກັນທີ່ເພີ່ມໃນເວລາທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ. ນີ້ແມ່ນຍ້ອນວິທີທີ່ {rocky} ຈັດການ repositories ຂອງພວກເຂົາ; {rocky} ຈະລຶບ packages ເວີຊັນເກົ່າອອກເມື່ອມີເວີຊັນໃໝ່ອອກມາ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ {productname} ຈະເກັບທຸກເວີຊັນໄວ້ ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນວ່າມັນຈະເກົ່າປານໃດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rocky.adoc:22
msgid ""
"If you are using modular channels with {rocky} 8, you must enable the "
"Python 3.6 module stream on the client.  If you do not provide Python 3.6, "
"the installation of the [package]``spacecmd`` package will fail."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rocky.adoc:25
msgid ""
"You need to create an activation key that is associated with your {rocky} "
"channels."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງ activation key ທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບ {rocky} channels ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rocky.adoc:29
#: modules/client-configuration/partials/trust_gpg.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Trusting a GPG key is important for security on clients.  It is the task of "
"the administrator to decide which keys are needed and can be trusted.  A "
"software channel cannot be assigned to a client when the GPG key is not "
"trusted."
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຊື່ (trusting) ຄີ GPG ແມ່ນມີຄວາມສຳຄັນຕໍ່ຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງ clients. ມັນແມ່ນໜ້າທີ່ຂອງຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບທີ່ຈະຕັດສິນໃຈວ່າຄີໃດທີ່ຈຳເປັນ ແລະ ສາມາດເຊື່ອມຊື່ໄດ້. software channel ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບ client ໄດ້ ຫາກຄີ GPG ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການເຊື່ອມຊື່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-rocky.adoc:33
msgid ""
"When you update {rocky} clients, the packages include metadata about the "
"updates."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານອັບເດດ {rocky} clients, packages ຈະລວມເອົາ metadata ກ່ຽວກັບການອັບເດດນັ້ນນຳ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sle.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registering {sle} Clients"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນ {sle} Clients"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sle.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section contains information about registering clients running {sle} "
"operating systems."
msgstr "ສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການລົງທະບຽນ clients ທີ່ໃຊ້ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ {sle}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sle.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Use the instructions in this chapter for preparing all {sle} products, "
"including:"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຄຳແນະນຳໃນບົດນີ້ເພື່ອການກຽມຜະລິດຕະພັນ {sle} ທັງໝົດ, ລວມທັງ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sle.adoc:4
msgid "{sles} for SAP"
msgstr "{sles} for SAP"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sle.adoc:5
msgid "{sle} Desktop"
msgstr "{sle} Desktop"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sle.adoc:6
msgid "{sle}"
msgstr "{sle}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sle.adoc:7
msgid "{sle} Real Time"
msgstr "{sle} Real Time"

#. type: Plain text
