#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slemicro.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registering {sle-micro} Clients"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນ {sle-micro} Clients"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slemicro.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section contains information about registering clients running "
"{sle-micro} operating systems 5.1, 5.2, 5.3, 5.4, and 5.5 on {x86_64}, "
"{arm64}, and {zsystems} (s390x) architectures."
msgstr "ສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການລົງທະບຽນ clients ທີ່ໃຊ້ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ {sle-micro} ເວີຊັນ 5.1, 5.2, 5.3, 5.4, ແລະ 5.5 ໃນສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ {x86_64}, {arm64}, ແລະ {zsystems} (s390x)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slemicro.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The {sle-micro} uses transactional updates.  Transactional updates are "
"atomic (all updates are applied only if all updates succeed) and support "
"rollbacks.  They do not affect a running system as no changes are activated "
"until after the system is rebooted."
msgstr "{sle-micro} ໃຊ້ການອັບເດດແບບ transactional. ການອັບເດດແບບ transactional ແມ່ນເປັນແບບ atomic (ການອັບເດດທັງໝົດຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອການອັບເດດທັງໝົດສຳເລັດ) ແລະ ຮອງຮັບການຍ້ອນກັບ (rollbacks). ພວກມັນຈະບໍ່ສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ລະບົບທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ ເພາະຈະບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງໃດໆທີ່ມີຜົນຈົນກວ່າລະບົບຈະຖືກປິດ-ເປີດເຄື່ອງໃໝ່ (reboot)."

#.  FIXME: We either must add this to the other client files (snippet), or
#.         up to the suse registration page
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slemicro.adoc:5
msgid "The client registration described in this chapter, consists of these steps:"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນ client ທີ່ອະທິບາຍໃນບົດນີ້ ປະກອບມີຂັ້ນຕອນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slemicro.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Synchronize software channels for the new client's operating system and "
"architecture by using either {webui} or command-line interface."
msgstr "ຊິງຄ໌ software channels ສຳລັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ ແລະ ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳຂອງ client ໃໝ່ ໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui} ຫຼື command-line interface."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slemicro.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Synchronize the client tool repository for the newly added operating systems "
"by using command-line interface."
msgstr "ຊິງຄ໌ client tool repository ສຳລັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ເພີ່ມໃໝ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ command-line interface."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slemicro.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Register the client with {productname} Server by using the {webui} or the "
"command-line interface."
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນ client ກັບ {productname} Server ໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui} ຫຼື command-line interface."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slemicro.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Additional sections describe ways to check and verify the registration "
"procedure."
msgstr "ສ່ວນເພີ່ມເຕີມຈະອະທິບາຍວິທີການກວດສອບ ແລະ ຢືນຢັນຂັ້ນຕອນການລົງທະບຽນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slemicro.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Before you register {sle-micro} clients to the {productname} Server, you "
"need to add the required software channels, and synchronize them."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະລົງທະບຽນ {sle-micro} clients ກັບ {productname} Server, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເພີ່ມ software channels ທີ່ຕ້ອງການ ແລະ ຊິງຄ໌ພວກມັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slemicro.adoc:12
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slmicro.adoc:7
msgid "You can add the software channels with the {webui} or from the command line."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມ software channels ໄດ້ດ້ວຍ {webui} ຫຼື ຈາກ command line."

