#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slemicro.adoc:26
msgid "{sle-micro} clients require a reboot after registering."
msgstr "{sle-micro} clients ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ປິດ-ເປີດເຄື່ອງໃໝ່ (reboot) ຫຼັງຈາກລົງທະບຽນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slemicro.adoc:27
msgid ""
"Following the bootstrapping process, automatic booting is disabled on "
"{sle-micro} clients. This change was implemented due to intermittent "
"automatic reboots, which could occurr before {salt} could relay the results "
"of applying the bootstrap {salt} state."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slemicro.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Although a reboot is automatically scheduled after registration is "
"completed, it is respecting the default reboot manager maintenance window.  "
"This window may be several hours after the client is registered.  It is "
"advisable to manually reboot the client after the registration script "
"finishes, to speed up the registration and to see the system appear in the "
"system list."
msgstr "ເຖິງວ່າຈະມີການຕັ້ງເວລາ reboot ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຫຼັງຈາກການລົງທະບຽນສຳເລັດ, ແຕ່ມັນຈະປະຕິບັດຕາມຊ່ວງເວລາການບຳລຸງຮັກສາ (maintenance window) ຂອງຕົວຈັດການ reboot. ຊ່ວງເວລານີ້ອາດຈະເປັນເວລາຫຼາຍຊົ່ວໂມງຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ client ຖືກລົງທະບຽນ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຂໍແນະນຳໃຫ້ reboot client ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ script ການລົງທະບຽນເຮັດວຽກສຳເລັດ ເພື່ອເລັ່ງຂະບວນການລົງທະບຽນ ແລະ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ລະບົບສະແດງຢູ່ໃນລາຍຊື່ລະບົບໄດ້ໄວຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slemicro.adoc:29
msgid ""
"When using a bootstrap script with {sle-micro} systems, ensure that the "
"certificate section of the script has this content:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອໃຊ້ bootstrap script ກັບລະບົບ {sle-micro}, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າສ່ວນຂອງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ (certificate) ໃນ script ມີເນື້ອຫາດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slemicro.adoc:30
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slmicro.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ORG_CA_CERT=RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT\n"
"ORG_CA_CERT_IS_RPM_YN=0\n"
msgstr ""
"ORG_CA_CERT=RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT\n"
"ORG_CA_CERT_IS_RPM_YN=0\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slemicro.adoc:31
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slmicro.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Either edit the bootstrap script directly and add the settings, or create "
"the bootstrap script with these parameters:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດແກ້ໄຂ bootstrap script ໂດຍກົງເພື່ອເພີ່ມການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ຫຼື ສ້າງ bootstrap script ໃໝ່ດ້ວຍພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້:"

#.  2023-12-12, ke: remains in /srv, see
#.  https://github.com/uyuni-project/uyuni-docs/pull/2682/files#r1423757456
#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slemicro.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- mgr-bootstrap --script=bootstrap-sle-micro.sh \\\n"
"    --ssl-cert=/srv/www/htdocs/pub/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- mgr-bootstrap --script=bootstrap-sle-micro.sh \\\n"
"    --ssl-cert=/srv/www/htdocs/pub/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slemicro.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reboot {sle-micro}"
msgstr "Reboot {sle-micro}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slemicro.adoc:34
msgid ""
"{sle-micro} is a transactional system.  Transactional updates in general "
"support several reboot methods.  It is recommended to use "
"[systemitem]``systemd`` for rebooting in systems managed by {productname}.  "
"Using other methods can lead to undesired behavior."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slemicro.adoc:35
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slmicro.adoc:32
msgid ""
"When bootstrapping a transactional system on {productname}, "
"[systemitem]``systemd`` will be configured as the reboot method "
"([literal]``REBOOT_METHOD``), if the system is in its default "
"configuration.  Such a configuration allows {productname} to control the "
"reboot action, and rebooting can be performed immediately or scheduled with "
"{productname} as wanted."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slemicro.adoc:37
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slmicro.adoc:34
msgid ""
"By default, the reboot method during client installation is set to "
"[option]``auto``.  With the [option]``auto`` boot method, "
"[command]``rebootmgrd`` will be used to reboot the system according to the "
"configured policies if the service is running.  Policies can be to reboot "
"instantly or during a maintenance window.  For more information, see the "
"[command]``rebootmgrd``(8) man page.  Otherwise if [command]``rebootmgrd`` "
"is not running, {productname} will call [command]``systemctl reboot``."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slemicro.adoc:38
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slmicro.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Using any method different from [command]``systemd`` may cause undesired "
"behavior."
msgstr ""

#
#.  2023-05-23, ke: The rest is commented and the user will not see the
#.                  following remarks/background info:
#. Otherwise, the only thing Suma will be able to do is to ask for a reboot and it will be managed in the peculiarities of each reboot method. Not having control of when the reboot should happen, also takes away from Suma the ability to perform the reboot on its own maintenance windows, which is not the ideal configuration.
#. The user must be able to change reboot method at any time and SUSE Manager will keep it. But in this case we should alert in the documentation that using any method different from systemd may cause undesired behavior.
#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registering {sll} Clients"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນ {sll} Clients"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section contains information about registering clients running {sll} "
"operating systems.  {sll} clients are based on {rhel} or {centos}."
msgstr "ສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການລົງທະບຽນ clients ທີ່ໃຊ້ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ {sll}. {sll} clients ແມ່ນມີພື້ນຖານມາຈາກ {rhel} ຫຼື {centos}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{sll} clients are sometimes also called {sleses} (SLESES), Liberty, RES or "
"{redhat} {es}."
msgstr "ບາງຄັ້ງ {sll} clients ກໍຖືກເອີ້ນວ່າ {sleses} (SLESES), Liberty, RES ຫຼື {redhat} {es}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The {sll} software channels provided by {suse} only provide updates to "
"packages, they do not provide the packages themselves.  To register {sll} "
"clients, you need to register the {sll} Product (outlined below) to create "
"the necessary base channel, then import any required {redhat} or {centos} "
"packages as custom child channels.  You must obtain the initial packages "
"directly from {redhat} or {centos} before you can apply the updates provided "
"by the {sll} software channels."
msgstr "{sll} software channels ທີ່ສະໜອງໂດຍ {suse} ຈະມີໃຫ້ພຽງແຕ່ການອັບເດດ packages ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ແຕ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ມີຕົວ packages ໃຫ້. ໃນການລົງທະບຽນ {sll} clients, ທ່ານຕ້ອງລົງທະບຽນ {sll} Product (ຕາມລາຍລະອຽດດ້ານລຸ່ມ) ເພື່ອສ້າງ base channel ທີ່ຈຳເປັນ, ຈາກນັ້ນໃຫ້ສ້າງ custom child channels ເພື່ອນໍາເຂົ້າ packages ຂອງ {redhat} ຫຼື {centos} ທີ່ຕ້ອງການ. ທ່ານຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບ packages ເບື້ອງຕົ້ນໂດຍກົງຈາກ {redhat} ຫຼື {centos} ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ການອັບເດດທີ່ມາຈາກ {sll} software channels ໄດ້."

#.  FIXME!
#.  Use list format: repository URLs / packages and metadata / version info
#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:5
msgid "{sll} repository URLs are available from {scclongform}"
msgstr "URL ຂອງ {sll} repository ແມ່ນມີໃຫ້ຈາກ {scclongform}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:6
msgid "Packages and metadata are provided by {suse}"
msgstr "Packages ແລະ metadata ແມ່ນສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍ {suse}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:8
msgid ""
"You are responsible for arranging access to {redhat} or {centos} base media "
"repositories and installation media."
msgstr "ທ່ານມີໜ້າທີ່ຮັບຜິດຊອບໃນການຈັດກຽມການເຂົ້າເຖິງ {redhat} ຫຼື {centos} base media repositories ແລະ ສື່ການຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:9
msgid "You must obtain support from {suse} for all your {sll} systems."
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງຂໍຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນ (support) ຈາກ {suse} ສຳລັບລະບົບ {sll} ທັງໝົດຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:10
msgid "{suse} does not provide support for {sll} systems on {uyuni}."
msgstr "{suse} ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຫ້ການສະໜັບສະໜູນສຳລັບລະບົບ {sll} ໃນ {uyuni}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:12
msgid ""
"For {sll} clients, some required packages are contained on the {rhel} or "
"{centos} installation media.  You must have these packages installed before "
"you can register a {sll} client."
msgstr "ສຳລັບ {sll} clients, packages ທີ່ຈຳເປັນບາງສ່ວນແມ່ນລວມຢູ່ໃນສື່ການຕິດຕັ້ງຂອງ {rhel} ຫຼື {centos}. ທ່ານຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງ packages ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະສາມາດລົງທະບຽນ {sll} client ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:13
msgid ""
"The {sll} product is provided by {scclongform}.  This also includes the "
"client tools package."
msgstr "ຜະລິດຕະພັນ {sll} ແມ່ນສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍ {scclongform}. ອັນນີ້ລວມເຖິງ package ຂອງ client tools ນຳ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Before you register {sll} clients to your {productname} Server, you need to "
"add the required software channels, and synchronize them."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະລົງທະບຽນ {sll} clients ກັບ {productname} Server ຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເພີ່ມ software channels ທີ່ຕ້ອງການ ແລະ ຊິງຄ໌ພວກມັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:15
msgid ""
"You need to select two different sets of channels, one for {sll} and the "
"other for the Client Tools."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເລືອກ channels ສອງຊຸດທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ, ຊຸດໜຶ່ງສຳລັບ {sll} ແລະ ອີກຊຸດໜຶ່ງສຳລັບ Client Tools."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:16
msgid ""
"You need an activation key associated with the correct {sll} channels.  For "
"more information about activation keys, see "
"xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີ activation key ທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບ {sll} channels ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ activation keys, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."

