#. type: Title ===
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add Base Media"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:29
msgid ""
"The {sll} software channels only provide updates, not the packages "
"themselves.  To register {sll} clients, first register the {sll} Product "
"(outlined below) to create the base channel, then import the necessary Red "
"Hat or CentOS packages as custom child channels.  Initial packages must be "
"obtained directly from {redhat} or {centos} before applying updates from "
"{sll}.  Importantly, you do not need to maintain your Red Hat subscriptions, "
"but consult your legal department to check for any ongoing payment "
"obligations to Red Hat during migration.  To ensure you have all the "
"packages you need, use a full DVD image, not a minimal or {jeos} image."
msgstr "{sll} software channels ຈະສະໜອງໃຫ້ພຽງແຕ່ການອັບເດດເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ໄດ້ມີຕົວ packages ໃຫ້. ໃນການລົງທະບຽນ {sll} clients, ທຳອິດຕ້ອງລົງທະບຽນ {sll} Product (ຕາມລາຍລະອຽດດ້ານລຸ່ມ) ເພື່ອສ້າງ base channel, ຈາກນັ້ນໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ packages ຂອງ Red Hat ຫຼື CentOS ທີ່ຈຳເປັນເປັນ custom child channels. ທ່ານຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບ packages ເບື້ອງຕົ້ນໂດຍກົງຈາກ {redhat} ຫຼື {centos} ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້ການອັບເດດຈາກ {sll}. ສິ່ງສຳຄັນແມ່ນທ່ານບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕໍ່ອາຍຸການສະໝັກໃຊ້ Red Hat ໄວ້, ແຕ່ຄວນປຶກສາຝ່າຍກົດໝາຍຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອ ກວດສອບພັນທະການຈ່າຍເງິນໃດໆທີ່ມີຕໍ່ Red Hat ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຍ້າຍລະບົບ (migration). ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີ packages ທັງໝົດທີ່ຕ້ອງການ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ DVD image ແບບເຕັມ, ບໍ່ຄວນໃຊ້ image ແບບ minimal ຫຼື {jeos}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:30
msgid ""
"You can use {productname} custom channels to set up the {rhel} or {centos} "
"media.  All packages on the base media must be mirrored into a child "
"channel."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ {productname} custom channels ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າສື່ຂອງ {rhel} ຫຼື {centos} ໄດ້. packages ທັງໝົດໃນ base media ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຖືກ mirror ເຂົ້າໄປໃນ child channel."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:31
msgid "You can freely choose the names for the channels."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກຊື່ສຳລັບ channels ໄດ້ຕາມໃຈ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding Base Media to Custom Channels (SLES-ES-7 example)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Copy the base media image to the {productname} Server container host to the "
"[path]``/tmp/`` directory."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:36
msgid "To get the base media image into the {productname} Server container, use:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເອົາ base media image ເຂົ້າໄປໃນ {productname} Server container, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm distribution copy /tmp/SLES-ES-7.9-x86_64-DVD.iso sles-es-7\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:38
msgid ""
"The destination in the container will be "
"[path]``/srv/www/distributions/sles-es-7``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:39
msgid "Import the packages into the child channel you created earlier:"
msgstr "ນໍາເຂົ້າ packages ເຂົ້າໃນ child channel ທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ສ້າງໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -- spacewalk-repo-sync -c <channel-label> -u "
"file:///srv/www/distributions/sles-es-7/\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:41
msgid ""
"For version 9 and 8 clients, adjust label and directories accordingly and "
"additionally, synchronize both the Base and AppStream channels:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບ clients ເວີຊັນ 9 ແລະ 8, ໃຫ້ປັບປ່ຽນ label ແລະ ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ຊິງຄ໌ທັງ Base channel ແລະ AppStream channel ເພີ່ມເຕີມ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -- spacewalk-repo-sync -c <channel-label> -u "
"file:///srv/www/distributions/sles-es-9/BaseOS\n"
"mgrctl exec -- spacewalk-repo-sync -c <channel-label> -u "
"file:///srv/www/distributions/sles-es-9/AppStream\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:43
msgid "Or:"
msgstr "ຫຼື:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -- spacewalk-repo-sync -c <channel-label> -u "
"file:///srv/www/distributions/sles-es-8/BaseOS\n"
"mgrctl exec -- spacewalk-repo-sync -c <channel-label> -u "
"file:///srv/www/distributions/sles-es-8/AppStream\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ====
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "OPTIONAL: Add Base Media from a Content URL"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:46
msgid ""
"Alternatively, if you have access to a content URL provided by {redhat} CDN "
"or {centos}, you can create a custom repository to mirror the packages."
msgstr "ອີກວິທີໜຶ່ງ, ຫາກທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ URL ຂອງເນື້ອຫາທີ່ສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍ {redhat} CDN ຫຼື {centos}, ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງ custom repository ເພື່ອ mirror ຕົວ packages ໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:48
#, no-wrap
msgid "ES Custom Repository Settings"
msgstr "ES Custom Repository Settings"

#. type: Table
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Option                 | Parameter\n"
"| Repository URL         | The content URL provided by {redhat} CDN or "
"{centos}\n"
"| Has Signed Metadata?   | Uncheck all {redhat} Enterprise repositories\n"
"| SSL CA Certificate     | [systemitem]``redhat-uep`` ({redhat} only)\n"
"| SSL Client Certificate | [systemitem]``Entitlement-Cert-date`` ({redhat} "
"only)\n"
"| SSL Client Key         | ``Entitlement-Key-date`` ({redhat} only)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:51
msgid ""
"The {sll} channels can be very large.  The initial channel synchronization "
"can sometimes take up to several hours."
msgstr "{sll} channels ອາດມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຫຼາຍ. ການຊິງຄ໌ channel ຄັ້ງທຳອິດບາງຄັ້ງອາດໃຊ້ເວລາດົນເຖິງຫຼາຍຊົ່ວໂມງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:52
msgid ""
"When the initial synchronization is complete, we recommended you clone the "
"channel before you work with it.  This gives you a backup of the original "
"synchronization data."
msgstr "ເມື່ອການຊິງຄ໌ຄັ້ງທຳອິດສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານໂຄນ (clone) ຊ່ອງທາງນັ້ນໄວ້ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມໃຊ້ງານມັນ. ອັນນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານມີຂໍ້ມູນສຳຮອງຂອງການຊິງຄ໌ຕົ້ນສະບັບ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:53
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register {sll} Clients"
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນ {sll} Clients"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migrate Enterprise Linux (EL) clients to {sll}"
msgstr "ຍ້າຍ (migrate) Enterprise Linux (EL) clients ໄປສູ່ {sll}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:55
msgid ""
"If an Enterprise Linux (EL) client such as {rhel} and {centos} is already "
"registered as a minion on {productname} and users want to migrate it to "
"{sll} they can use a re-activation key to apply the activation key that "
"drives the migration."
msgstr "ຫາກ Enterprise Linux (EL) client ເຊັ່ນ {rhel} ແລະ {centos} ໄດ້ຖືກລົງທະບຽນເປັນ minion ໃນ {productname} ຢູ່ແລ້ວ ແລະ ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕ້ອງການຍ້າຍໄປສູ່ {sll}, ພວກເຂົາສາມາດໃຊ້ re-activation key ເພື່ອນຳໃຊ້ activation key ທີ່ຈະເປັນຕົວຂັບເຄື່ອນການຍ້າຍລະບົບນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:56
msgid ""
"For more information about re-activation keys, see "
"xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc#activation-keys-reactivation[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ re-activation keys, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc#activation-keys-reactivation[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:57
msgid ""
"The re-activation key is per minion, and can be generated with the {webui} "
"or using the API.  For more information, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/suma/5.0/api/suse-manager/api/system.html#apidoc-system-obtainReactivationKey-loggedInUser-sid."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:58
msgid ""
"To re-activate a client, the user can run the bootstrap script on the client "
"and pass the re-activation key as an environment variable.  Example:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເຮັດການ re-activate client, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດຣັນ bootstrap script ໃນ client ແລະ ສົ່ງຄ່າ re-activation key ເປັນ environment variable. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "REACTIVATION_KEY=<KEY> ./bootstrap_liberate9.sh\n"
msgstr "REACTIVATION_KEY=<KEY> ./bootstrap_liberate9.sh\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:60
msgid ""
"Another method is to add some special flags to the {salt} client "
"configuration file located at "
"[path]``/etc/venv-salt-minon/minion.d/susemanager.conf`` (or "
"[path]``/etc/salt-minon/minion.d/susemanager.conf``) the following content "
"(join this content with the already existing one):"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:61
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"grains:\n"
"    susemanager:\n"
"        activation_key: \"<KEY_ID>\"\n"
"        management_key: \"MINION_REACTIVATION_KEY\"\n"
msgstr ""
"grains:\n"
"    susemanager:\n"
"        activation_key: \"<KEY_ID>\"\n"
"        management_key: \"MINION_REACTIVATION_KEY\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:62
msgid ""
"After changing the [path]``susemanager.conf`` file, the "
"[systemitem]``salt-minion`` service needs to be restarted on the {salt} "
"server.  By default with:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:63
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl restart venv-salt-minon\n"
msgstr "systemctl restart venv-salt-minon\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:64
msgid "Or for legacy {salt} with:"
msgstr "ຫຼືສຳລັບ {salt} ແບບເກົ່າ (legacy) ໃຫ້ໃຊ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl restart salt-minon\n"
msgstr "systemctl restart salt-minon\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [systemitem]``liberate`` formula"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-sleses.adoc:67
msgid ""
"Migrating Enterprise Linux (EL) clients to {sll} with the "
"[systemitem]``liberate`` formula.  For more information, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-liberate.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slmicro.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registering {sl-micro} Clients"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນ {sl-micro} Clients"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slmicro.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section contains information about registering clients running "
"{sl-micro} operating system {x86_64}, {arm64}, and {zsystems} (s390x)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slmicro.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The {sl-micro} uses transactional updates.  Transactional updates are atomic "
"(all updates are applied only if all updates succeed) and support "
"rollbacks.  They do not affect a running system as no changes are activated "
"until after the system is rebooted."
msgstr "{sl-micro} ໃຊ້ການອັບເດດແບບ transactional. ການອັບເດດແບບ transactional ແມ່ນເປັນແບບ atomic (ການອັບເດດທັງໝົດຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອການອັບເດດທັງໝົດສຳເລັດ) ແລະ ຮອງຮັບການຍ້ອນກັບ (rollbacks). ພວກມັນຈະບໍ່ສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ລະບົບທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ ເພາະຈະບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງໃດໆທີ່ມີຜົນຈົນກວ່າລະບົບຈະຖືກ reboot."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slmicro.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Before you register {sl-micro} clients to the {productname} Server, you need "
"to add the required software channels, and synchronize them."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະລົງທະບຽນ {sl-micro} clients ກັບ {productname} Server, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເພີ່ມ software channels ທີ່ຕ້ອງການ ແລະ ຊິງຄ໌ພວກມັນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slmicro.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "{sl-micro} 6.1 Products - WebUI"
msgstr "{sl-micro} 6.1 Products - WebUI"

#. type: Table
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-slmicro.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| OS Version\n"
"| Product Name\n"
"\n"
"| {sl-micro} 6.1 {x86_64}\n"
"| SUSE Linux Micro 6.1 x86_64\n"
"\n"
"| {sl-micro} 6.1 {arm64}\n"
"| SUSE Linux Micro 6.1 arch64\n"
"\n"
"| {sl-micro} 6.1 {s390x}\n"
"| SUSE Linux Micro 6.1 s390x\n"
