#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mirror Ubuntu ESM packages"
msgstr "Mirror packages ຂອງ Ubuntu ESM"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Canonical provides https://ubuntu.com/security/esm[Expanded Security "
"Maintenance] (**ESM**) packages for https://ubuntu.com/pro[Ubuntu Pro] users "
"and customers.  These packages offer longer maintenance (_10 to 12 years_) "
"for several operating system components and selected applications."
msgstr "Canonical ສະໜອງ packages https://ubuntu.com/security/esm[Expanded Security Maintenance] (**ESM**) ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ລູກຄ້າ https://ubuntu.com/pro[Ubuntu Pro]. packages ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃຫ້ການບຳລຸງຮັກສາທີ່ຍາວນານກວ່າ (_10 ຫາ 12 ປີ_) ສຳລັບຫຼາຍອົງປະກອບຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ ແລະ ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ເລືອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:23
msgid ""
"These repositories can also be synchronized within {productname} if you "
"extract the required **GPG keys** and your personal **Bearer Token** from a "
"system registered to Ubuntu Pro."
msgstr "repositories ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດຊິງຄ໌ພາຍໃນ {productname} ໄດ້ ຫາກທ່ານທຳການສະກັດ (extract) **GPG keys** ທີ່ຈຳເປັນ ແລະ **Bearer Token** ສ່ວນຕົວຂອງທ່ານຈາກລະບົບທີ່ລົງທະບຽນກັບ Ubuntu Pro."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Extract GPG keys and Bearer Token"
msgstr "ສະກັດ GPG keys ແລະ Bearer Token"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Register an Ubuntu host with Ubuntu Pro.  You will find your personal "
"registration token in the https://ubuntu.com/pro/dashboard[Ubuntu Pro "
"Dashbaord].  An https://login.ubuntu.com/[Ubuntu One acconut] is required "
"for this."
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນ Ubuntu host ກັບ Ubuntu Pro. ທ່ານຈະພົບ token ການລົງທະບຽນສ່ວນຕົວຂອງທ່ານໃນ https://ubuntu.com/pro/dashboard[Ubuntu Pro Dashboard]. ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີ [Ubuntu One account] ສຳລັບຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo apt-get install ubuntu-advantage-tools\n"
"sudo pro attach <perosnal_token>\n"
msgstr ""
"sudo apt-get install ubuntu-advantage-tools\n"
"sudo pro attach <personal_token>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:27
msgid ""
"After registration, you will find the Bearer Token in the file "
"`/etc/apt/auth.conf.d/90ubuntu-advantage`:"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກລົງທະບຽນ, ທ່ານຈະພົບ Bearer Token ໃນໄຟລ໌ `/etc/apt/auth.conf.d/90ubuntu-advantage`:"

