"| Architectures | Releases\n"
"| `amd64`, `arm64`, `armel`, `armhf`, `i386`, `powerpc`, `ppc64el`, `s390x` "
"| `bionic`, `focal`, `jammy`, `noble`, `trusty`, `xenial`\n"
msgstr ""
"| ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ | ເວີຊັນທີ່ປ່ອຍ\n"
"| `amd64`, `arm64`, `armel`, `armhf`, `i386`, `powerpc`, `ppc64el`, `s390x` | `bionic`, `focal`, `jammy`, `noble`, `trusty`, `xenial`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:38
msgid ""
"In order for {productname} to synchronize the repositories, the "
"corresponding GPG keys (`ubuntu-advantage-esm-infra-trusty.gpg`, "
"`ubuntu-advantage-esm-apps.gpg`) must be imported. These are located on a "
"system registered with Ubuntu Pro under `/etc/apt/trusted.gpg.d`. Copy these "
"files to the {productname} system and import them as follows:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ {productname} ສາມາດຊິງຄ໌ repositories ໄດ້, ຕ້ອງນຳເຂົ້າ GPG keys ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ (`ubuntu-advantage-esm-infra-trusty.gpg`, `ubuntu-advantage-esm-apps.gpg`). ຄີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນລະບົບທີ່ລົງທະບຽນກັບ Ubuntu Pro ພາຍໃຕ້ `/etc/apt/trusted.gpg.d`. ໃຫ້ສຳເນົາໄຟລ໌ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄປຍັງລະບົບ {productname} ແລະ ນຳເຂົ້າພວກມັນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm gpg add /path/to/gpg.key\n"
msgstr "mgradm gpg add /path/to/gpg.key\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:40
msgid ""
"Create the appropriate child channels below already synchronized {ubuntu} "
"parent channels. After that, repositories can be synchronized."
msgstr "ສ້າງ child channels ທີ່ເໝາະສົມພາຍໃຕ້ parent channels ຂອງ {ubuntu} ທີ່ຊິງຄ໌ແລ້ວ. ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ, ຈະສາມາດຊິງຄ໌ repositories ໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:41
msgid ""
"The procedure shown here can be used to circumvent the subscription "
"limitations - however, this constitutes a breach of the Terms of Service and "
"may have **legal consequences**.  There must always be sufficient "
"subscriptions for the number of systems used."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:43
msgid ""
"{ubuntu} channels can be very large.  Synchronization can sometimes take "
"several hours."
msgstr "{ubuntu} channels ສາມາດມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຫຼາຍ. ການຊິງຄ໌ບາງຄັ້ງອາດໃຊ້ເວລາຫຼາຍຊົ່ວໂມງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:49
msgid "The root user on {ubuntu} is disabled by default for SSH access."
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ root ໃນ {ubuntu} ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານໄວ້ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງຜ່ານ SSH."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:51
msgid ""
"This issue happens with self-installed versions of {ubuntu}.  If the default "
"user has been granted administrative privileges during installation time, a "
"password is required to perform privilege escalation using "
"[command]``sudo``.  With cloud instances this does not happen because "
"[command]``cloud-init`` automatically creates a file under "
"[path]``/etc/sudoers.d`` and grants privilege escalation through "
"[command]``sudo`` without the need for a password."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "Grant Root User Access"
msgstr "ໃຫ້ສິດການເຂົ້າເຖິງແກ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ Root"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bootstrap as Install-created User via SSH"
msgstr "ເຮັດ Bootstrap ໃນຖານະຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນຕອນຕິດຕັ້ງຜ່ານ SSH"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:60
msgid ""
"To bootstrap an Ubuntu client via SSH you must add the install-created user "
"to the sudo group.  Then run the bootstrap script from the client."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເຮັດ bootstrap ໃຫ້ກັບ Ubuntu client ຜ່ານ SSH, ທ່ານຕ້ອງເພີ່ມຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນຕອນຕິດຕັ້ງເຂົ້າໃນກຸ່ມ sudo. ຈາກນັ້ນໃຫ້ຣັນ bootstrap script ຈາກ client."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:61
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Adding Install-created User to sudo Group and Bootstrapping via "
"SSH"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເພີ່ມຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນຕອນຕິດຕັ້ງເຂົ້າໃນກຸ່ມ sudo ແລະ ການເຮັດ Bootstrapping ຜ່ານ SSH"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:62
msgid ""
"On the client, as root, run from the command line (replace "
"[literal]``<username>`` with the name of the install-created user):"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:63
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo usermod -aG sudo <username>\n"
msgstr "sudo usermod -aG sudo <username>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:64
msgid ""
"Bootstrap the client system from its command line (replace "
"[literal]``<SERVER_FQDN>`` with the fully qualified domain name of the "
"{productname} Server):"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo su -\n"
"curl -Sks https://<SERVER_FQDN>/pub/bootstrap/bootstrap-script.sh | "
"/bin/bash\n"
msgstr ""
"sudo su -\n"
"curl -Sks https://<SERVER_FQDN>/pub/bootstrap/bootstrap-script.sh | /bin/bash\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/clients-ubuntu.adoc:66
msgid ""
"{ubuntu} can only be bootstrapped using the corresponding {ubuntu} bootstrap "
"script run from the client system's command line after issuing "
"[command]``sudo su -`` as above.  It cannot be bootstrapped via the "
"{productname} {webui} due to the fact that the root user is disabled on "
"{ubuntu} by default, and that the {webui} does not permit for privilege "
"escalation of the {ubuntu} install-created user."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-basics.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuration Basics"
msgstr "ພື້ນຖານການຕັ້ງຄ່າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-basics.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} requires a number of steps to prepare the environment for "
"clients registration before a wide range of its operations can be utilized."
msgstr "{productname} ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີຫຼາຍຂັ້ນຕອນໃນການກຽມສະພາບແວດລ້ອມສຳລັບການລົງທະບຽນ clients ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ການເຮັດວຽກຕ່າງໆໄດ້ຢ່າງເຕັມທີ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-basics.adoc:3
msgid ""
"This section contains summary of the initial configuration steps that are "
"necessary to support environment operations following successful "
"{productname} installation and setting up."
msgstr "ສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍບົດສະຫຼຸບຂອງຂັ້ນຕອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າເບື້ອງຕົ້ນທີ່ຈຳເປັນ ເພື່ອຮອງຮັບການເຮັດວຽກຂອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ ຫຼັງຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-basics.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For more information about installing {productname}, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-uyuni.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-basics.adoc:5
msgid ""
"For more information about setting up {productname}, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:uyuni-server-setup.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuration Management"
msgstr "ການຈັດການການຕັ້ງຄ່າ (Configuration Management)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:2
msgid ""
"You can use configuration files and channels to manage configuration for "
"your clients, rather than configuring each client manually."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ ແລະ channels ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເພື່ອຈັດການການຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບ clients ຂອງທ່ານ, ແທນທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າແຕ່ລະ client ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Configuration parameters are scripted and stored in configuration files.  "
"You can write configuration files directly using the {productname} {webui}, "
"or you can upload or link to files that exist in other locations."
msgstr "ພາລາມິເຕີການຕັ້ງຄ່າຈະຖືກຂຽນເປັນ script ແລະ ເກັບໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ. ທ່ານສາມາດຂຽນໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ໂດຍກົງໂດຍໃຊ້ {productname} {webui}, ຫຼື ທ່ານສາມາດອັບໂຫຼດ ຫຼື ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນບ່ອນອື່ນກໍໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Configuration files can be centrally managed.  Centrally managed "
"configuration files are provided by global configuration channels and can be "
"applied to any client subscribed to the {productname} Server."
msgstr ""

#. // 2023-10, julio: such features are somehow covered by salt. Is dedicated documentation
#. // for this required?
#. Locally managed configuration files are used to override centrally managed configuration settings.
#. They are especially useful for {productname} users who do not have configuration administration privileges, but need to make changes to the clients that they manage.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Configuration channels are used to organize configuration files.  You can "
"subscribe clients to configuration channels, and deploy configuration files "
"as required."
msgstr "channels ການຕັ້ງຄ່າແມ່ນໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈັດລະບຽບໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຫ້ clients ສະໝັກ (subscribe) ເຂົ້າໃນ channels ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງ (deploy) ໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Configuration files are version-controlled, so you can add configuration "
"settings, test them on your clients, and roll back to a previous revision as "
"required.  When you have created your configuration channels, you can also "
"perform comparisons between various configuration files, and between "
"revisions of the same configuration file."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າແມ່ນມີການຄວບຄຸມເວີຊັນ (version-controlled), ດັ່ງນັ້ນທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ທົດສອບພວກມັນໃນ clients, ແລະ ຍ້ອນກັບ (roll back) ໄປຫາເວີຊັນກ່ອນໜ້າໄດ້ຕາມຕ້ອງການ. ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງ channels ການຕັ້ງຄ່າແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດປຽບທຽບລະຫວ່າງໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕ່າງໆ, ຫຼື ປຽບທຽບລະຫວ່າງແຕ່ລະເວີຊັນຂອງໄຟລ໌ດຽວກັນໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Centrally managed configuration files are provided by global configuration "
"channels."
msgstr ""

