#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:8
msgid "This table shows the supported features, where:"
msgstr "ຕາຕະລາງນີ້ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນຟີເຈີທີ່ຮອງຮັບ, ໂດຍທີ່:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:9
