#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add Configuration Files, Directories, or Symbolic Links"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:35
msgid ""
"When you have created a configuration channel you can add a configuration "
"file, directory, or symbolic link:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານສ້າງ channel ການຕັ້ງຄ່າແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ, ຫຼື symbolic link ໄດ້:"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding a Configuration File, Directory, or Symbolic Link"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:37
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Configuration[Channels], and "
"click the name of the configuration channel that you want to add a "
"configuration file to, and navigate to the menu:Add Files[Create File] "
"subtab."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Configuration[Channels], ແລະ ຄລິກໃສ່ຊື່ຂອງ channel ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌, ຈາກນັ້ນໄປທີ່ແຖບຍ່ອຍ menu:Add Files[Create File]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:38
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``File Type`` field, choose whether you want to create a "
"text file, directory, or symbolic link."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:39
msgid ""
"In the [path]``Filename/Path`` field, type the absolute path to the location "
"where the file should be deployed."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:40
msgid ""
"If you are creating a symbolic link, type the target file and path in the "
"[guimenu]``Symbolic Link Target Filename/Path`` field."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:41
msgid ""
"Type the [guimenu]``User name`` and [guimenu]``Group name`` for the file in "
"the [guimenu]``Ownership`` field, and the [guimenu]``File Permissions "
"Mode``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:42
msgid ""
"If the client has SELinux enabled, you can configure [guimenu]``SELinux "
"contexts`` to enable the required file attributes (for example: user, role, "
"and file type)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:43
msgid ""
"If the configuration file includes a macro, enter the symbol that marks the "
"beginning and end of the macro."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:44
msgid ""
"Enter the configuration file contents in the [guimenu]``File Contents`` text "
"box, using the script drop-down box to choose the appropriate scripting "
"language."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:45
msgid "Click btn:[Create Configuration File]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Create Configuration File]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "Subscribe Clients to Configuration Channels"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:47
msgid ""
"You can subscribe individual clients to configuration channels by navigating "
"to menu:Systems[System List], selecting the client you want to subscribe, "
"and navigating to the [guimenu]``Configuration`` tab.  To subscribe multiple "
"clients to a configuration channel, you can use the system set manager "
"(SSM)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:48
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Subscribing Multiple Clients to Configuration Channels"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:49
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Systems List] and "
"select the clients you want to work with."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Systems List] ແລະ ເລືອກ clients ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:50
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Systems[System Set Manager], and go to the "
"menu:Configuration[Subscribe to Channels] subtab to see the list of "
"available configuration channels."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[System Set Manager], ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແຖບຍ່ອຍ menu:Configuration[Subscribe to Channels] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ channels ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ມີຢູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:51
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: Click the number in the [guimenu]``Systems currently subscribed`` "
"column to see which clients are currently subscribed to the configuration "
"channel."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:52
msgid ""
"Check the configuration channels you want to subscribe to, and click "
"btn:[Continue]."
msgstr "ເລືອກ channels ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການສະໝັກ, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Continue]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:53
msgid "Rank the configuration channels using the up and down arrows."
msgstr "ຈັດລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນຂອງ channels ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂດຍໃຊ້ລູກສອນຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ລົງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:54
msgid ""
"Where settings conflicts occur between configuration channels, channels "
"closer to the top of the list take precedence."
msgstr "ຫາກເກີດການຂັດແຍ້ງກັນຂອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າລະຫວ່າງ channels, channel ທີ່ຢູ່ໃກ້ທາງເທິງຂອງລາຍຊື່ຈະມີສິດເໜືອກວ່າ (take precedence)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:55
msgid "Determine how the channels are applied to the selected clients."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວິທີການນຳໃຊ້ channels ກັບ clients ທີ່ເລືອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:56
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Subscribe With Lowest Priority] to add the new channels at a "
"lower priority than currently subscribed channels.  Click btn:[Subscribe "
"with Highest Priority] to add the new channels at a higher priority than "
"currently subscribed channels.  Click btn:[Replace Existing Subscriptions] "
"to remove existing channels and replace them with the new channels."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Subscribe With Lowest Priority] ເພື່ອເພີ່ມ channel ໃໝ່ໂດຍໃຫ້ມີຄວາມສຳຄັນຕ່ຳກວ່າ channel ທີ່ສະໝັກຢູ່ແລ້ວ. ຄລິກ btn:[Subscribe with Highest Priority] ເພື່ອເພີ່ມ channel ໃໝ່ໂດຍໃຫ້ມີຄວາມສຳຄັນສູງກວ່າ. ຄລິກ btn:[Replace Existing Subscriptions] ເພື່ອລຶບ channel ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວອອກ ແລະ ແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍ channel ໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:57
msgid "Click btn:[Apply Subscriptions]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Apply Subscriptions]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:58
msgid ""
"If new configuration channel priorities conflict with existing channels, the "
"duplicate channel is removed and replaced according to the new priority.  If "
"the client's configuration priorities are going to be reordered by an "
"action, the {webui} requires you to confirm the change before proceeding."
msgstr "ຫາກລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນຂອງ channel ໃໝ່ຂັດແຍ້ງກັບ channel ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ, channel ທີ່ຊ້ຳກັນຈະຖືກລຶບອອກ ແລະ ແທນທີ່ຕາມລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນໃໝ່. ຫາກລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນຂອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນ client ຈະຖືກຈັດລຳດັບໃໝ່, {webui} ຈະໃຫ້ທ່ານຢືນຢັນການປ່ຽນແປງກ່ອນທີ່ຈະດຳເນີນການຕໍ່."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compare Configuration Files"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:60
msgid ""
"You can also use the system set manager (SSM) to compare the configuration "
"file deployed on clients with the configuration file stored on the "
"{productname} Server."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ system set manager (SSM) ເພື່ອປຽບທຽບໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນ clients ກັບໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ໃນ {productname} Server ໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Comparing Configuration Files"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:62
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Systems List] and "
"select the clients subscribed to the configuration files you want to "
"compare."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Systems List] ແລະ ເລືອກ clients ທີ່ສະໝັກໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການປຽບທຽບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:63
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Systems[System Set Manager], and go to the "
"menu:Configuration[Compare Files] subtab to the list of available "
"configuration files."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[System Set Manager], ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແຖບຍ່ອຍ menu:Configuration[Compare Files] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ມີຢູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:64
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: Click the number in the [guimenu]``Systems`` column to see which "
"clients are currently subscribed to the configuration file."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:65
msgid ""
"Check the configuration files to compare, and click btn:[Schedule File "
"Comparison]."
msgstr "ເລືອກໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຕ້ອງການປຽບທຽບ, ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Schedule File Comparison]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "Jinja templating on clients"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ Jinja templating ໃນ clients"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:67
msgid ""
"Jinja templating is possible on {salt} clients.  Jinja provides variables "
"from pillars or grains.  They can be used in configuration files or {salt} "
"states."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:68
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/salt/user-guide/en/latest/topics/jinja.html with "
"this example:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ https://docs.saltproject.io/salt/user-guide/en/latest/topics/jinja.html ພ້ອມກັບຕົວຢ່າງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/configuration-management.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{% if grains.os_family == 'RedHat' %}\n"
"  {% set dns_cfg = '/etc/named.conf' %}\n"
"{% elif grains.os_family == 'Debian' %}\n"
"  {% set dns_cfg = '/etc/bind/named.conf' %}\n"
"{% else %}\n"
"  {% set dns_cfg = '/etc/named.conf' %}\n"
"{% endif %}\n"
"dns_conf:\n"
"  file.managed:\n"
"    - name: {{ dns_cfg }}\n"
"    - source: salt://dns/files/named.conf\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-default.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Default Contact Method"
msgstr "ວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (Default Contact Method)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-default.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The default contact method using the {salt} protocol is recommended unless "
"there are specific needs.  By default, the {salt} Bundle implementation "
"([package]``venv-salt-minion``) will be deployed.  For more information "
"about {salt} in general, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-overview.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-default.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The default contact method ([literal]``Default``) is the best scaling "
"method.  All new {productname} features are supported."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-default.adoc:4
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-intro.adoc:16
msgid ""
"The so-called traditional contact protocol is no longer supported with "
"{productname} 5.0 and later.  Before upgrading from {productname} 4 to 5, "
"any existing traditional clients including the traditional proxies must be "
"migrated to {salt} or replaced with {salt} proxies."
msgstr "ໂປຣໂຕຄໍການຕິດຕໍ່ແບບດັ້ງເດີມ (traditional contact protocol) ແມ່ນບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບໃນ {productname} 5.0 ແລະ ເວີຊັນຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ. ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະອັບເກຣດຈາກ {productname} 4 ໄປເປັນ 5, ລູກຂ່າຍແບບດັ້ງເດີມທີ່ມີຢູ່ທັງໝົດ ລວມທັງ Proxy ແບບດັ້ງເດີມ ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຍ້າຍ (migrate) ໄປຫາ {salt} ຫຼື ປ່ຽນແທນດ້ວຍ {salt} proxies."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-default.adoc:5
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-intro.adoc:17
msgid ""
"For more information about migrating traditional {productname} 4 clients to "
"{salt} clients, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/suma/4.3/en/suse-manager/client-configuration/contact-methods-migrate-traditional.html"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຍ້າຍລູກຂ່າຍ {productname} 4 ແບບດັ້ງເດີມ ໄປເປັນລູກຂ່າຍ {salt}, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://documentation.suse.com/suma/4.3/en/suse-manager/client-configuration/contact-methods-migrate-traditional.html"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-default.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Software updates are generally pushed from the server to the client.  "
"Connections are initiated from the client.  This means you must open ports "
"on the server, not on clients.  The {salt} clients are also known as {salt} "
"minions.  {productname} Server installs a daemon on every client."
msgstr "ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ ການອັບເດດຊອບແວແມ່ນຖືກສົ່ງ (push) ຈາກເຊີເວີໄປຫາລູກຂ່າຍ. ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແມ່ນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈາກລູກຂ່າຍ. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງເປີດພອດ (ports) ຢູ່ເທິງເຊີເວີ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນຢູ່ລູກຂ່າຍ. ລູກຂ່າຍ {salt} ຍັງເປັນທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກໃນນາມ {salt} minions. {productname} Server ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງ ເດມອນ (daemon) ໄວ້ໃນທຸກໆລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-default.adoc:7
msgid ""
"If you need to use {salt} clients in a disconnected setup you can configure "
"SSH Push as a contact method.  With this contact method, clients can be "
"located in a firewall-protected zone called a DMZ.  For more information "
"about SSH Push, see "
"xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-saltssh.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ລູກຂ່າຍ {salt} ໃນຮູບແບບທີ່ບໍ່ມີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍກົງ ເເຈົ້າສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າ SSH Push ເປັນວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ໄດ້. ດ້ວຍວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ນີ້, ລູກຂ່າຍສາມາດຢູ່ໃນເຂດທີ່ຖືກປ້ອງກັນດ້ວຍໄຟວໍ (firewall) ທີ່ເອີ້ນວ່າ DMZ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ SSH Push, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-saltssh.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-default.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Onboarding Details"
msgstr "ລາຍລະອຽດການນຳເຂົ້າລະບົບ (Onboarding)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-default.adoc:9
msgid ""
"{salt} has its own database to keep the keys for the minions. This needs to "
"be kept in sync with the {productname} database.  As soon as the key is "
"accepted in {salt}, the onboarding process in {productname} starts."
msgstr "{salt} ມີຖານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງຕົນເອງເພື່ອເກັບຮັກສາກຸນແຈ (keys) ສຳລັບ minions. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຊິງໂຄໄນຊ໌ (sync) ກັບຖານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ {productname}. ທັນທີທີ່ກຸນແຈຖືກຍອມຮັບໃນ {salt}, ຂະບວນການ onboarding ໃນ {productname} ຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-default.adoc:10
msgid ""
"The onboarding process will look for existing systems in the {productname} "
"database by searching for the ``minion_id`` and the ``machine-id``.  "
"Depending on the outcome, the following scenarios are possible:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-default.adoc:11
msgid "If nothing is found, the new system gets created."
msgstr "ຖ້າບໍ່ພົບຫຍັງເລີຍ, ລະບົບໃໝ່ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-default.adoc:12
msgid ""
"In case an entry with the ``minion_id`` or the ``machine-id`` is found, that "
"system will be migrated to match the new system."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-default.adoc:13
msgid ""
"In case there is a match for both entries, and they are not the same system, "
"the onboarding will be aborted with an error."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນຕົງກັນທັງສອງຢ່າງ, ແຕ່ພວກມັນບໍ່ແມ່ນລະບົບດຽວກັນ, ການ onboarding ຈະຖືກຍົກເລີກ ແລະ ສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-default.adoc:14
msgid ""
"In this case the administrator needs to resolve the conflict by removing at "
"least one of the systems."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງໂດຍການລຶບຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງລະບົບອອກ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-intro.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client Contact Methods"
msgstr "ວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-intro.adoc:2
msgid ""
"There are three contact methods how the {productname} Server can communicate "
"with clients.  They are based on {salt} protocols."
msgstr "ມີສາມວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ທີ່ {productname} Server ສາມາດສື່ສານກັບລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້. ພວກມັນເຮັດວຽກໂດຍອີງໃສ່ໂປຣໂຕຄໍຂອງ {salt}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-intro.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Which {salt} contact method you use depends on the type of client and your "
"network architecture:"
msgstr "ວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ {salt} ທີ່ເຈົ້າຈະໃຊ້ນັ້ນ ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບປະເພດຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳເຄືອຂ່າຍຂອງເຈົ້າ:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-intro.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Default"
msgstr "ມາດຕະຖານ (Default)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-intro.adoc:5
msgid ""
"is recommended unless there are specific user needs.  By default, the {salt} "
"Bundle implementation will be deployed.  For more information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-default.adoc[]."
msgstr "ແມ່ນແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ ຍົກເວັ້ນແຕ່ມີຄວາມຕ້ອງການສະເພາະຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ການຈັດຕັ້ງປະຕິບັດ {salt} Bundle ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-default.adoc[]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-intro.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "SSH Push"
msgstr "SSH Push"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-intro.adoc:7
msgid ""
"is useful only if network restrictions make it impossible for clients to "
"establish contact to the server.  It is supported with the {salt} Bundle "
"only.  This contact method has serious limitations.  For more information, "
"see xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-saltssh.adoc[]."
msgstr "ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງເຄືອຂ່າຍເຮັດໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍບໍ່ສາມາດຕິດຕໍ່ກັບເຊີເວີໄດ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ມັນຮອງຮັບກັບ {salt} Bundle ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ນີ້ມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຫຼາຍຢ່າງ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-saltssh.adoc[]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-intro.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "SSH Push (with tunnel)"
msgstr "SSH Push (ຜ່ານທໍ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-intro.adoc:9
msgid ""
"is the same as SSH Push, but with using a secured communication tunnel.  For "
"more information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-saltssh-tunnel.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຄືກັນກັບ SSH Push, ແຕ່ໃຊ້ທໍ່ການສື່ສານທີ່ມີຄວາມປອດໄພ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-saltssh-tunnel.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-intro.adoc:10
msgid "Implementation of {salt} communication software options:"
msgstr "ການຈັດຕັ້ງປະຕິບັດຕົວເລືອກຊອບແວການສື່ສານຂອງ {salt}:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-intro.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Bundle ([package]``venv-salt-minion``)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-intro.adoc:12
msgid ""
"is a single binary package containing {salt} Minion, Python 3, required "
"Python modules, and libraries.  Thus the {salt} contact method is "
"independent from software installed on the client.  Using the {salt} Bundle "
"is the default.  It is the only supported implementation for the SSH Push or "
"SSH Push (with tunnel) contact method.  For more information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-intro.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Minion ([package]``salt-minion``)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-intro.adoc:14
msgid ""
"is {salt} software installed on the client system.  The SSH Push or SSH Push "
"(with tunnel) contact method is not supported with this Salt Minion."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-intro.adoc:15
msgid ""
"([package]``salt-minion``) is still a supported implementation for {sle} 15 "
"and derivatives (like {sle-micro}).  It is not the default, and there are a "
"number of reasons [package]``venv-salt-minion`` is preferred for "
"{productname} clients."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt Bundle"
msgstr "Salt Bundle"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "What is Salt Bundle?"
msgstr "Salt Bundle ແມ່ນຫຍັງ?"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The Salt Bundle is a single binary package containing {salt} Minion, "
"Python 3, required Python modules, and libraries."
msgstr "Salt Bundle ແມ່ນແພັກເກດໄບນາຣີດຽວທີ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍ {salt} Minion, Python 3, ໂມດູນ Python ທີ່ຈຳເປັນ, ແລະ ໄລບຣາຣີຕ່າງໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The Salt Bundle is shipped with Python 3 and all the requirements for {salt} "
"to run. Thus Salt Bundle does not use the Python version install on the "
"client as system software.  The Salt Bundle can be installed on clients that "
"do not meet the requirements for a given {salt} version."
msgstr "Salt Bundle ມາພ້ອມກັບ Python 3 ແລະ ຂໍ້ກຳນົດທັງໝົດເພື່ອໃຫ້ {salt} ສາມາດເຮັດວຽກໄດ້. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ Salt Bundle ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ໃຊ້ເວີຊັນ Python ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນລູກຂ່າຍເປັນຊອບແວລະບົບ. Salt Bundle ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງໃສ່ລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ບໍ່ມີຄຸນສົມບັດຕົງຕາມຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂອງເວີຊັນ {salt} ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:5
msgid ""
"It is also possible to use the Salt Bundle on systems that run a {salt} "
"Minion connected to a {salt} Master other than the {productname} {salt} "
"Master."
msgstr "ນອກຈາກນີ້ ຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ Salt Bundle ໃນລະບົບທີ່ໃຊ້ {salt} Minion ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ {salt} Master ອື່ນ ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ {productname} {salt} Master ໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client Registration With Salt Bundle as a Minion"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍດ້ວຍ Salt Bundle ໃນຖານະ Minion"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The registration method with the Salt Bundle is the recommended registration "
"method.  This section explains the advantages and limitations of the current "
"implementation."
msgstr "ວິທີການລົງທະບຽນດ້ວຍ Salt Bundle ແມ່ນວິທີທີ່ແນະນຳ. ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ຈະອະທິບາຍກ່ຽວກັບຂໍ້ດີ ແລະ ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງການຈັດຕັ້ງປະຕິບັດໃນປັດຈຸບັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:8
msgid ""
"The Salt Bundle is provided as the [package]``venv-salt-minion`` package "
"that consists of {salt}, Python 3, and the Python modules {salt} depends on."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Bootstrapping with {webui} is using Salt Bundle as well, so bootstrapping "
"with {webui} is not Python dependant.  Using the Salt Bundle, it is no "
"longer needed that the client provides any Python interpreter or modules."
msgstr "ການ bootstrapping ດ້ວຍ {webui} ແມ່ນໃຊ້ Salt Bundle ຄືກັນ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນການ bootstrapping ດ້ວຍ {webui} ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ຂຶ້ນກັບ Python ຂອງລະບົບ. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ Salt Bundle, ມັນບໍ່ຈຳເປັນອີກຕໍ່ໄປ ທີ່ລູກຂ່າຍຕ້ອງມີ Python interpreter ຫຼື ໂມດູນຕ່າງໆກຽມໄວ້ໃຫ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:10
msgid ""
"If you bootstrap new clients, registration with the Salt Bundle is the "
"default method.  You can switch existing clients to the Salt Bundle method.  "
"If you switch, the [package]``salt-minion`` package and its dependencies "
"will stay installed."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using the {salt} Bundle With the {salt} Minion"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ {salt} Bundle ຮ່ວມກັບ {salt} Minion"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:12
msgid ""
"The {salt} Bundle can be used with the {salt} Minion managed by the {salt} "
"Master other than {productname} Server at the same time.  If the Salt Bundle "
"is installed on a client {productname} Server will manage the configuration "
"files of the Salt Bundle, the configuration files of "
"[literal]``salt-minion`` will not be managed in this case.  For more "
"information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-cli.adoc#_salt_bundle_configuration[Salt "
"Bundle configuration]."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:13
msgid ""
"To bootstrap a client with the {salt} Minion managed by the {salt} Master "
"other than {productname} Server it is recommended to use "
"[command]``mgr-bootstrap`` [option]``--force-bundle`` when generating the "
"bootstrap script, or to set [option]``FORCE_VENV_SALT_MINION`` to `1` in the "
"bootstrap script."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:14
msgid ""
"For bootstrapping with {webui} [literal]``mgr_force_venv_salt_minion`` set "
"to [literal]``true`` pillar can be specified globally.  For more "
"information, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-states-and-pillars.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Switching From {salt} Minion to Salt Bundle"
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນຈາກ {salt} Minion ມາເປັນ Salt Bundle"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:16
msgid ""
"The {salt} state [literal]``util.mgr_switch_to_venv_minion`` is available to "
"switch from [package]``salt-minion`` to [package]``venv-salt-minion``.  It "
"is recommended to switch to [package]``venv-salt-minion`` in two steps to "
"avoid trouble with shifting processes:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: SwitchingWwith [literal]``util.mgr_switch_to_venv_minion`` State "
"to [package]``venv-salt-minion``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Apply [literal]``util.mgr_switch_to_venv_minion`` with no pillar specified "
"first.  This will result in the switch to [package]``venv-salt-minion`` with "
"copying configuration files etc.  It will not clean up the original "
"[package]``salt-minion`` configurations and its packages."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt <minion_id> state.apply util.mgr_switch_to_venv_minion\n"
msgstr "salt <minion_id> state.apply util.mgr_switch_to_venv_minion\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Apply [literal]``util.mgr_switch_to_venv_minion`` with "
"[literal]``mgr_purge_non_venv_salt`` set to [literal]``True`` to remove "
"[package]``salt-minion`` and with [literal]``mgr_purge_non_venv_salt_files`` "
"set to [literal]``True`` to remove all the files related to "
"[package]``salt-minion``.  This second step ensures the first step was "
"processed, and then removes the old configuration files and the now obsolete "
"[package]``salt-minion`` package."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"salt <minion_id> state.apply util.mgr_switch_to_venv_minion "
"pillar='{\"mgr_purge_non_venv_salt_files\": True, "
"\"mgr_purge_non_venv_salt\": True}'\n"
msgstr "salt <minion_id> state.apply util.mgr_switch_to_venv_minion pillar='{\"mgr_purge_non_venv_salt_files\": True, \"mgr_purge_non_venv_salt\": True}'\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Additional Concerns"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວນລະວັງເພີ່ມເຕີມ"

#. [WARNING]
#. ====
#. ====
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:23
msgid ""
"In case of running the second step only and the first step, state apply "
"process could fail as it requires stopping the [systemitem]``salt-minion`` "
"which is used to execute the command on the client side."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:24
msgid ""
"It is also possible to avoid installing the Salt Bundle and keep using "
"[package]``salt-minion`` instead.  In this case, specify one of these "
"options:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:25
msgid "Execute [command]``mgr-bootstrap`` with [option]``--no-bundle`` option."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Set [literal]``AVOID_VENV_SALT_MINION`` to [literal]``1`` in the generated "
"bootstrap script."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:27
msgid ""
"For bootstrap state set the [literal]``mgr_avoid_venv_salt_minion`` pillar "
"to [literal]``True`` in [path]``/srv/pillar/salt_bundle_config.sls``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "SSH Push With the Salt Bundle"
msgstr "SSH Push ຮ່ວມກັບ Salt Bundle"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:29
msgid "The Salt Bundle is also used when performing SSH Push actions to clients."
msgstr "Salt Bundle ຍັງຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເມື່ອປະຕິບັດການ SSH Push ໄປຫາລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:30
msgid ""
"A shell script deploys the Salt Bundle onto the target system without "
"installing [package]``venv-salt-minion`` before any {salt} command is "
"executed. Because the Salt Bundle contains the whole {salt} code base, no "
"[literal]``salt-thin`` is deployed.  SSH Push (including bootstrapping using "
"the {webui}) uses the Python 3 interpreter within the bundle.  The target "
"system does not need to have any other Python interpreter installed."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:31
msgid ""
"The Python 3 deployed with the Bundle is used to handle SSH Push session on "
"the client, so SSH Push (including bootstrapping with {webui}) is not "
"dependant on Python installed on the system."
msgstr "Python 3 ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງມາພ້ອມກັບ Bundle ແມ່ນຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈັດການ SSH Push session ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ SSH Push (ລວມທັງການ bootstrapping ຜ່ານ {webui}) ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ຂຶ້ນກັບ Python ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນລະບົບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Using `salt-thin` can be enabled as a fallback method, but it requires "
"Python 3 to be installed on the client.  This method is not recommended nor "
"supported and exists for development purposes only.  Set "
"[option]``web.ssh_use_salt_thin`` to `true` in the "
"[path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` configuration file."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:33
msgid ""
"The bootstrap repository must be created before bootstrapping the client "
"with {webui}.  SSH Push is using the Salt Bundle taken from the bootstrap "
"repository based on the detected target operating system.  For more "
"information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:bootstrap-repository.adoc#_prepare_to_create_a_bootstrap_repository[]."
msgstr "ຕ້ອງສ້າງ bootstrap repository ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະ bootstrap ລູກຂ່າຍດ້ວຍ {webui}. SSH Push ຈະໃຊ້ Salt Bundle ທີ່ດຶງມາຈາກ bootstrap repository ໂດຍອີງຕາມລະບົບປະຕິບັດການເປົ້າໝາຍທີ່ກວດພົບ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:bootstrap-repository.adoc#_prepare_to_create_a_bootstrap_repository[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:34
msgid ""
"SSH Push is using [path]``/var/tmp`` to deploy Salt Bundle to and execute "
"{salt} commands on the client with the bundled Python.  Therefore you must "
"not mount [path]``/var/tmp`` with the [option]``noexec`` option.  It is not "
"possible to bootstrap the clients, which have [path]``/var/tmp`` mounted "
"with [option]``noexec`` option, with the {webui} because the bootstrap "
"process is using SSH Push to reach a client."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Extend Salt Bundle With Python Packages using [literal]``pip``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:36
msgid ""
"The Salt Bundle includes [literal]``pip`` to make it possible to extend the "
"functionality of the bundled {salt} Minion with extra Python packages."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:37
msgid ""
"By default, [command]``salt <minion_id> pip.install <package-name>`` "
"installs the Python package specified by [literal]``<package_name>`` into "
"[path]``/var/lib/venv-salt-minion/local``."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:38
msgid ""
"If needed, the path [path]``/var/lib/venv-salt-minion/local`` can be "
"overridden by setting the [literal]``VENV_PIP_TARGET`` environment variable "
"for the [literal]``venv-salt-minion.service``.  It is recommended to use a "
"systemd drop-in configuration file for the service.  It could be done with "
"the configuration file "
"[path]``/etc/systemd/system/venv-salt-minion.service.d/10-pip-destination.conf``:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Service]\n"
"Environment=VENV_PIP_TARGET=/new/path/local/venv-salt-minion/pip\n"
msgstr ""
"[Service]\n"
"Environment=VENV_PIP_TARGET=/new/path/local/venv-salt-minion/pip\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc:40
msgid ""
"The Python packages installed through [literal]``pip`` are not changing on "
"updating the Salt Bundle.  To ensure that such packages are available and "
"functional after an update, it is recommended to install them with a {salt} "
"state that is applied after Salt Bundle updates."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh-tunnel.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "SSH Push (With Tunnel) Contact Method"
msgstr "ວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ແບບ SSH Push (ຜ່ານທໍ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh-tunnel.adoc:2
msgid ""
"SSH Push (with tunnel) ([literal]``ssh-push-tunnel``) is used in "
"environments where clients cannot reach the {productname} Server directly.  "
"In this environment, clients are located in a firewall-protected zone called "
"a DMZ.  No system within the DMZ is authorized to open a connection to the "
"internal network, including the {productname} Server."
msgstr ""

#.  CHECKIT: Maybe, we can delete the following sentence.  It is already
#.  described in the second "important" admonition
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh-tunnel.adoc:3
msgid ""
"In other words: SSH Push (with tunnel) also creates a reverse tunnel from "
"the client to the {productname} Server, not only from the server to the "
"client."
msgstr "ເວົ້າອີກຢ່າງໜຶ່ງຄື: SSH Push (ຜ່ານທໍ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່) ຍັງສ້າງ reverse tunnel ຈາກລູກຂ່າຍ ກັບມາຫາ {productname} Server, ບໍ່ແມ່ນແຕ່ຈາກເຊີເວີໄປຫາລູກຂ່າຍເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh-tunnel.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The server uses SSH to contact the clients at regular intervals, checking in "
"and performing scheduled actions and events."
msgstr "ເຊີເວີຈະໃຊ້ SSH ເພື່ອຕິດຕໍ່ກັບລູກຂ່າຍຕາມຊ່ວງເວລາທີ່ກຳນົດ, ເພື່ອທຳການ check-in ແລະ ປະຕິບັດຕາມແຜນງານ (actions) ແລະ ເຫດການຕ່າງໆທີ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງໄວ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh-tunnel.adoc:5
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Re-installing systems using the provisioning model is not currently "
"supported on clients managed with SSH Push."
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບໃໝ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ provisioning ແມ່ນຍັງບໍ່ທັນຮອງຮັບເທື່ອ ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຖືກຈັດການດ້ວຍ SSH Push."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh-tunnel.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The tunnel is used to provide the access to the server through the encrypted "
"tunnel.  The repositories assigned to the SSH Push client (with tunnel) are "
"provided through this tunnel only, thus it is not possible to use package "
"manager tools directly from the client system because the repositories are "
"available only while the tunnel is up.  In other words, access is only "
"possible if the session is initiated by the server.  All package managing "
"operations on the client can be performed from the server side only."
msgstr "ທໍ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (tunnel) ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຂົ້າຫາເຊີເວີຜ່ານການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ. Repositories ທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍ SSH Push (ຜ່ານທໍ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່) ຈະຖືກສະໜອງໃຫ້ຜ່ານທໍ່ນີ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືຈັດການແພັກເກດໂດຍກົງຈາກລະບົບລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້ ເພາະ repositories ຈະໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ທໍ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເປີດຢູ່ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເວົ້າອີກຢ່າງໜຶ່ງຄື, ການເຂົ້າຫາຈະເຮັດໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ ເຊີເວີເປັນຜູ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ session ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ການຈັດການແພັກເກດທັງໝົດໃນລູກຂ່າຍ ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ຈາກຝັ່ງເຊີເວີເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh-tunnel.adoc:7
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Use [literal]``mgrctl term`` before running steps inside the server "
"container."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh-tunnel.adoc:8
msgid ""
"For tunneling connections via SSH, a port number is required for tunneling "
"via HTTPS.  The port number used by default is [literal]``1233``.  To "
"overwrite it, inside the container, you can add a custom port numbers "
"greater than 1024 to [path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf``:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh-tunnel.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "ssh_push_port_https = high_port\n"
msgstr "ssh_push_port_https = high_port\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh-tunnel.adoc:10
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh-tunnel.adoc:22
msgid ""
"After changing this configuration parameter you must restart services such "
"as [systemitem]``salt-secrets-config.service``, "
"[systemitem]``tomcat.service``, and [systemitem]``taskomatic.service``.  To "
"cover all needed services, it is the best to restart the {productname} "
"Server as root.  Outside of the container, from the container host, enter:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh-tunnel.adoc:11
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh-tunnel.adoc:23
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm restart\n"
msgstr "mgradm restart\n"

#. [IMPORTANT]
#. ====
#. Use [literal]``mgrctl term`` before running steps inside the server container.
#. ====
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh-tunnel.adoc:12
msgid ""
"For security reasons, you might want to use sudo with SSH, to access the "
"system as an unprivileged user instead of as root."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຄວາມປອດໄພ, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ sudo ຮ່ວມກັບ SSH ເພື່ອເຂົ້າຫາລະບົບ ໃນຖານະຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ບໍ່ມີສິດພິເສດ (unprivileged user) ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນ root."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh-tunnel.adoc:13
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring Unprivileged SSH Access"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການເຂົ້າເຖິງ SSH ແບບບໍ່ມີສິດພິເສດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh-tunnel.adoc:14
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:32
msgid "On each client system, create an appropriate unprivileged user."
msgstr "ໃນແຕ່ລະລະບົບລູກຂ່າຍ, ໃຫ້ສ້າງຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ບໍ່ມີສິດພິເສດທີ່ເໝາະສົມຂຶ້ນມາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh-tunnel.adoc:15
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:33
msgid "On each client system, edit the [filename]``sudoers`` file:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh-tunnel.adoc:18
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<user>  ALL=NOPASSWD: /usr/bin/python3, "
"/var/tmp/venv-salt-minion/bin/python\n"
msgstr "<user>  ALL=NOPASSWD: /usr/bin/python3, /var/tmp/venv-salt-minion/bin/python\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh-tunnel.adoc:20
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:38
msgid ""
"Inside the {productname} Server container, edit the "
"[path]``/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`` configuration file, and add or amend this line "
"to include the unprivileged username:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh-tunnel.adoc:21
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "ssh_push_sudo_user = <user>\n"
msgstr "ssh_push_sudo_user = <user>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh-tunnel.adoc:24
msgid ""
"You need to use the {webui} or API to register these clients with the "
"{productname} Server."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ {webui} ຫຼື API ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍເຫຼົ່ານີ້ກັບ {productname} Server."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh-tunnel.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Before you begin, you need to ensure that you have specified which ports to "
"use for SSH tunneling.  If you have registered clients before changing the "
"port numbers, they need to be registered again with a re-activation key."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ກຳນົດພອດທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບ SSH tunneling ແລ້ວ. ຖ້າເຈົ້າໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍກ່ອນທີ່ຈະປ່ຽນໝາຍເລກພອດ, ພວກມັນຈະຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການລົງທະບຽນໃໝ່ ໂດຍໃຊ້ກຸນແຈເປີດໃຊ້ງານຄືນໃໝ່ (re-activation key)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh-tunnel.adoc:26
msgid ""
"For more information about bootstrapping, see "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການ bootstrapping, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh-tunnel.adoc:27
msgid ""
"For more information about bootstrapping, see "
"xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc#activation-keys-reactivation[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການ bootstrapping, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc#activation-keys-reactivation[]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh-tunnel.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: API Access to SSH Push (with tunnel)"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການເຂົ້າເຖິງ SSH Push (ຜ່ານທໍ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່) ຜ່ານ API"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh-tunnel.adoc:29
msgid ""
"You can use the API to manage which contact method to use.  This example "
"Python code sets the contact method to ``ssh-push-tunnel``."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh-tunnel.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"client = xmlrpclib.Server(SUMA_HOST + \"/rpc/api\", verbose=0)\n"
"key = client.auth.login(SUMA_LOGIN, SUMA_PASSWORD)\n"
"client.system.setDetails(key, 1000012345, {'contact_method' : "
"'ssh-push-tunnel'})\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh-tunnel.adoc:31
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:21
msgid "Valid values are:"
msgstr "ຄ່າທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງແມ່ນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh-tunnel.adoc:32
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:22
msgid "`default` (pull)"
msgstr "`default` (pull)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh-tunnel.adoc:33
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:23
msgid "`ssh-push`"
msgstr "`ssh-push`"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh-tunnel.adoc:34
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:24
msgid "`ssh-push-tunnel`"
msgstr "`ssh-push-tunnel`"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "SSH Push Contact Method"
msgstr "ວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ແບບ SSH Push"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:2
msgid ""
"SSH Push ([literal]``ssh-push``) is used in environments where Salt clients "
"cannot reach the {productname} Server directly.  In this environment, "
"clients are located in a firewall-protected zone called a DMZ.  No system "
"within the DMZ is authorized to open a connection to the internal network "
"where the {productname} Server is located."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:3
msgid ""
"SSH Push opens a tunnel only from {productname} to the client, but the "
"reverse channel goes directly.  Such a scenario might not work everywhere.  "
"Therefore also SSH Push (with tunnel) is available as contact method.  That "
"also opens a reverse tunnel and thus you can communicate through all "
"firewalls which otherwise might block the connection from client to server."
msgstr "SSH Push ຈະເປີດທໍ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈາກ {productname} ໄປຫາລູກຂ່າຍເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ແຕ່ຊ່ອງທາງຂາກັບ ແມ່ນໄປໂດຍກົງ. ສະຖານະການນີ້ອາດຈະໃຊ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃນທຸກໆບ່ອນ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ຈຶ່ງມີວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ແບບ SSH Push (ຜ່ານທໍ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່) ໃຫ້ເລືອກໃຊ້. ເຊິ່ງມັນຈະເປີດ reverse tunnel ນຳ ເຮັດໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດສື່ສານຜ່ານໄຟວໍທຸກໂຕທີ່ອາດຈະບລັອກການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈາກລູກຂ່າຍມາຫາເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:4
msgid ""
"SSH Push is also to use if installing a daemon agent on clients is not "
"possible."
msgstr "SSH Push ຍັງຖືກໃຊ້ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ daemon agent ໃນລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The SSH Push method has serious limitations.  It does not scale well, and "
"consumes more Server resources and network bandwidth than the plain Salt "
"method ([literal]``default``).  The Push SSH method is not at all supported "
"with large setups (1000 clients and more)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The server uses the SSH Push to contact the clients at regular intervals, "
"checking in and performing scheduled actions and events."
msgstr "ເຊີເວີໃຊ້ SSH Push ເພື່ອຕິດຕໍ່ກັບລູກຂ່າຍຕາມຊ່ວງເວລາທີ່ກຳນົດ, ເພື່ອ check-in ແລະ ປະຕິບັດຕາມແຜນງານ ແລະ ເຫດການຕ່າງໆທີ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:8
msgid ""
"This image demonstrates the SSH Push process path.  All items left of the "
"[systemitem]``Taskomatic`` block represent processes running on the "
"{productname} client."
msgstr ""

#. type: Target for macro image
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-ssh-contact-taigon.png"
msgstr "salt-ssh-contact-taigon.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:10
msgid ""
"To use SSH Push, you must have the SSH daemon running on the client, and "
"reachable by the [systemitem]``salt-api`` daemon running on the "
"{productname} Server.  Additionally, the required Python version will be "
"deployed with the {salt} Bundle on the client system."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Before beginning with the following registering procedure, define an "
"activation key with the SSH Push contact method configured.  This method "
"expects that there is a direct connection with HTTPS to the Server."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມຂັ້ນຕອນການລົງທະບຽນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດກຸນແຈເປີດໃຊ້ງານ (activation key) ທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ແບບ SSH Push ໄວ້. ວິທີນີ້ຄາດຫວັງວ່າຈະມີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍກົງ ຜ່ານ HTTPS ໄປຫາເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:12
msgid ""
"You need to use the {webui} or API to register these clients with the "
"{productname} Server.  See the following procedure or example."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ {webui} ຫຼື API ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍເຫຼົ່ານີ້ກັບ {productname} Server. ເບິ່ງຂັ້ນຕອນ ຫຼື ຕົວຢ່າງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Registering Clients With SSH Push"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍດ້ວຍ SSH Push"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:14
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Bootstrapping] and "
"complete the appropriate fields."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Bootstrapping] ແລະ ປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນໃນຊ່ອງຕ່າງໆໃຫ້ຄົບຖ້ວນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Select an activation key with the SSH Push contact method configured.  For "
"more information about activation keys, see "
"xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເລືອກກຸນແຈເປີດໃຊ້ງານທີ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ແບບ SSH Push ໄວ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບກຸນແຈເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:16
msgid "Check the [systemitem]``Manage system completely via SSH`` checkbox."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Confirm that the system has been registered correctly by navigating to "
"menu:Systems[Overview]."
msgstr "ຢືນຢັນວ່າລະບົບໄດ້ຮັບການລົງທະບຽນຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ ໂດຍໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Overview]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: API Access to Push via SSH"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການເຂົ້າເຖິງ Push ຜ່ານ SSH ຜ່ານ API"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:20
msgid ""
"You can use the API to manage which contact method to use.  This example "
"Python code sets the contact method to ``ssh-push``."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"client = xmlrpclib.Server(SUMA_HOST + \"/rpc/api\", verbose=0)\n"
"key = client.auth.login(SUMA_LOGIN, SUMA_PASSWORD)\n"
"client.system.setDetails(key, 1000012345, {'contact_method' : 'ssh-push'})\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Available Parameters"
msgstr "ພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:27
msgid ""
"When you are configuring SSH Push, you can modify parameters that are used "
"when a system is registered, including the host, activation key, and "
"password.  The password is used only for bootstrapping, it is not saved "
"anywhere.  All future SSH sessions are authorized via a key/certificate "
"pair.  These parameters are configured in menu:Systems[Bootstrapping]."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຈົ້າກຳລັງຕັ້ງຄ່າ SSH Push, ເຈົ້າສາມາດປັບປ່ຽນພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນເວລາລົງທະບຽນລະບົບໄດ້, ເຊິ່ງລວມມີ host, ກຸນແຈເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, ແລະ ລະຫັດຜ່ານ. ລະຫັດຜ່ານແມ່ນໃຊ້ສຳລັບການ bootstrapping ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ມັນຈະບໍ່ຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ບ່ອນໃດເລີຍ. SSH session ໃນອະນາຄົດທັງໝົດຈະຖືກອະນຸຍາດຜ່ານຄູ່ກຸນແຈ/ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ (key/certificate pair). ພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນຕັ້ງຄ່າຢູ່ໃນ menu:Systems[Bootstrapping]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:28
msgid ""
"You can also configure persistent parameters that are used system-wide, "
"including the sudo user to access the system as an unprivileged user instead "
"of as root."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າພາຣາມິເຕີແບບຖາວອນທີ່ໃຊ້ທົ່ວທັງລະບົບໄດ້, ລວມທັງ sudo user ເພື່ອເຂົ້າຫາລະບົບໃນຖານະຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ບໍ່ມີສິດພິເສດແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນ root."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:31
msgid ""
"Ensure you have the latest [path]``spacewalk-taskomatic`` and "
"[path]``spacewalk-certs-tools`` packages installed on the {productname} "
"Server."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:40
msgid ""
"After changing this configuration parameter you must restart services such "
"as [systemitem]``salt-secrets-config.service``, "
"[systemitem]``tomcat.service``, and [systemitem]``taskomatic.service``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:41
msgid ""
"To cover all needed services, it is the best to restart the {productname} "
"Server as root.  Outside of the container, from the container host, enter:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຄອບຄຸມທຸກເຊີວິດທີ່ຈຳເປັນ, ວິທີທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດຄືຣີສະຕາດ {productname} Server ໃນຖານະ root. ໂດຍລັນຄຳສັ່ງຈາກພາຍນອກ container (ຢູ່ທີ່ container host):"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "Action Execution"
msgstr "ການປະຕິບັດການ (Action Execution)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:44
msgid ""
"The SSH Push feature uses taskomatic to execute scheduled actions using "
"[command]``salt-ssh``.  The taskomatic job periodically checks for scheduled "
"actions and executes them.  The SSH Push feature executes a complete "
"[command]``salt-ssh`` call based on the scheduled action."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:45
msgid ""
"By default, twenty Salt SSH actions can be executed at a time.  You can "
"increase the number of actions that can be executed in parallel, by adding "
"these lines to your configuration file, and adjusting the value of "
"``parallel_threads`` upwards.  We recommend you keep the number of parallel "
"actions low, to avoid problems:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"taskomatic.sshminion_action_executor.parallel_threads = <number>\n"
"org.quartz.threadPool.threadCount = <value of parallel_threads + 20>\n"
msgstr ""
"taskomatic.sshminion_action_executor.parallel_threads = <number>\n"
"org.quartz.threadPool.threadCount = <value of parallel_threads + 20>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:47
msgid ""
"This adjusts the number of actions that can run in parallel on any one "
"client and the total number of worker threads used by taskomatic.  If "
"actions needs to be run on multiple clients, actions are always executed "
"sequentially on each client."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະປັບຈຳນວນການປະຕິບັດການທີ່ສາມາດລັນແບບຂະໜານໃນລູກຂ່າຍໃດໜຶ່ງ ແລະ ຈຳນວນ worker threads ທັງໝົດທີ່ taskomatic ໃຊ້. ຫາກຕ້ອງປະຕິບັດການ ໃນລູກຂ່າຍຫຼາຍເຄື່ອງ, ການປະຕິບັດການຈະຖືກລັນຕາມລຳດັບໃນແຕ່ລະລູກຂ່າຍສະເໝີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:48
msgid ""
"If the clients are connected through a proxy, you need to adjust the "
"``MaxSessions`` settings on the proxy.  In this case, set the number of "
"parallel connections to be three times the total number of clients."
msgstr ""

#.  FIXME: 2024-01-23, ke: to be deleted?
#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "Future Features"
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດໃນອະນາຄົດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:50
msgid ""
"There are some features that are not yet supported on SSH Push.  These "
"features do not work on Salt SSH clients:"
msgstr "ມີບາງຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນຮອງຮັບໃນ SSH Push. ຄຸນສົມບັດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະໃຊ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ Salt SSH:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:51
msgid "OpenSCAP auditing"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບ OpenSCAP (OpenSCAP auditing)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:52
msgid "Beacons, resulting in:"
msgstr "Beacons, ເຊິ່ງສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:53
msgid ""
"Installing a package on a system using [command]``zypper`` does not invoke "
"the package refresh."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:54
msgid ""
"Virtual Host functions (for example, a host to guests) does not work if the "
"virtual host system is Salt SSH-based."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນ Virtual Host (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຈາກ host ໄປຫາ guests) ຈະໃຊ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ ຖ້າລະບົບ virtual host ນັ້ນເປັນແບບ Salt SSH."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:55
msgid "For more information:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:56
msgid ""
"about Salt SSH in general, see xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-ssh.adoc[] "
"and https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/ssh/."
msgstr "ກ່ຽວກັບ Salt SSH ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-ssh.adoc[] ແລະ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/ssh/."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/contact-methods-saltssh.adoc:57
msgid ""
"about SSH key rotation, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-ssh.adoc#salt.ssh.key_rotation[]."
msgstr "ກ່ຽວກັບການໝູນວຽນກຸນແຈ SSH (SSH key rotation), ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-ssh.adoc#salt.ssh.key_rotation[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/custom-info.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Custom System Information"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນລະບົບທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/custom-info.adoc:2
msgid ""
"You can include customized system information about your clients.  System "
"information is defined as [literal]``key:value`` pairs, which can be "
"assigned to clients.  For example, you can define a [literal]``key:value "
"pair`` for a particular processor, then assign that key to all clients that "
"have that processor installed.  Custom system information is categorized, "
"and can be searched using the {productname} {webui}."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/custom-info.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Before you begin, you need to create a key that allows you to store custom "
"information."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ເຈົ້າຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງສ້າງກຸນແຈ (key) ທີ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຈົ້າເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ກຳນົດເອງໄດ້ກ່ອນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/custom-info.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a Custom System Information Key"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງກຸນແຈຂໍ້ມູນລະບົບທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/custom-info.adoc:5
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Custom System Info], "
"and click btn:[Create Key]."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Custom System Info], ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Create Key]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/custom-info.adoc:6
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Key Label`` field, add a name for your key.  Do not use "
"spaces.  For example, ``intel-x86_64-quadcore``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/custom-info.adoc:7
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Description`` field, provide any additional information "
"required."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/custom-info.adoc:8
msgid "Repeat for each key you require."
msgstr "ເຮັດຊ້ຳສຳລັບແຕ່ລະກຸນແຈທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/custom-info.adoc:9
msgid ""
"The information is available via {salt} pillar.  You can retrieve this "
"information with a command such as:"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຜ່ານ {salt} pillar. ເຈົ້າສາມາດດຶງຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງເຊັ່ນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/custom-info.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt $minionid pillar.get custom_info:key1\n"
msgstr "salt $minionid pillar.get custom_info:key1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/custom-info.adoc:11
msgid "This command will result in an output such as:"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈະສະແດງຜົນອອກມາໃນຮູບແບບເຊັ່ນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/custom-info.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$minionid:\n"
"    val1\n"
msgstr ""
"$minionid:\n"
"    val1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/custom-info.adoc:13
msgid ""
"When you have created some custom system information keys, you can apply "
"them to clients."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຈົ້າສ້າງກຸນແຈຂໍ້ມູນລະບົບທີ່ກຳນົດເອງແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດນຳພວກມັນໄປໃຊ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/custom-info.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Applying Custom Information Keys to Clients"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການນຳໃຊ້ກຸນແຈຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ກຳນົດເອງກັບລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/custom-info.adoc:15
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to [guimenu]``Systems``, click the "
"client to apply custom information to, and navigate to the "
"menu:Details[Custom Info] tab."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/custom-info.adoc:16
msgid "Click btn:[Create Value]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Create Value]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/custom-info.adoc:17
msgid "Locate the value you want to apply, and click the key label."
msgstr "ຊອກຫາຄ່າທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການນຳໃຊ້, ແລະ ຄລິກທີ່ປ້າຍຊື່ກຸນແຈ (key label)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/custom-info.adoc:18
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Value`` field, provide any additional information."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/custom-info.adoc:19
msgid "Click btn:[Update Key] to apply the custom information to the client."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Update Key] ເພື່ອນຳໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ກຳນົດເອງກັບລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/custom-info.adoc:20
msgid ""
"For more information about configuration management, see "
"xref:client-configuration:configuration-management.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຈັດການການຕັ້ງຄ່າ (configuration management), ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:configuration-management.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client Deletion"
msgstr "ການລຶບລູກຂ່າຍ"

#.  FIXME: where do we need to add warnings (suse clients only, all clients)
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:2
msgid "If you need to remove a client from your {productname} Server, you can:"
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການລຶບລູກຂ່າຍອອກຈາກ {productname} Server ຂອງເຈົ້າ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:3
msgid "use the {webui} to delete it"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ {webui} ເພື່ອລຶບມັນອອກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:4
msgid "remove a client from the command line."
msgstr "ລຶບລູກຂ່າຍອອກຜ່ານຄຳສັ່ງ (command line)."

#.  can also be done manually.
#.  FIXME: Why Manual Cleanup is necessary sometimes.
#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Delete a Client with the {webui}"
msgstr "ລຶບລູກຂ່າຍດ້ວຍ {webui}"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Deleting a Client"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:7
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[System List] and "
"select the client to delete."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[System List] ແລະ ເລືອກລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຕ້ອງການລຶບ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:8
msgid "Click btn:[Delete System]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Delete System]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:9
msgid "Check the details and click btn:[Delete Profile] to confirm."
msgstr "ກວດສອບລາຍລະອຽດ ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Delete Profile] ເພື່ອຢືນຢັນ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:10
msgid ""
"For Salt clients, {productname} attempts to clean up additional "
"configuration.  If the client cannot be contacted, you are given the option "
"to cancel the deletion, or delete the client without cleaning up the "
"configuration files."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:11
msgid ""
"You can also delete multiple clients using the System Set Manager.  For more "
"information about the System Set Manager, see "
"xref:client-configuration:system-set-manager.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດລຶບລູກຂ່າຍຫຼາຍເຄື່ອງພ້ອມກັນໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ System Set Manager. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ System Set Manager, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:system-set-manager.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Cleaning up a client only disables {salt} and stops the service if "
"possible.  It does not uninstall the package."
msgstr "ການລ້າງ (Cleaning up) ລູກຂ່າຍ ແມ່ນພຽງແຕ່ປິດການໃຊ້ງານ {salt} ແລະ ຢຸດເຊີວິດຖ້າເປັນໄປໄດ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ມັນຈະບໍ່ທຳການຖອນການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດອອກ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Delete a Client on the Command Line (with API Call)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Deleting a Client from the Server"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:15
msgid "Delete the client with the FQDN (Fully Qualified Domain Name):"
msgstr "ລຶບລູກຂ່າຍດ້ວຍ FQDN (Fully Qualified Domain Name):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacecmd system_delete FQDN\n"
msgstr "spacecmd system_delete FQDN\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:17
msgid "[command]``spacecmd system_delete`` also deletes the {salt} key."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:18
msgid "[command]``system_delete`` offers the following options:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "usage: system_delete [options] <SYSTEMS>\n"
msgstr "usage: system_delete [options] <SYSTEMS>\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    options:\n"
"          -c TYPE - Possible values:\n"
"             *  'FAIL_ON_CLEANUP_ERR' - fail in case of cleanup error,\n"
"             *  'NO_CLEANUP' - do not cleanup, just delete,\n"
"             *  'FORCE_DELETE' - try cleanup first but delete server "
"anyway\n"
"\t        in case of error\n"
msgstr ""
"    options:\n"
"          -c TYPE - ຄ່າທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້:\n"
"             *  'FAIL_ON_CLEANUP_ERR' - ໃຫ້ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວຫາກເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນການລ້າງຂໍ້ມູນ,\n"
"             *  'NO_CLEANUP' - ບໍ່ຕ້ອງລ້າງຂໍ້ມູນ, ໃຫ້ລຶບເລີຍ,\n"
"             *  'FORCE_DELETE' - ພະຍາຍາມລ້າງຂໍ້ມູນກ່ອນ ແຕ່ໃຫ້ລຶບເຊີເວີເລີຍ\n"
"\t        ຫາກເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ\n"

#
#. // move to Trouble Shooting and link from here
#. Sometimes a new registration of a deleted (unregistered) client might not be possible.
#. To solve this issue, some Salt cache files should be deleted on the {productname} Server (Salt master) before trying to re-register again:
#. ----
#. rm /var/cache/salt/master/thin/version
#. rm /var/cache/salt/master/thin/thin.tgz
#. ----
#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Delete a Client from the Command Line"
msgstr ""

#. === Salt Client
#.  Manual Registration Cleanup
#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:22
msgid ""
"This process is for {productname} clients only.  Do not run it on the "
"{productname} Server itself."
msgstr "ຂະບວນການນີ້ແມ່ນສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍ {productname} ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຫ້າມລັນມັນຢູ່ໃນ {productname} Server ໂດຍຕົງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:23
msgid ""
"You must not execute the following procedure on clients running {rhel}, "
"{debian}, or clones.  Instead of [command]``zypper`` use equivalent packager "
"commands such as [command]``yum``, [command]``dnf``, or [command]``apt``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Deleting SLES 12 and 15 Clients"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:25
msgid "Stop the salt-minion service:"
msgstr "ຢຸດເຊີວິດ salt-minion:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl stop salt-minion\n"
msgstr "systemctl stop salt-minion\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:27
msgid "Remove the repositories and configuration files:"
msgstr "ລຶບ repositories ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າອອກ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rm -f /etc/zypp/repos.d/susemanager\\:bootstrap.repo\n"
"rm -f /etc/zypp/repos.d/susemanager\\:channels.repo\n"
"rm -r /etc/sysconfig/rhn/\n"
"rm -r /etc/salt/\n"
msgstr ""
"rm -f /etc/zypp/repos.d/susemanager\\:bootstrap.repo\n"
"rm -f /etc/zypp/repos.d/susemanager\\:channels.repo\n"
"rm -r /etc/sysconfig/rhn/\n"
"rm -r /etc/salt/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:29
msgid "Remove Client Packages:"
msgstr "ລຶບແພັກເກດລູກຂ່າຍອອກ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper rm salt salt-minion python*-salt sle-manager-tools-release\n"
msgstr "zypper rm salt salt-minion python*-salt sle-manager-tools-release\n"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Salt Bundle Client - Manual Registration Cleanup"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:32
msgid "To unregister, run:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອຍົກເລີກການລົງທະບຽນ, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"systemctl stop venv-salt-minion\n"
"zypper rm -y venv-salt-minion sle-manager-tools-release\n"
"rm -f /etc/zypp/repos.d/susemanager\\:bootstrap.repo\n"
"rm -f /etc/zypp/repos.d/susemanager\\:channels.repo\n"
"rm -r /etc/venv-salt-minion/*\n"
msgstr ""
"systemctl stop venv-salt-minion\n"
"zypper rm -y venv-salt-minion sle-manager-tools-release\n"
"rm -f /etc/zypp/repos.d/susemanager\\:bootstrap.repo\n"
"rm -f /etc/zypp/repos.d/susemanager\\:channels.repo\n"
"rm -r /etc/venv-salt-minion/*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:34
msgid "Remove client machine ID:"
msgstr "ລຶບ machine ID ຂອງລູກຂ່າຍອອກ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "rm /etc/sysconfig/rhn/systemid\n"
msgstr "rm /etc/sysconfig/rhn/systemid\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/delete-clients.adoc:36
msgid ""
"For information about the {salt} bundle, see "
"xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບ {salt} bundle, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/gpg-keys.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "GPG Keys"
msgstr "ກຸນແຈ GPG"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/gpg-keys.adoc:3
msgid ""
"In most cases, you do not need to adjust the GPG settings to be able to "
"install software on your clients."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ເຈົ້າບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ GPG ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດ ຕິດຕັ້ງຊອບແວໃນລູກຂ່າຍຂອງເຈົ້າໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/gpg-keys.adoc:4
msgid ""
"RPM packages can be signed directly, while Debian based systems sign only "
"the metadata and use a chain of checksums to secure the packages.  Most RPM "
"based systems use signed metadata in addition to signed packages."
msgstr "ແພັກເກດ RPM ສາມາດຖືກເຊັນກຳກັບ (signed) ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ລະບົບທີ່ອີງໃສ່ Debian ຈະເຊັນກຳກັບສະເພາະ metadata ແລະ ໃຊ້ລະບົບ checksum ເພື່ອຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງແພັກເກດ. ລະບົບທີ່ອີງໃສ່ RPM ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຈະໃຊ້ metadata ທີ່ຖືກເຊັນກຳກັບ ນອກເໜືອໄປຈາກແພັກເກດທີ່ຖືກເຊັນກຳກັບ."

#
#
#
#
#
#. From Ref Guide, needs editing. --LKB 2020-09-08
#. Lists keys and certificates available for inclusion in {kickstart} profiles and provides a means to create new ones.
#. This is especially important for customers of {productname} or the Proxy Server because systems kickstarted by them must have the server key imported into {productname} and associated with the relevant {kickstart} profiles.
#. Import a profile by creating a new key on this page and then make the profile association in the [guimenu]``GPG and SSL keys`` subtab of the [guimenu]``Autoinstallation Details`` page.
#. To create a key or certificate, click the [guimenu]``Create Stored Key/Cert`` link in the upper-right corner of the page.
#. Enter a description, select the type, upload the file, and click the btn:[Update Key] button.
#. A unique description is required.
#. [IMPORTANT]
#. ====
#. The GPG key you upload to {productname} must be in ASCII format.
#. Using a GPG key in binary format causes anaconda, and therefore the {kickstart} process, to fail.
#. ====
#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Package Management"
msgstr "ການຈັດການແພັກເກດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:2
msgid "Clients use packages to install, uninstall, and upgrade software."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍໃຊ້ແພັກເກດເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ, ຖອນການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ແລະ ອັບເກຣດຊອບແວ."

#.  available subtabs:
#.      List / Remove
#.      Upgrade
#.      Install
#.      Lock / Unlock
#.      Profiles
#.      Non Compliant
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To manage packages on a client, navigate to [guimenu]``Systems``, click the "
"client to manage, and navigate to the menu:Systems[Software > Packages] "
"subtab.  The options available in this section vary depending on the type of "
"client you have selected, and its current channel subscriptions."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Most package management actions can be added to action chains.  For more "
"about action chains, see xref:reference:schedule/action-chains.adoc[]."
msgstr "ການປະຕິບັດການຈັດການແພັກເກດສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ ສາມາດເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ action chains ໄດ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ action chains, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:reference:schedule/action-chains.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:5
msgid ""
"When packages are installed or upgraded, licenses or EULAs are automatically "
"accepted."
msgstr "ເມື່ອມີການຕິດຕັ້ງ ຫຼື ອັບເກຣດແພັກເກດ, ໃບອະນຸຍາດ ຫຼື EULAs ຈະຖືກຍອມຮັບໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compare Packages Using Profiles"
msgstr "ການປຽບທຽບແພັກເກດໂດຍໃຊ້ Profile"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:7
msgid ""
"You can compare the packages installed on a client with a stored profile, or "
"with packages installed on another client.  When the comparison is made, you "
"can choose to modify the selected client to match."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດປຽບທຽບແພັກເກດທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ ກັບ profile ທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້, ຫຼື ກັບແພັກເກດ ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນລູກຂ່າຍອື່ນໄດ້. ເມື່ອທຳການປຽບທຽບແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເລືອກປັບປຸງ ລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ເລືອກໃຫ້ຕົງກັນໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:8
msgid ""
"To compare packages against a profile, you need to have stored a profile.  "
"Profiles are created from the packages on a currently installed client.  "
"When the profile has been created, you can use it to install more clients "
"with the same packages installed."
msgstr "ເພື່ອປຽບທຽບແພັກເກດກັບ profile, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງມີ profile ທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້ກ່ອນ. Profile ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈາກແພັກເກດຕ່າງໆທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ. ເມື່ອ profile ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ມັນເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງລູກຂ່າຍອື່ນໆ ໃຫ້ມີແພັກເກດທີ່ຄືກັນໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a Stored Profile"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງ Profile ທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:10
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to [guimenu]``Systems``, click the "
"client to base your profile off, and navigate to the menu:Systems[Software > "
"Packages > Profiles] subtab."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:11
msgid "Click btn:[Create System Profile]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Create System Profile]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:12
msgid "Type a name and description for your profile and click btn:[Create Profile]."
msgstr "ປ້ອນຊື່ ແລະ ຄຳອະທິບາຍສຳລັບ profile ຂອງເຈົ້າ ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Create Profile]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Comparing Client Packages"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປຽບທຽບແພັກເກດລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:14
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to [guimenu]``Systems``, click the "
"client to compare, and navigate to the menu:Systems[Software > Packages > "
"Profiles] subtab."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:15
msgid ""
"To compare with a stored profile, select the profile and click "
"btn:[Compare]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອປຽບທຽບກັບ profile ທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ profile ນັ້ນ ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Compare]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:16
msgid ""
"To compare with another client, select the client name and click "
"btn:[Compare] to see a list of differences between the two clients."
msgstr "ເພື່ອປຽບທຽບກັບລູກຂ່າຍອື່ນ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຊື່ລູກຂ່າຍນັ້ນ ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Compare] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍການຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງລະຫວ່າງລູກຂ່າຍທັງສອງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Orphaned Packages"
msgstr "ແພັກເກດທີ່ຖືກປະລະ (Orphaned Packages)"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Orphaned packages are packages synchronized by {productname} that are not "
"associated with a software channel.  Therefore, orphaned packages are "
"usually not available to {productname} clients and users cannot install such "
"packages without additional effort."
msgstr "ແພັກເກດທີ່ຖືກປະລະ ແມ່ນແພັກເກດທີ່ຖືກຊິງໂຄໄນຊ໌ໂດຍ {productname} ແຕ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເຊື່ອມໂຍງ ກັບແຊນແນວຊອບແວໃດໆ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວລູກຂ່າຍ {productname} ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດ ເຂົ້າເຖິງແພັກເກດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້ ແລະ ຜູ້ໃຊ້ກໍບໍ່ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງພວກມັນໄດ້ຫາກບໍ່ມີການຈັດການເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:19
msgid "A package can become orphaned as a result of one of the following events:"
msgstr "ແພັກເກດສາມາດກາຍເປັນແພັກເກດທີ່ຖືກປະລະໄດ້ ຈາກເຫດການໃດໜຶ່ງດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:20
msgid ""
"A synchronized repository removes a package.  By default, {productname} "
"unlinks such a package from the channel, but does not remove the package."
msgstr "repository ທີ່ຖືກຊິງໂຄໄນຊ໌ໄດ້ລຶບແພັກເກດອອກ. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, {productname} ຈະຍົກເລີກການເຊື່ອມໂຍງແພັກເກດນັ້ນອອກຈາກແຊນແນວ, ແຕ່ຈະບໍ່ລຶບແພັກເກດອອກ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:21
msgid ""
"A repository supersedes a package with a newer version and thus removes the "
"previous version."
msgstr "repository ມີແພັກເກດເວີຊັນໃໝ່ມາປ່ຽນແທນ ແລະ ຈຶ່ງລຶບເວີຊັນກ່ອນໜ້າອອກ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:22
msgid ""
"The reposync process got interrupted (for example, because of an out of "
"space exception) and thus downloaded packages were not associated with a "
"channel."
msgstr "ຂະບວນການ reposync ຖືກຂັດຈັງຫວະ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເນື່ອງຈາກພື້ນທີ່ຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນເຕັມ) ເຮັດໃຫ້ແພັກເກດທີ່ດາວໂຫລດມາແລ້ວ ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເຊື່ອມໂຍງເຂົ້າກັບແຊນແນວ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Users manually uploaded packages, but did not associate them with any "
"channel."
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ອັບໂຫລດແພັກເກດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ແຕ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຊື່ອມໂຍງພວກມັນເຂົ້າກັບແຊນແນວໃດໆ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Orphaned packages cost space in user environment and cannot be easily "
"distributed to clients because they are not associated with a channel.  "
"Orphaned package can make sense with specific workflows like bootstrapping "
"or customer-specific procedures."
msgstr "ແພັກເກດທີ່ຖືກປະລະ ຈະກິນພື້ນທີ່ໃນລະບົບ ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດແຈກຈ່າຍໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້ໂດຍງ່າຍ ເນື່ອງຈາກພວກມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບແຊນແນວ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ແພັກເກດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ອາດມີປະໂຫຍດ ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກສະເພາະ ເຊັ່ນ ການ bootstrapping ຫຼື ຂັ້ນຕອນສະເພາະຂອງລູກຄ້າ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:25
msgid ""
"You can view orphaned packages in the {webui} by clicking "
"menu:Software[Manage > Packages > view Packages in no channel]."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດເບິ່ງແພັກເກດທີ່ຖືກປະລະໄດ້ໃນ {webui} ໂດຍຄລິກທີ່ menu:Software[Manage > Packages > view Packages in no channel]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:26
msgid ""
"{productname} periodically runs a taskomatic job that searches for orphaned "
"packages and modifies the package organization ID to 1.  This means that you "
"can delete orphaned packages only after the taskomatic job execution.  If "
"you encounter an orphaned package that you cannot delete, wait 24 hours and "
"try the deletion again."
msgstr "{productname} ຈະລັນງານ taskomatic ເປັນໄລຍະເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາແພັກເກດທີ່ຖືກປະລະ ແລະ ປ່ຽນແປງ ID ອົງກອນຂອງແພັກເກດໃຫ້ເປັນ 1. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າເຈົ້າຈະສາມາດລຶບ ແພັກເກດທີ່ຖືກປະລະໄດ້ ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ງານ taskomatic ເຮັດວຽກແລ້ວເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຫາກເຈົ້າພົບ ແພັກເກດທີ່ຖືກປະລະແລ້ວລຶບບໍ່ໄດ້, ໃຫ້ລໍຖ້າ 24 ຊົ່ວໂມງແລ້ວລອງລຶບໃໝ່ອີກຄັ້ງ."

#.  .Procedure: Deleting orphaned packages
#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:27
msgid "Delete orphaned packages:"
msgstr "ການລຶບແພັກເກດທີ່ຖືກປະລະ:"

#.  * With the UI (FIXME is this possible?  How?
#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:28
msgid "with command line tools targeting individual packages. For example:"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືຜ່ານຄຳສັ່ງເພື່ອລຶບແພັກເກດແຕ່ລະໂຕ. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacecmd package_remove zypper-1.14.52-150400.1.9.x86_64\n"
msgstr "spacecmd package_remove zypper-1.14.52-150400.1.9.x86_64\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:30
msgid "with command line tools targeting all orphaned packages at once:"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືຜ່ານຄຳສັ່ງເພື່ອລຶບແພັກເກດທີ່ຖືກປະລະທັງໝົດໃນຄັ້ງດຽວ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/package-management.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacecmd package_removeorphans\n"
msgstr "spacecmd package_removeorphans\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Patch Management"
msgstr "ການຈັດການແພັດ (Patch Management)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:2
msgid ""
"You can use custom patches within your organization to manage clients.  This "
"allows you to issue patch alerts for packages in custom channels, schedule "
"patch installation, and manage patches across organizations."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ແພັດ (patches) ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງພາຍໃນອົງກອນຂອງເຈົ້າເພື່ອຈັດການລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດແຈ້ງເຕືອນແພັດສຳລັບແພັກເກດໃນແຊນແນວທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ກຳນົດເວລາການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັດ, ແລະ ຈັດການແພັດໃນແຕ່ລະອົງກອນໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create Patches"
msgstr "ການສ້າງແພັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To use a custom patch, you need to create the patch, add packages to it and "
"add it to one or more channels."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຊ້ແພັດທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງສ້າງແພັດ, ເພີ່ມແພັກເກດເຂົ້າໄປ ແລະ ເພີ່ມແພັດນັ້ນເຂົ້າໃນແຊນແນວໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a Custom Patch"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງແພັດທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:6
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Patches[Manage Patches], "
"click btn:[Create Patch]."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Patches[Manage Patches], ຄລິກ btn:[Create Patch]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:7
msgid "In the ``Create Patch`` section, use these details:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:8
msgid "In the ``Synopsis`` field, type a short description of the patch."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:9
msgid "In the ``Advisory`` field, type a label for the patch."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:10
msgid ""
"We recommend you devise a naming convention for your organization to make "
"patch management easier."
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຈົ້າກຳນົດຮູບແບບການຕັ້ງຊື່ສຳລັບອົງກອນຂອງເຈົ້າ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຈັດການແພັດງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:11
msgid "In the ``Advisory Release`` field, enter a release number for your patch."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:12
msgid "For example, if this is the first version of this patch, use ``1``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:13
msgid "In the ``Advisory Type`` field, select the type of patch to use."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:14
msgid "For example, ``Bug Fix Advisory`` for a patch that fixes errors."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:15
msgid ""
"If you selected an advisory type of ``Security Advisory``, in the ``Advisory "
"Severity`` field, select the severity level to use."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:16
msgid "In the ``Product`` field, type the name of the product this patch refers to."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:17
msgid "OPTIONAL: In the ``Author`` field, type the name of the author of the patch."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Complete the ``Topic``, ``Description``, and ``Solution`` fields with "
"further information about the patch."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:19
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: In the ``Bugs`` section, specify the information of any related "
"bugs, using these details:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:20
msgid "In the ``ID`` field, enter the bug number."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:21
msgid "In the ``Summary`` field, type a short description of the bug."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:22
msgid "In the ``Bugzilla URL`` field, type the address of the bug."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:23
msgid "In the ``Keywords`` field, type any keywords related to the bug."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:24
msgid "Use a comma between each keyword."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຈຸດ (comma) ຂັ້ນລະຫວ່າງແຕ່ລະຄຳສຳຄັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Complete the ``References`` and ``Notes`` fields with further information "
"about the bug."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:26
msgid "Select one or more channels to add the new patch to."
msgstr "ເລືອກແຊນແນວໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່ານັ້ນເພື່ອເພີ່ມແພັດໃໝ່ນີ້ເຂົ້າໄປ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:27
msgid "Click btn:[Create Patch]."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Create Patch]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:28
msgid ""
"You can also create patches by cloning an existing one.  Cloning preserves "
"package associations and simplifies issuing patches."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດສ້າງແພັດໄດ້ໂດຍການໂຄລນ (cloning) ຈາກແພັດທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ. ການໂຄລນຈະຮັກສາການເຊື່ອມໂຍງແພັກເກດໄວ້ ແລະ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການອອກແພັດງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Cloning Patches"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການໂຄລນແພັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:30
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Patches[Clone Patches]."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Patches[Clone Patches]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:31
msgid ""
"In the ``View patches potentially applicable to:`` field, select the "
"software channel for the patch you want to clone."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Select the patch or patches you want to clone, and click btn:[Clone "
"Patches]."
msgstr "ເລືອກແພັດທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໂຄລນ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Clone Patches]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:33
msgid "Select one or more channels to add the cloned patch to."
msgstr "ເລືອກແຊນແນວໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່ານັ້ນເພື່ອເພີ່ມແພັດທີ່ໂຄລນມາເຂົ້າໄປ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:34
msgid "Confirm the details to begin the clone."
msgstr "ຢືນຢັນລາຍລະອຽດເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການໂຄລນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:35
msgid "When you have created a patch, you can assign packages to it."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຈົ້າສ້າງແພັດແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດກຳນົດແພັກເກດໃຫ້ກັບແພັດນັ້ນໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Assigning Packages to a Patch"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຳນົດແພັກເກດໃຫ້ກັບແພັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:37
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Patches[Manage Patches], and "
"click the the advisory name of the patch to see the patch details."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:38
msgid "Navigate to the menu:Packages[Add] tab."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Packages[Add]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:39
msgid ""
"In the ``Channel`` field, select the software channel that contains the "
"packages you want to assign to the patch, and click btn:[View Packages]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:40
msgid ""
"You can select ``All managed packages`` to see the available packages in all "
"channels."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:41
msgid "Check the packages you want to include, and click btn:[Add Packages]."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລືອກແພັກເກດທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການລວມເຂົ້າ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Add Packages]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:42
msgid ""
"Confirm the details of the packages, and click btn:[Confirm] to assign them "
"to the patch."
msgstr "ຢືນຢັນລາຍລະອຽດຂອງແພັກເກດ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Confirm] ເພື່ອກຳນົດພວກມັນໃຫ້ກັບແພັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:43
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Packages[List/Remove] tab to check that the packages "
"have been assigned correctly."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Packages[List/Remove] ເພື່ອກວດສອບວ່າແພັກເກດໄດ້ຖືກກຳນົດຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:44
msgid ""
"When packages are assigned to a patch, the patch cache is updated to reflect "
"the changes.  The cache update might take a couple of minutes."
msgstr "ເມື່ອມີການກຳນົດແພັກເກດໃຫ້ກັບແພັດ, patch cache ຈະຖືກອັບເດດເພື່ອສະແດງການປ່ຽນແປງ. ການອັບເດດແຄຊ (cache) ອາດຈະໃຊ້ເວລາສອງສາມນາທີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:45
msgid ""
"If you need to change the details of an existing patch, you can do so from "
"the [guimenu]``Patches Management`` page."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Editing and Deleting Existing Patch Alerts"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການແກ້ໄຂ ແລະ ລຶບການແຈ້ງເຕືອນແພັດທີ່ມີຢູ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:47
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Patches[Manage Patches]."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Patches[Manage Patches]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:48
msgid "Click the advisory name of the patch to see the patch details."
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ advisory ຂອງແພັດເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:49
msgid "Make the changes as required, and click btn:[Update Patch]."
msgstr "ທຳການປ່ຽນແປງຕາມທີ່ຕ້ອງການ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Update Patch]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:50
msgid ""
"To delete a patch, select the patch in the [guimenu]``Patches Management`` "
"page, and click btn:[Delete Patches]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:51
msgid "Deleting patches might take a few minutes."
msgstr "ການລຶບແພັດອາດຈະໃຊ້ເວລາສອງສາມນາທີ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "Apply Patches to Clients"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ແພັດກັບລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:53
msgid ""
"When a patch is ready, you can apply it to clients either singly, or with "
"other patches."
msgstr "ເມື່ອແພັດພ້ອມແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດນຳມັນໄປໃຊ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້ທັງແບບແພັດດຽວ ຫຼື ພ້ອມກັບແພັດອື່ນໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:54
msgid ""
"Each package within a patch is part of one or more channels.  If the client "
"is not subscribed to the channel, the update is not installed."
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະແພັກເກດພາຍໃນແພັດແມ່ນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງແຊນແນວໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່ານັ້ນ. ຖ້າລູກຂ່າຍ ບໍ່ໄດ້ສະໝັກໃຊ້ແຊນແນວນັ້ນ, ການອັບເດດຈະບໍ່ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:55
msgid ""
"If the client has a more recent version of a package already installed, the "
"update is not installed.  If the client has an older version of the package "
"installed, the package is upgraded."
msgstr "ຖ້າລູກຂ່າຍມີແພັກເກດເວີຊັນໃໝ່ກວ່າຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ການອັບເດດຈະບໍ່ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງ. ຖ້າລູກຂ່າຍມີແພັກເກດເວີຊັນເກົ່າກວ່າຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່, ແພັກເກດນັ້ນຈະຖືກອັບເກຣດ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:56
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Applying All Applicable Patches"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການນຳໃຊ້ແພັດທັງໝົດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:57
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Overview] and select "
"the client you want to update."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Overview] ແລະ ເລືອກລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການອັບເດດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:58
msgid "Navigate to the menu:Software[Patches] tab."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Software[Patches]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:59
msgid "Click btn:[Select All] to select all applicable patches."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Select All] ເພື່ອເລືອກແພັດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງທັງໝົດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:60
msgid "Click btn:[Apply Patches] to update the client."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Apply Patches] ເພື່ອອັບເດດລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:61
msgid ""
"If you are signed in with Administrator privileges, you can also perform "
"larger batch upgrades for clients."
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບດ້ວຍສິດຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ (Administrator), ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດ ທຳການອັບເກຣດແບບກຸ່ມໃຫຍ່ (batch upgrades) ໃຫ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Applying a Single Patch to Multiple Clients"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການນຳໃຊ້ແພັດດຽວໃຫ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍຫຼາຍເຄື່ອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:63
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Patches[Patch List]."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Patches[Patch List]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:64
msgid ""
"Locate the patch you want to apply, and click the number under the "
"``Systems`` column for that patch."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:65
msgid ""
"Select the clients you want to apply the patch to, and click btn:[Apply "
"Patches]."
msgstr "ເລືອກລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການນຳໃຊ້ແພັດ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Apply Patches]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:66
msgid "Confirm the list of clients to perform the update."
msgstr "ຢືນຢັນລາຍຊື່ລູກຂ່າຍເພື່ອດຳເນີນການອັບເດດ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Applying Multiple Patches to Multiple Clients"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການນຳໃຊ້ຫຼາຍແພັດໃຫ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍຫຼາຍເຄື່ອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:68
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Overview] and check "
"the clients you want to update to add them to the system set manager."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Overview] ແລະ ໝາຍເລືອກ ລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການອັບເດດເພື່ອເພີ່ມພວກມັນເຂົ້າໃນ system set manager."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:69
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Systems[System Set Manager] and naviagte to the "
"[guimenu]``Patches`` tab."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:70
msgid ""
"Select the patches you want to apply to the clients and click btn:[Apply "
"Patches]."
msgstr "ເລືອກແພັດທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການນຳໃຊ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍ ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Apply Patches]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:71
msgid "Schedule a date and time for the update to occur, and click btn:[Confirm]."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວັນທີ ແລະ ເວລາທີ່ຈະໃຫ້ທຳການອັບເດດ, ແລ້ວຄລິກ btn:[Confirm]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:72
msgid ""
"To check the progress of the update, navigate to menu:Schedule[Pending "
"Actions]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕິດຕາມຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຂອງການອັບເດດ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Schedule[Pending Actions]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/patch-management.adoc:73
msgid ""
"Scheduled package updates are installed using the contact method configured "
"for each client.  For more information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-intro.adoc[]."
msgstr "ການອັບເດດແພັກເກດທີ່ກຳນົດເວລາໄວ້ ຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໂດຍໃຊ້ວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ສຳລັບ ແຕ່ລະລູກຂ່າຍ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-intro.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/power-management.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Power Management"
msgstr "ການຈັດການພະລັງງານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/power-management.adoc:3
msgid ""
"You can power on, power off, and reboot clients using the {productname} "
"{webui}."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດເປີດເຄື່ອງ, ປິດເຄື່ອງ, ແລະ ຣີບູດລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້ ໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/power-management.adoc:4
msgid ""
"This feature uses either the IPMI or Redfish protocol and is managed using a "
"{cobbler} profile.  The selected client must have a power management "
"controller supporting one of these protocols."
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ໃຊ້ໂປຣໂຕຄໍ IPMI ຫຼື Redfish ແລະ ຖືກຈັດການໂດຍໃຊ້ {cobbler} profile. ລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ເລືອກຕ້ອງມີຕົວຄວບຄຸມການຈັດການພະລັງງານທີ່ຮອງຮັບໜຶ່ງໃນໂປຣໂຕຄໍເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/power-management.adoc:5
msgid ""
"For Redfish, ensure you can establish a valid SSL connection between the "
"client and the {productname} Server.  You must have trusted the certificate "
"authority used to sign the SSL Server Certificate of the Redfish management "
"controller.  The CA certificate must be in [literal]``.pem`` format, and "
"stored on the {productname} Server at [path]``/etc/pki/trust/anchors/``.  "
"When you have saved the certificate, run [command]``update-ca-certificate``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/power-management.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Enabling Power Management"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເປີດໃຊ້ງານການຈັດການພະລັງງານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/power-management.adoc:7
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Systems List], select "
"the client you want to manage, and navigate to the menu:Provisioning[Power "
"Management] tab."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Systems List], ເລືອກລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຕ້ອງການຈັດການ, ແລະ ໄປທີ່ແທັບ menu:Provisioning[Power Management]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/power-management.adoc:8
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Type`` field, select the power management protocol to use."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/power-management.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Complete the details for the power management server, and click the "
"appropriate button for the action to take, or click btn:[Save only] to save "
"the details without taking any action."
msgstr "ຕື່ມລາຍລະອຽດຂອງເຊີເວີຈັດການພະລັງງານໃຫ້ຄົບຖ້ວນ, ແລະ ຄລິກປຸ່ມທີ່ເໝາະສົມສຳລັບ ການປະຕິບັດການທີ່ຕ້ອງການ, ຫຼື ຄລິກ btn:[Save only] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກລາຍລະອຽດໂດຍບໍ່ທຳການໃດໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/power-management.adoc:10
msgid ""
"You can apply power management actions to multiple clients at the same time "
"by adding them to the system set manager.  For more information about using "
"the system set manager, see "
"xref:client-configuration:system-set-manager.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ການປະຕິບັດການຈັດການພະລັງງານກັບລູກຂ່າຍຫຼາຍເຄື່ອງໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ ໂດຍການເພີ່ມພວກມັນເຂົ້າໃນ system set manager. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ system set manager, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:system-set-manager.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/power-management.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Power Management and {cobbler}"
msgstr "ການຈັດການພະລັງງານ ແລະ {cobbler}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/power-management.adoc:12
msgid ""
"The first time you use a power management feature, a {cobbler} system record "
"is automatically created, if one does not yet exist for the client.  These "
"automatically created system records are not bootable from the network, and "
"include a reference to a dummy system image.  This is needed because "
"{cobbler} does not currently support system records without profiles or "
"images."
msgstr "ຄັ້ງທຳອິດທີ່ເຈົ້າໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດການຈັດການພະລັງງານ, ຂໍ້ມູນລະບົບ {cobbler} (system record) ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ຫາກຍັງບໍ່ທັນມີຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍນັ້ນ. ຂໍ້ມູນລະບົບທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດບູດຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍໄດ້, ແລະ ຈະມີການອ້າງອີງເຖິງ dummy system image. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈຳເປັນເພາະວ່າໃນປັດຈຸບັນ {cobbler} ຍັງບໍ່ຮອງຮັບຂໍ້ມູນລະບົບທີ່ບໍ່ມີ profile ຫຼື images."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/power-management.adoc:13
msgid ""
"{cobbler} power management uses fence-agent tools to support protocols other "
"than IPMI.  Only IPMI and Redfish protocols are supported by {productname}.  "
"You can configure your client to use other protocols by adding the "
"fence-agent names as a comma-separated list to the "
"[option]``java.power_management.types`` configuration parameter in the "
"[path]``rhn.conf`` configuration files."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/products.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Software Products"
msgstr "ຜະລິດຕະພັນຊອບແວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/products.adoc:2
msgid ""
"In {productname}, software is made available in products.  Your {suse} "
"subscription allows you to access a range of different products, which you "
"can browse and select in the {productname} {webui} by navigating to "
"menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Products]."
msgstr "ໃນ {productname}, ຊອບແວຈະຖືກຈັດໄວ້ໃນຮູບແບບຜະລິດຕະພັນ. ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ (subscription) {suse} ຂອງເຈົ້າ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າເຂົ້າເຖິງຜະລິດຕະພັນຕ່າງໆໄດ້ຫຼາຍຢ່າງ, ເຊິ່ງເຈົ້າສາມາດ ເລືອກເບິ່ງ ແລະ ເລືອກໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname} ໂດຍໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Products]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/products.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Products contain any number of software channels.  Click the `Show product's "
"channels` icon to see the channels included in the product.  When you have "
"added a product and synchronized successfully, you have access to the "
"channels provided by the product, and can use the packages in the product on "
"your {productname} Server and clients."
msgstr "ຜະລິດຕະພັນຈະປະກອບມີແຊນແນວຊອບແວຈຳນວນໜຶ່ງ. ຄລິກທີ່ໄອຄອນ `Show product's channels` ເພື່ອເບິ່ງແຊນແນວທີ່ລວມຢູ່ໃນຜະລິດຕະພັນນັ້ນ. ເມື່ອເຈົ້າເພີ່ມຜະລິດຕະພັນ ແລະ ຊິງໂຄໄນຊ໌ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າຈະສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງແຊນແນວທີ່ຜະລິດຕະພັນນັ້ນສະໜອງໃຫ້, ແລະ ສາມາດໃຊ້ແພັກເກດໃນຜະລິດຕະພັນນັ້ນ ໃນ {productname} Server ແລະ ລູກຂ່າຍຂອງເຈົ້າໄດ້."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register Clients With a Bootstrap Script"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍດ້ວຍສຄຣິບ Bootstrap"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Registering clients with a bootstrap script gives you control over "
"parameters, and can help if you have to register a large number of clients "
"at once."
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍດ້ວຍສຄຣິບ bootstrap ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດຄວບຄຸມພາຣາມິເຕີຕ່າງໆໄດ້, ແລະ ຊ່ວຍໄດ້ຫຼາຍຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍຈຳນວນຫຼາຍໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To register clients using a bootstrap script, we recommend you create a "
"template bootstrap script to begin, which can then be copied and modified.  "
"The bootstrap script you create is executed on the client when it is "
"registered, and ensures all the necessary packages are deployed to the "
"client.  Some parameters in the bootstrap script ensure the client system "
"can be assigned to its base channel, using activation key and GPG key."
msgstr "ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍໂດຍໃຊ້ສຄຣິບ bootstrap, ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສ້າງສຄຣິບ bootstrap ຕົ້ນແບບກ່ອນ, ຈາກນັ້ນຈຶ່ງກ່າຍ ແລະ ປັບແຕ່ງຕາມຕ້ອງການ. ສຄຣິບ bootstrap ທີ່ເຈົ້າສ້າງ ຈະຖືກລັນຢູ່ໃນລູກຂ່າຍເມື່ອມີການລົງທະບຽນ, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າແພັກເກດທີ່ຈຳເປັນທັງໝົດ ໄດ້ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍແລ້ວ. ພາຣາມິເຕີບາງໂຕໃນສຄຣິບ bootstrap ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ ລະບົບລູກຂ່າຍສາມາດຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບແຊນແນວພື້ນຖານ (base channel) ໄດ້ ໂດຍໃຊ້ກຸນແຈເປີດໃຊ້ງານ ແລະ ກຸນແຈ GPG."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:5
msgid ""
"It is important that you check the repository information carefully, to "
"ensure it matches the base channel repository.  If the repository "
"information does not match exactly, the bootstrap script cannot download the "
"correct packages."
msgstr "ມັນເປັນສິ່ງສຳຄັນທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງກວດສອບຂໍ້ມູນ repository ຢ່າງລະອຽດ, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ ມັນຕົງກັບ repository ຂອງແຊນແນວພື້ນຖານ. ຖ້າຂໍ້ມູນ repository ບໍ່ຕົງກັນ, ສຄຣິບ bootstrap ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດດາວໂຫລດແພັກເກດທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:6
msgid "Additional considerations:"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວນພິຈາລະນາເພີ່ມເຕີມ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:7
msgid ""
"All clients need a bootstrap repository.  It is automatically created and "
"regenerated on the {productname} Server when products are synchronized.  A "
"bootstrap repository includes packages for installing {salt} on clients, and "
"for registering clients.  For more information about creating a bootstrap "
"repository, see xref:client-configuration:bootstrap-repository.adoc[]."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດຕ້ອງການ bootstrap repository. ມັນຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ສ້າງໃໝ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ໃນ {productname} Server ເມື່ອຜະລິດຕະພັນຖືກຊິງໂຄໄນຊ໌. bootstrap repository ປະກອບມີແພັກເກດສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ {salt} ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ, ແລະ ສຳລັບການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການສ້າງ bootstrap repository, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:bootstrap-repository.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:8
msgid ""
"openSUSE Leap 15 and SLE 15 use Python 3 by default.  Bootstrap scripts "
"based on Python 2 must be re-created for openSUSE Leap 15 and SLE 15 "
"systems.  If you register openSUSE Leap 15 or SLE 15 systems using Python 2, "
"the bootstrap script fails."
msgstr "openSUSE Leap 15 ແລະ SLE 15 ໃຊ້ Python 3 ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ສຄຣິບ bootstrap ທີ່ອີງໃສ່ Python 2 ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການສ້າງໃໝ່ສຳລັບລະບົບ openSUSE Leap 15 ແລະ SLE 15. ຖ້າເຈົ້າລົງທະບຽນລະບົບ openSUSE Leap 15 ຫຼື SLE 15 ໂດຍໃຊ້ Python 2, ສຄຣິບ bootstrap ຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "GPG keys and Uyuni client tools"
msgstr "ກຸນແຈ GPG ແລະ ເຄື່ອງມືລູກຂ່າຍ Uyuni"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:10
msgid ""
"The GPG key used by Uyuni Client Tools is not trusted by default.  When you "
"create your bootstrap script, add a path to the file containing the public "
"key fingerprint with the [systemitem]``ORG_GPG_KEY`` parameter."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:11
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview.adoc:11
msgid ""
"After migrating from an older version of {productname} to a newer version, "
"we strongly recommend re-generating the bootstrap scripts before onboarding "
"new systems to prevent any potential issues."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກຍ້າຍຈາກ {productname} ເວີຊັນເກົ່າໄປຫາເວີຊັນໃໝ່, ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳຢ່າງຍິ່ງໃຫ້ ສ້າງສຄຣິບ bootstrap ໃໝ່ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະນຳລະບົບໃໝ່ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ (onboarding) ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບັນຫາທີ່ອາດເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:12
msgid ""
"To access a shell inside the server container run [literal]``mgrctl term`` "
"on the container host.  From there, one can run the CLI tools as usual."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a bootstrap script with [command]``mgr-bootstrap``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:14
msgid ""
"The [command]``mgr-bootstrap`` command generates custom bootstrap scripts.  "
"A bootstrap script is used by {productname} client systems for simplifying "
"their initial registration and configuration."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:15
msgid ""
"The arguments [option]``--activation-keys`` and [option]``--script``, are "
"the only mandatory arguments.  On the {productname} Server, as root at the "
"command line execute it with the mandatory arguments.  Replace "
"[systemitem]``<ACTIVATION_KEY`` and [systemitem]``<EDITED_NAME>`` with your "
"values:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:16
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:41
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:63
msgid ""
"From the command prompt of the {productname} container host, run the "
"following command as the root user to enter the server container:"
msgstr "ຈາກ command prompt ຂອງ {productname} container host, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ ໃນຖານະ root ເພື່ອເຂົ້າໄປໃນ server container:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:18
msgid "Execute the following command (adjust the values as needed)"
msgstr "ລັນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ (ປັບປ່ຽນຄ່າຕາມຄວາມຈຳເປັນ)"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgr-bootstrap --activation-keys=<ACTIVATION_KEY> "
"--script=bootstrap-<EDITED_NAME>.sh\n"
msgstr "mgr-bootstrap --activation-keys=<ACTIVATION_KEY> --script=bootstrap-<EDITED_NAME>.sh\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:20
msgid ""
"The [command]``mgr-bootstrap`` command offers several other options, "
"including the ability to set a specific hostname, set specific GPG keys, and "
"set the registration method (salt-minion or salt-bundle)."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:21
msgid ""
"If you wish to create a bootstrap script to register against the Proxy, you "
"can do so by using the following command from the Server container:"
msgstr "ຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການສ້າງສຄຣິບ bootstrap ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນຜ່ານ Proxy, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈາກພາຍໃນ Server container:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-boostrap --hostname <PROXY_FQDN>\n"
msgstr "mgr-boostrap --hostname <PROXY_FQDN>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:23
msgid ""
"This command will create a new bootstrap script with default name "
"[literal]``bootstrap.sh`` and it will overwrite the existing "
"[literal]``bootstrap.sh`` file which is used for the Server."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:24
msgid "To specify a different script, use the following comamnd:"
msgstr "ຫາກຕ້ອງການກຳນົດຊື່ສຄຣິບອື່ນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-bootstrap --hostname <PROXY_FQDN> --script=boostrap-<PROXY-SCRIPT>.sh\n"
msgstr "mgr-bootstrap --hostname <PROXY_FQDN> --script=boostrap-<PROXY-SCRIPT>.sh\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:26
msgid ""
"For more information, see the [literal]``mgr-bootstrap`` man page, or run "
"[command]``mgr-bootstrap --help``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a bootstrap script from {webui}"
msgstr "ການສ້າງສຄຣິບ bootstrap ຈາກ {webui}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:28
msgid ""
"You can use the {productname} {webui} to create an editable bootstrap "
"script."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ {webui} ຂອງ {productname} ເພື່ອສ້າງສຄຣິບ bootstrap ທີ່ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້."

#.  2022-10-26, ke: In step 2, check whether we can use {productname} macro.
#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a bootstrap script"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງສຄຣິບ bootstrap"

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:30
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Manager Configuration > "
"Bootstrap Script]."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Admin[Manager Configuration > Bootstrap Script]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:31
msgid ""
"The required fields are pre-populated with values derived from previous "
"installation steps.  For details on each setting, see "
"xref:reference:admin/bootstrap-script.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈຳເປັນຈະຖືກຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ ດ້ວຍຄ່າທີ່ມາຈາກຂັ້ນຕອນການຕິດຕັ້ງກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້. ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດຂອງແຕ່ລະການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:reference:admin/bootstrap-script.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:32
msgid "Click btn:[Update] to create the script."
msgstr "ຄລິກ btn:[Update] ເພື່ອສ້າງສຄຣິບ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:33
msgid ""
"The bootstrap script is generated and stored on the server in the "
"[path]``/srv/www/htdocs/pub/bootstrap`` directory.  Alternatively, you can "
"access the bootstrap script over HTTPS.  Replace [literal]``<example.com>`` "
"with the host name of your {productname} Server:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://<example.com>/pub/bootstrap/bootstrap.sh\n"
msgstr "https://<example.com>/pub/bootstrap/bootstrap.sh\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Do not disable SSL in your bootstrap script.  Ensure that [guimenu]``Enable "
"SSL`` is checked in the {webui}, or that the setting `USING_SSL=1` exists in "
"the bootstrap script.  If you disable SSL, the registration process requires "
"custom SSL certificates."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:36
msgid ""
"For more information about custom certificates, see "
"xref:administration:ssl-certs.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:ssl-certs.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Edit a bootstrap script"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂສຄຣິບ bootstrap"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:38
msgid ""
"You can copy and modify the template bootstrap script you created to "
"customize it.  A minimal requirement when modifying a bootstrap script for "
"use with {productname} is the inclusion of an activation key.  Most packages "
"are signed with GPG, so you also need to have trusted GPG keys on your "
"system to install them."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດກ່າຍ ແລະ ປັບແຕ່ງສຄຣິບ bootstrap ຕົ້ນແບບທີ່ເຈົ້າສ້າງຂຶ້ນໄດ້. ຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂັ້ນຕໍ່າໃນການແກ້ໄຂສຄຣິບ bootstrap ເພື່ອໃຊ້ກັບ {productname} ແມ່ນ ການໃສ່ກຸນແຈເປີດໃຊ້ງານ (activation key). ແພັກເກດສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຈະຖືກເຊັນກຳກັບດ້ວຍ GPG, ດັ່ງນັ້ນເຈົ້າຈຶ່ງຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີກຸນແຈ GPG ທີ່ເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້ຢູ່ໃນລະບົບຂອງເຈົ້າເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງພວກມັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:39
msgid ""
"In this procedure, you need to know the exact name of your activation keys.  "
"Navigate to menu:Home[Overview] and, in the [guimenu]``Tasks`` box, click "
"[guimenu]``Manage Activation Keys``.  All keys created for channels are "
"listed on this page.  You must enter the full name of the key you wish to "
"use in the bootstrap script exactly as presented in the key field.  For more "
"information about activation keys, see "
"xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Modifying a bootstrap script"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການປັບແຕ່ງສຄຣິບ bootstrap"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:43
msgid ""
"On your {productname} Server, as root at the command line change to the "
"bootstrap directory with:"
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} Server ຂອງເຈົ້າ, ໃນຖານະ root ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງປ່ຽນໄປທີ່ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ bootstrap ດ້ວຍ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:44
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "cd /srv/www/htdocs/pub/bootstrap/\n"
msgstr "cd /srv/www/htdocs/pub/bootstrap/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:45
msgid ""
"Create and rename two copies of the template bootstrap script for use with "
"each of your clients."
msgstr "ສ້າງ ແລະ ປ່ຽນຊື່ສຄຣິບ bootstrap ຕົ້ນແບບສອງຊຸດ ເພື່ອໃຊ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cp bootstrap.sh bootstrap-sles12.sh\n"
"cp bootstrap.sh bootstrap-sles15.sh\n"
msgstr ""
"cp bootstrap.sh bootstrap-sles12.sh\n"
"cp bootstrap.sh bootstrap-sles15.sh\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:47
msgid "Open [path]``bootstrap-sles15.sh`` for modification."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:48
msgid ""
"Scroll down until you can see the text shown below.  If ``exit 1`` exists in "
"the file, comment it out by typing a hash or pound sign (&#35;) at the "
"beginning of the line.  This activates the script.  Enter the name of the "
"key for this script in the ``ACTIVATION_KEYS=`` field:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"echo \"Enable this script: comment (with #'s) this block (or, at least "
"just\"\n"
"echo \"the exit below)\"\n"
"echo\n"
"#exit 1\n"
msgstr ""
"echo \"Enable this script: comment (with #'s) this block (or, at least just\"\n"
"echo \"the exit below)\"\n"
"echo\n"
"#exit 1\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# can be edited, but probably correct (unless created during initial "
"install):\n"
"# NOTE: ACTIVATION_KEYS *must* be used to bootstrap a client machine.\n"
"ACTIVATION_KEYS=1-sles15\n"
"ORG_GPG_KEY=\n"
msgstr ""
"# can be edited, but probably correct (unless created during initial install):\n"
"# NOTE: ACTIVATION_KEYS *must* be used to bootstrap a client machine.\n"
"ACTIVATION_KEYS=1-sles15\n"
"ORG_GPG_KEY=\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:51
msgid ""
"Instead of editing the script manually, user can pass the following "
"environment variables at runtime:"
msgstr "ແທນທີ່ຈະແກ້ໄຂສຄຣິບດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດສົ່ງຄ່າ environment variables ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ລັນໄດ້:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:52
msgid "`ACTIVATION_KEYS`: Activation keys to use for registration"
msgstr "`ACTIVATION_KEYS`: ກຸນແຈເປີດໃຊ້ງານທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບການລົງທະບຽນ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:53
msgid "`ORG_GPG_KEY`: Path or identifier of the GPG key"
msgstr "`ORG_GPG_KEY`: ເສັ້ນທາງ ຫຼື ຕົວລະບຸຂອງກຸນແຈ GPG"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:54
msgid "`REACTIVATION_KEY`: Reactivation key for previously registered systems"
msgstr "`REACTIVATION_KEY`: ກຸນແຈເປີດໃຊ້ງານຄືນໃໝ່ ສຳລັບລະບົບທີ່ເຄີຍລົງທະບຽນມາແລ້ວ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:55
msgid ""
"`MGR_SERVER_HOSTNAME`: Hostname of the Server or Proxy to register the "
"client against"
msgstr "`MGR_SERVER_HOSTNAME`: Hostname ຂອງ Server ຫຼື Proxy ທີ່ຕ້ອງການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍໃສ່"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:56
msgid ""
"Using environment variables allows dynamic input at runtime and makes it "
"easier to reuse the same bootstrap script across different systems or "
"environments."
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ environment variables ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນແບບໄດນາມິກໄດ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ລັນ ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ການນຳສຄຣິບ bootstrap ດຽວກັນກັບມາໃຊ້ໃນລະບົບ ຫຼື ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຕ່າງໆໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:57
msgid ""
"When you have finished, save the file, and repeat this procedure for the "
"second bootstrap script."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຈົ້າເຮັດສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ບັນທຶກໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ເຮັດຊ້ຳຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ສຳລັບສຄຣິບ bootstrap ຊຸດທີສອງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:58
msgid ""
"By default, bootstrap script will try to install "
"[package]``venv-salt-minion`` if it is available in the bootstrap repository "
"and [package]``salt-minion`` if there is no {salt} bundle in the bootstrap "
"repository.  It is possible to avoid installing {salt} bundle and keep using "
"[package]``salt-minion`` if you need it for some reason."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:59
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc[Salt Bundle]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc[Salt Bundle]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register clients running the bootstrap script"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍໂດຍການລັນສຄຣິບ bootstrap"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:61
msgid ""
"When you have finished creating your script, you can use it to register "
"clients."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຈົ້າສ້າງສຄຣິບສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ມັນເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Running the bootstrap script"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລັນສຄຣິບ bootstrap"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:65
msgid "On the {productname} Server, change to the bootstrap directory:"
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} Server, ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນໄປທີ່ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ bootstrap:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:67
msgid ""
"Run this command to execute the bootstrap script on the client; replace "
"[systemitem]``EXAMPLE.COM`` with the host name of your client:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:68
#, no-wrap
msgid "cat bootstrap-sles15.sh | ssh root@EXAMPLE.COM /bin/bash\n"
msgstr "cat bootstrap-sles15.sh | ssh root@EXAMPLE.COM /bin/bash\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:69
msgid "Alternatively, on the client, run this command:"
msgstr "ຫຼືອີກວິທີໜຶ່ງ, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຢູ່ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:70
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ACTIVATION_KEYS=\"17-someactivationkey\" \\\n"
"MGR_SERVER_HOSTNAME=\"proxy.example.com\" \\\n"
"ORG_GPG_KEY=\"mykey\" \\\n"
"REACTIVATION_KEY=my-reactivation-key \\\n"
"curl -Sks https://server_hostname/pub/bootstrap/bootstrap.sh | /bin/bash\n"
msgstr ""
"ACTIVATION_KEYS=\"17-someactivationkey\" \\\n"
"MGR_SERVER_HOSTNAME=\"proxy.example.com\" \\\n"
"ORG_GPG_KEY=\"mykey\" \\\n"
"REACTIVATION_KEY=my-reactivation-key \\\n"
"curl -Sks https://server_hostname/pub/bootstrap/bootstrap.sh | /bin/bash\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:71
msgid ""
"If you do not need to override any values, you can omit the environment "
"variables entirely:"
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປ່ຽນຄ່າໃດໆ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດຂ້າມການກຳນົດ environment variables ໄປໄດ້ເລີຍ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:72
#, no-wrap
msgid "curl -Sks https://server_hostname/pub/bootstrap/bootstrap.sh | /bin/bash\n"
msgstr "curl -Sks https://server_hostname/pub/bootstrap/bootstrap.sh | /bin/bash\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:73
msgid ""
"To avoid problems, make sure the bootstrap script is executed using "
"[command]``bash``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:74
msgid ""
"This script downloads the required dependencies located in the repositories "
"directory you created earlier."
msgstr "ສຄຣິບນີ້ຈະດາວໂຫລດໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈຳເປັນ (dependencies) ທີ່ຢູ່ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ repositories ທີ່ເຈົ້າໄດ້ສ້າງໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:75
msgid ""
"When the script has finished running, you can check that the client is "
"registered correctly.  Open the {productname} {webui} and navigate to "
"menu:Systems[Overview] to ensure the new client is listed.  If the client is "
"not listed, in the {productname} {webui} navigate to menu:Salt[Keys] and "
"check whether the client key is accepted."
msgstr "ເມື່ອສຄຣິບລັນສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ເເຈົ້າສາມາດກວດສອບວ່າລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງຫຼືບໍ່. ເປີດ {webui} ຂອງ {productname} ແລະ ໄປທີ່ menu:Systems[Overview] ເພື່ອເບິ່ງວ່າລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່ປະກົດຢູ່ໃນລາຍຊື່ຫຼືບໍ່. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີໃນລາຍຊື່, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ menu:Salt[Keys] ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname} ແລະ ກວດສອບວ່າກຸນແຈຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ ໄດ້ຮັບການຍອມຮັບ (accepted) ຫຼື ບໍ່."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-bootstrap.adoc:76
msgid ""
"When new packages or updates are installed on the client using "
"{productname}, any end user license agreements (EULAs) are automatically "
"accepted.  To review a package EULA, open the package detail page in the "
"{webui}."
msgstr "ເມື່ອມີການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດໃໝ່ ຫຼື ການອັບເດດໃນລູກຂ່າຍໂດຍໃຊ້ {productname}, ຂໍ້ຕົກລົງໃບອະນຸຍາດຜູ້ໃຊ້ (EULAs) ໃດໆ ຈະຖືກຍອມຮັບໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຫາກຕ້ອງການ ກວດສອບ EULA ຂອງແພັກເກດ, ໃຫ້ເປີດໜ້າລາຍລະອຽດແພັກເກດໃນ {webui}."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register Clients on the Command Line"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍຜ່ານຄຳສັ່ງ (Command Line)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{salt} clients are registered accurately with the default bootstrap methods "
"in most cases."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ລູກຂ່າຍ {salt} ຈະຖືກລົງທະບຽນຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງດ້ວຍວິທີ bootstrap ມາດຕະຖານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:4
msgid ""
"However, you can use {salt} to register the client to the {productname} "
"Server manually by editing the {salt} minion file on the client, and "
"providing the fully qualified domain name (FQDN) of the server."
msgstr "ແນ່ວໃດກໍຕາມ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ {salt} ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍກັບ {productname} Server ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໄດ້ ໂດຍການແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ {salt} minion ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ, ແລະ ລະບຸ ຊື່ໂດເມນເຕັມ (FQDN) ຂອງເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:5
msgid "This method:"
msgstr "ວິທີນີ້:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:6
msgid "uses ports 4505 and 4506 inbound to the server."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ພອດ 4505 ແລະ 4506 ຂາເຂົ້າ (inbound) ໄປຫາເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:7
msgid ""
"requires no configuration on the {productname} Server aside from ensuring "
"that these ports are open."
msgstr "ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃດໆໃນ {productname} Server ນອກຈາກການກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າພອດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເປີດຢູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:8
msgid ""
"requires that you have installed the [package]``venv-salt-minion`` (Salt "
"bundle) or the [package]``salt-minion`` package on the Salt client before "
"registration.  Both use configuration files in different locations and "
"filenames remain the same.  The [literal]``systemd`` service filename is "
"different."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Bootstrapping this way will only work if you use the "
"[package]``salt-minion`` being part of the client tools channels or of an "
"official {suse} distributions."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "{salt} Bundle Configuration"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {salt} Bundle"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:11
msgid "{salt} Bundle ([package]``venv-salt-minion``)::"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:12
msgid "[path]``/etc/venv-salt-minion/``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:13
msgid "[path]``/etc/venv-salt-minion/minion``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:14
msgid "[path]``/etc/venv-salt-minion/minion.d/NAME.conf``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:15
msgid "systemd service file: [path]``venv-salt-minion.service``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:16
msgid ""
"For more information about the Salt bundle, see "
"xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc[Salt Bundle]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ Salt bundle, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc[Salt Bundle]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Registering Clients with Salt Bundle Configuration File"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍດ້ວຍໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Salt Bundle"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:18
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:37
msgid ""
"On the Salt client, open the [literal]``minion`` configuration file.  The "
"configuration file is either located at:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "/etc/venv-salt-minion/minion\n"
msgstr "/etc/venv-salt-minion/minion\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "/etc/venv-salt-minion/minion.d/NAME.conf\n"
msgstr "/etc/venv-salt-minion/minion.d/NAME.conf\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:22
msgid ""
"In the file add or edit the FQDN of the {productname} Server or Proxy, and "
"the activation key if any. Also add the other configuration parameters "
"listed below."
msgstr "ໃນໄຟລ໌ດັ່ງກ່າວ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂ FQDN ຂອງ {productname} Server ຫຼື Proxy, ແລະ ກຸນແຈເປີດໃຊ້ງານ (ຖ້າມີ). ນອກຈາກນີ້ ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມພາຣາມິເຕີການຕັ້ງຄ່າອື່ນໆທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ທາງລຸ່ມ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:23
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "master: SERVER.EXAMPLE.COM\n"
msgstr "master: SERVER.EXAMPLE.COM\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:24
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"grains:\n"
"  susemanager:\n"
"    activation_key: \"<Activation_Key_Name>\"\n"
msgstr ""
"grains:\n"
"  susemanager:\n"
"    activation_key: \"<Activation_Key_Name>\"\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:25
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"server_id_use_crc: adler32\n"
"enable_legacy_startup_events: False\n"
"enable_fqdns_grains: False\n"
msgstr ""
"server_id_use_crc: adler32\n"
"enable_legacy_startup_events: False\n"
"enable_fqdns_grains: False\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:26
msgid "Restart the [systemitem]``venv-salt-minion`` service:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl restart venv-salt-minion\n"
msgstr "systemctl restart venv-salt-minion\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:28
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:47
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, accept the new client key; replace "
"[systemitem]``<client>`` with the name of your client:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client Configuration"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Labeled list
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client ([package]``salt-minion``)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:32
msgid "[path]``/etc/salt/``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:33
msgid "[path]``/etc/salt/minion``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:34
msgid "[path]``/etc/salt/minion.d/NAME.conf``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:35
msgid "systemd service file: [path]``salt-minion.service``"
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Registering Clients with Salt Minion Configuration File"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍດ້ວຍໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Salt Minion"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:41
msgid ""
"In the file add or edit the FQDN of the {productname} Server or Proxy, and "
"the activation key if any.  Also add the other configuration parameters "
"listed below."
msgstr "ໃນໄຟລ໌ດັ່ງກ່າວ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂ FQDN ຂອງ {productname} Server ຫຼື Proxy, ແລະ ກຸນແຈເປີດໃຊ້ງານ (ຖ້າມີ). ນອກຈາກນີ້ ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມພາຣາມິເຕີການຕັ້ງຄ່າອື່ນໆທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ທາງລຸ່ມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-cli.adoc:49
msgid ""
"For more information about the {salt} minion configuration file, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/configuration/minion.html[Configuring "
"the Salt Minion]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {salt} minion, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/configuration/minion.html[Configuring the Salt Minion]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-methods.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registration Methods"
msgstr "ວິທີການລົງທະບຽນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-methods.adoc:2
msgid "There are several ways to register clients to your {productname} Server."
msgstr "ມີຫຼາຍວິທີໃນການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍກັບ {productname} Server ຂອງເຈົ້າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-methods.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For only a few clients, we recommend that you register clients using the "
"{productname} {webui}."
msgstr "ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍພຽງແຕ່ບໍ່ກີ່ເຄື່ອງ, ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຈົ້າລົງທະບຽນໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-methods.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-webui.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:registration-webui.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-methods.adoc:5
msgid ""
"If you want more control over the process, or have to register many clients, "
"we recommend that you create a bootstrap script."
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຄວບຄຸມຂະບວນການໃຫ້ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, ຫຼື ຕ້ອງລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ, ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສ້າງສຄຣິບ bootstrap."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-methods.adoc:6
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-methods.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For even more control over the process, executing a single commands on the "
"command line can be useful."
msgstr "ເພື່ອການຄວບຄຸມທີ່ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນໄປອີກ, ການລັນຄຳສັ່ງດ່ຽວໆຜ່ານ command line ກໍສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-methods.adoc:8
msgid "For more information, see xref:client-configuration:registration-cli.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:registration-cli.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-methods.adoc:9
msgid ""
"The client must have the date and time synchronized correctly with the "
"{productname} Server before registration."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍຕ້ອງມີການຊິງໂຄໄນຊ໌ວັນທີ ແລະ ເວລາໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງກັບ {productname} Server ກ່ອນການລົງທະບຽນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-methods.adoc:10
msgid ""
"You must create an activation key first, to use bootstrap script or command "
"line method.  For more information about creating activation keys, see "
"xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."
