#, no-wrap
msgid "{rocky} Client Registration"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍ {rocky}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview-rocky.adoc:2
msgid ""
"You can register {rocky} clients to your {productname} Server.  The method "
"and details vary depending on the operating system of the client."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍ {rocky} ກັບ {productname} Server ຂອງເຈົ້າໄດ້. ວິທີການ ແລະ ລາຍລະອຽດຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມລະບົບປະຕິບັດການຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview-rocky.adoc:6
msgid ""
"For more information about migrating {rocky} to {sll}, see "
"xref:client-configuration:clients-sleses.adoc#clients-sleses-el-migration[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຍ້າຍ {rocky} ໄປເປັນ {sll}, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:clients-sleses.adoc#clients-sleses-el-migration[]."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview-suse.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "SUSE Client Registration"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍ SUSE"

#.  SUSE Liberty Linux not available at Uyuni for now
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview-suse.adoc:2
msgid "You can register {sle} and {sleses} clients to {productname} Server."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍ {sle} ແລະ {sleses} ກັບ {productname} Server ໄດ້."

#.  SUSE Liberty Linux not available at Uyuni for now
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview-suse.adoc:3
msgid "You can register {sle} clients to {productname} Server."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍ {sle} ກັບ {productname} Server ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview-suse.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To register a new client to {productname} Server, first synchronize software "
"channels for the new client's operating system and architecture by using "
"either the {webui} or command line tools."
msgstr "ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່ກັບ {productname} Server, ຂັ້ນທຳອິດໃຫ້ຊິງໂຄໄນຊ໌ ແຊນແນວຊອບແວສຳລັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ ແລະ ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳຂອງລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່ ໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui} ຫຼື ເຄື່ອງມືຜ່ານຄຳສັ່ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview-suse.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Then, synchronize the client tool repository for the newly added operating "
"system by using command line tools."
msgstr "ຈາກນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ຊິງໂຄໄນຊ໌ repository ຂອງເຄື່ອງມືລູກຂ່າຍ (client tool repository) ສຳລັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃໝ່ ໂດຍໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືຜ່ານຄຳສັ່ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview-suse.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The method and details varies depending on the client's operating system.  "
"This is described in the following sections."
msgstr "ວິທີການ ແລະ ລາຍລະອຽດຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມລະບົບປະຕິບັດການຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ. ເຊິ່ງຈະມີຄຳອະທິບາຍໃນພາກສ່ວນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview-suse.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Preliminary Steps or Checks"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນການກຽມພ້ອມ ຫຼື ການກວດສອບເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview-suse.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check Previous Registration Status"
msgstr "ກວດສອບສະຖານະການລົງທະບຽນກ່ອນໜ້າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview-suse.adoc:12
msgid ""
"If the client was registered to SCC, SMT, or RMT previously, remove such a "
"registration with [command]``SUSEConnect`` before migrating the client to "
"{productname} Server.  Do not forget to remove the old registration first.  "
"Otherwise repositories that are no longer needed, will be added to the "
"client after the client has been migrated to a newer version of a {suse} "
"operating system with {productname}."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview-suse.adoc:13
msgid "To de-register a {sle} 12 or 15 client, on the client, as root, execute:"
msgstr "ຫາກຕ້ອງການຍົກເລີກການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍ {sle} 12 ຫຼື 15, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃນລູກຂ່າຍໃນຖານະ root:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview-suse.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"SUSEConnect --de-register\n"
"SUSEConnect --cleanup\n"
msgstr ""
"SUSEConnect --de-register\n"
"SUSEConnect --cleanup\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview-suse.adoc:15
msgid ""
"For more information about detailed cleanup commands and verification steps, "
"see https://www.suse.com/de-de/support/kb/doc/?id=000019054."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຄຳສັ່ງການລ້າງຂໍ້ມູນຢ່າງລະອຽດ ແລະ ຂັ້ນຕອນການກວດສອບ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ https://www.suse.com/de-de/support/kb/doc/?id=000019054."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview-ubuntu.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ubuntu Client Registration"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍ Ubuntu"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview-ubuntu.adoc:2
msgid ""
"You can register {ubuntu} clients to your {productname} Server.  The method "
"and details varies depending on the operating system of the client."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍ {ubuntu} ກັບ {productname} Server ຂອງເຈົ້າໄດ້. ວິທີການ ແລະ ລາຍລະອຽດຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມລະບົບປະຕິບັດການຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client Registration"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview.adoc:2
msgid ""
"There are several ways to register clients to your {productname} Server.  "
"This section covers the various available methods.  It also contains "
"information specific to the operating system you intend to run on the "
"client."
msgstr "ມີຫຼາຍວິທີໃນການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍກັບ {productname} Server ຂອງເຈົ້າ. ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ ຈະຄອບຄຸມວິທີການຕ່າງໆທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້. ນອກຈາກນີ້ ຍັງມີຂໍ້ມູນສະເພາະສຳລັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ ທີ່ເຈົ້າຕັ້ງໃຈຈະລັນຢູ່ໃນລູກຂ່າຍນຳ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview.adoc:3
msgid "Before you begin, check that:"
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ເຈົ້າຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The client has the date and time synchronized correctly with the "
"{productname} Server before registration."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍມີການຊິງໂຄໄນຊ໌ວັນທີ ແລະ ເວລາໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງກັບ {productname} Server ກ່ອນການລົງທະບຽນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview.adoc:5
msgid ""
"You have created an activation key.  For more information about creating "
"activation keys, see xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າໄດ້ສ້າງກຸນແຈເປີດໃຊ້ງານໄວ້ແລ້ວ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການສ້າງ ກຸນແຈເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Once a client system has been bootstrapped, the **Installer Updates** "
"channel should be removed.  The standard update channel already includes the "
"necessary updates, making this channel redundant."
msgstr "ເມື່ອລະບົບລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້ຮັບການ bootstrap ແລ້ວ, ຄວນລຶບແຊນແນວ **Installer Updates** ອອກ. ເນື່ອງຈາກແຊນແນວອັບເດດມາດຕະຖານມີການອັບເດດທີ່ຈຳເປັນຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ແຊນແນວນີ້ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Do not register the {productname} Server base OS to {productname} itself.  "
"The {productname} Server base OS must be managed individually or by using "
"another separate {productname} Server."
msgstr "ຫ້າມລົງທະບຽນ OS ພື້ນຖານຂອງ {productname} Server ໃສ່ {productname} ຕົວມັນເອງ. OS ພື້ນຖານຂອງ {productname} Server ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຈັດການແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ ຫຼື ໂດຍການໃຊ້ {productname} Server ອື່ນອີກເຄື່ອງໜຶ່ງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-overview.adoc:10
msgid "To manage {productname} Server Containers, use the [literal]``mgradm`` tool."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:1
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register Clients With the {webui}"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍດ້ວຍ {webui}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Bootstrapping clients with the {webui} is using "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-ssh.adoc[Salt SSH] to execute the "
"bootstrap process on the client.  Salt SSH uses the Salt Bundle with the "
"Python interpreter included.  Therefore, no other Python interpreter needs "
"to be installed on the client."
msgstr "ການ bootstrapping ລູກຂ່າຍດ້ວຍ {webui} ແມ່ນໃຊ້ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-ssh.adoc[Salt SSH] ເພື່ອປະຕິບັດຂະບວນການ bootstrap ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ. Salt SSH ໃຊ້ Salt Bundle ທີ່ ລວມເອົາ Python interpreter ມາໃຫ້ແລ້ວ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງ Python ອື່ນໆໃນລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Salt Bundle is made available together with the bootstrap "
"repository. Therefore the bootstrap repository must be created before "
"starting the bootstrap process for the client.  A shell script detects the "
"operating system on the client and deploys the Salt Bundle from the "
"appropriate bootstrap repository, using the same logic as the bootstrap "
"script."
msgstr "Salt Bundle ຖືກຈັດໄວ້ພ້ອມກັບ bootstrap repository. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ຕ້ອງສ້າງ bootstrap repository ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມຂະບວນການ bootstrap ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍ. shell script ຈະກວດຫາລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງ Salt Bundle ຈາກ bootstrap repository ທີ່ເໝາະສົມ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຫຼັກການດຽວກັນກັບສຄຣິບ bootstrap."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:5
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:bootstrap-repository.adoc#_prepare_to_create_a_bootstrap_repository[Prepare "
"to Create a Bootstrap Repository]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:bootstrap-repository.adoc#_prepare_to_create_a_bootstrap_repository[Prepare to Create a Bootstrap Repository]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Registering Clients With the {webui}"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລົງທະບຽນລູກຂ່າຍດ້ວຍ {webui}"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:15
msgid "Select an [guimenu]``Authentication`` method:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:16
msgid ""
"To bootstrap the client with an SSH key, in the [guimenu]``Authentication`` "
"field, check [guimenu]``SSH Private Key``, and upload the SSH private key to "
"use to log in to the client."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:17
msgid ""
"If your SSH private key requires a passphrase, type it into the "
"[guimenu]``SSH Private Key Passphrase`` field, or leave it blank for no "
"passphrase."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:18
msgid ""
"To bootstrap the client with a password, in the [guimenu]``Authentication`` "
"field, check [guimenu]``Password``, and type the password to log in to the "
"client."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:21
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: In the [guimenu]``Proxy`` field, select the proxy to register the "
"client to."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:25
msgid ""
"If you check this option, the client is configured to use SSH for its "
"connection to the server, and no other contact method is configured."
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າໝາຍເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້, ລູກຂ່າຍຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ໃຊ້ SSH ສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ໄປຫາເຊີເວີ, ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ອື່ນໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:26
msgid ""
"For more information about contact methods, see "
"xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-intro.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-intro.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:29
msgid ""
"SSH private keys are stored only for the duration of the bootstrapping "
"process.  They are deleted from the {productname} Server as soon as "
"bootstrapping is complete."
msgstr "ກຸນແຈ SSH ສ່ວນຕົວຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ສະເພາະໃນລະຫວ່າງຂະບວນການ bootstrapping ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ພວກມັນຈະຖືກລຶບອອກຈາກ {productname} Server ທັນທີທີ່ການ bootstrapping ສຳເລັດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:30
msgid ""
"When new packages or updates are installed on the client using "
"{productname}, any end user license agreements (EULAs) are automatically "
"accepted.  To review a package EULA, open the package details page in the "
"{webui}."
msgstr "ເມື່ອມີການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດໃໝ່ ຫຼື ການອັບເດດໃນລູກຂ່າຍໂດຍໃຊ້ {productname}, ຂໍ້ຕົກລົງໃບອະນຸຍາດຜູ້ໃຊ້ (EULAs) ໃດໆ ຈະຖືກຍອມຮັບໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຫາກຕ້ອງການ ກວດສອບ EULA ຂອງແພັກເກດ, ໃຫ້ເປີດໜ້າລາຍລະອຽດແພັກເກດໃນ {webui}."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Handling of Locally Assigned Repositories"
msgstr "ການຈັດການ Repositories ທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດພາຍໃນລະບົບ (Locally Assigned)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Having repositories assigned directly to clients not served by {productname} "
"is not a common use case.  It can cause trouble.  Therfore bootstrapping via "
"Salt disables all local repositories at the beginning of the bootstrap "
"process."
msgstr "ການມີ repositories ທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍໂດຍກົງ ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ໄດ້ມາຈາກ {productname} ບໍ່ແມ່ນກໍລະນີການໃຊ້ງານປົກກະຕິ ແລະ ອາດກໍ່ໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາໄດ້. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ການ bootstrapping ຜ່ານ Salt ຈະທຳການປິດການໃຊ້ງານ local repositories ທັງໝົດໃນຕອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຂະບວນການ bootstrap."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Later, during every use of the channel state, for example when executing a "
"Highstate or a package installation, all locally assigned repositories are "
"disabled again."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ, ໃນທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ມີການໃຊ້ channel state, ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ ເມື່ອລັນ Highstate ຫຼື ການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ, local repositories ທັງໝົດທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້ຈະຖືກປິດການໃຊ້ງານອີກຄັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/registration-webui.adoc:34
msgid ""
"All software packages which are used on the clients should come from "
"channels served by {productname}.  For more information about creating a "
"custom channel, see ``Custom Channels`` at "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/repositories.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Software Repositories"
msgstr "ຊອບແວ Repositories"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/repositories.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Repositories are used to collect software packages.  When you have access to "
"a software repository, you can install any of the software that the "
"repository provides.  You must have at least one repository associated with "
"your software channels in {productname} to assign clients to the channel and "
"install and update packages on the client."
msgstr "Repositories ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອຮວບຮວມແພັກເກດຊອບແວ. ເມື່ອເຈົ້າສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ software repository ໃດໜຶ່ງ, ເຈົ້າຈະສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງຊອບແວໃດກໍໄດ້ທີ່ repository ນັ້ນມີໃຫ້. ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງມີຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງ repository ທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບແຊນແນວຊອບແວຂອງເຈົ້າໃນ {productname} ເພື່ອທີ່ຈະກຳນົດລູກຂ່າຍໃຫ້ກັບແຊນແນວນັ້ນ ແລະ ທຳການຕິດຕັ້ງ ຫຼື ອັບເດດແພັກເກດໃນລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/repositories.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Most default channels in {productname} are already associated with the "
"correct repositories.  If you are creating custom channels, you need to "
"associate a repository that you have access to, or that you have created "
"yourself."
msgstr "ແຊນແນວມາດຕະຖານສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ໃນ {productname} ແມ່ນຖືກເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບ repository ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ຢູ່ແລ້ວ. ຖ້າເຈົ້າກຳລັງສ້າງແຊນແນວທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບ repository ທີ່ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້, ຫຼື ທີ່ເຈົ້າໄດ້ສ້າງຂຶ້ນມາດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/repositories.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For more information about custom repositories and channels, see "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຄັງເກັບຊອບແວ ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/repositories.adoc:5
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/repositories.adoc:16
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/repositories.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Local Repository Locations"
msgstr "ບ່ອນເກັບ Local Repository"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/repositories.adoc:6
msgid ""
"You can configure local repositories on clients, to provide packages that "
"are not supplied by {productname} channels."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າ local repositories ໃນລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້, ເພື່ອສະໜອງແພັກເກດ ທີ່ບໍ່ມີຢູ່ໃນແຊນແນວຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/repositories.adoc:7
msgid ""
"In most cases, client systems do not require local repositories.  Local "
"repositories can lead to problems knowing which packages are available on "
"the client.  This can lead to installing unexpected packages."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ລະບົບລູກຂ່າຍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີ local repositories. Local repositories ອາດກໍ່ໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາໃນການກວດສອບວ່າແພັກເກດໃດແດ່ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ. ເຊິ່ງອາດນຳໄປສູ່ການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດທີ່ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/repositories.adoc:8
msgid "Local repositories are disabled during onboarding."
msgstr "Local repositories ຈະຖືກປິດການໃຊ້ງານໃນລະຫວ່າງການ onboarding."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/repositories.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Local repositories will be disabled each time a channel state is executed.  "
"For example, when applying the highstate or performing a package action."
msgstr "Local repositories ຈະຖືກປິດການໃຊ້ງານທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ມີການລັນ channel state. ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ: ເມື່ອມີການນຳໃຊ້ highstate ຫຼື ປະຕິບັດການໃດໜຶ່ງກ່ຽວກັບແພັກເກດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/repositories.adoc:10
msgid ""
"If local repositories should stay enabled after onboarding, the following "
"pillar must be set for the affected client:"
msgstr "ຫາກຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ local repositories ຍັງຄົງເປີດໃຊ້ງານຫຼັງຈາກ onboarding ແລ້ວ, ຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າ pillar ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/repositories.adoc:11
msgid "Edit the ``/srv/pillar/top.sls`` file:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/repositories.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"base:\n"
"  'minionid':\n"
"    - localrepos\n"
msgstr ""
"base:\n"
"  'minionid':\n"
"    - localrepos\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/repositories.adoc:13
msgid "Edit the ``/srv/pillar/localrepos.sls`` file:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/repositories.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr_disable_local_repos: False\n"
msgstr "mgr_disable_local_repos: False\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/repositories.adoc:15
msgid ""
"After a client has completed onboarding, you can add local repositories to "
