msgid "In this table, virtual guest management is split into basic and advanced."
msgstr "ໃນຕາຕະລາງນີ້, ການຈັດການແຂກສະເໝືອນຖືກແບ່ງອອກເປັນແບບພື້ນຖານ ແລະ ແບບຂັ້ນສູງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/supported-features-alibaba.adoc:12
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/supported-features-almalinux.adoc:13
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/supported-features-amazon.adoc:14
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/supported-features-centos.adoc:13
