#: modules/client-configuration/pages/supported-features-sll.adoc:14
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/supported-features-ubuntu.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Basic virtual guest management includes listing VMs, slow refresh, VM "
"lifecycle actions (start, stop, resume, pause), and modifying VM vCPU and "
"Memory."
msgstr "ການຈັດການແຂກສະເໝືອນແບບພື້ນຖານ ລວມມີການສະແດງລາຍຊື່ VM, ການຣີເຟຣຊແບບຊ້າ, ການດຳເນີນການວົງຈອນຊີວິດຂອງ VM (ເລີ່ມ, ຢຸດ, ສືບຕໍ່, ພັກ), ແລະ ການປ່ຽນແປງ vCPU ແລະ ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຂອງ VM."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/supported-features-alibaba.adoc:13
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/supported-features-almalinux.adoc:14
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/supported-features-amazon.adoc:15
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/supported-features-centos.adoc:14
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/supported-features-debian.adoc:13
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/supported-features-oes.adoc:13
