#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-groups.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "System Groups"
msgstr "ກຸ່ມລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-groups.adoc:2
msgid ""
"You can use system groups to make it easier to manage a large number of "
"clients.  Groups can be used to perform bulk actions on clients such as "
"applying updates, configuration channels, salt states, or formulas."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ກຸ່ມລະບົບເພື່ອໃຫ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນໃນການຈັດການລູກຂ່າຍຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ. ກຸ່ມສາມາດຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອປະຕິບັດງານແບບຊຸດໃຫຍ່ (bulk actions) ເທິງລູກຂ່າຍ ເຊັ່ນ: ການອັບເດດ, ຊ່ອງທາງການກຳນົດຄ່າ, salt states, ຫຼື ສູດການຕັ້ງຄ່າ (formulas)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-groups.adoc:3
msgid ""
"You can organize clients into groups in any way that works for your "
"environment.  For example, you could organize clients on which operating "
"system is installed, which physical location they are in, or the type of "
"workload they are handling.  Clients can be in any number of groups, so you "
"can define your groups in different ways."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຈັດກຸ່ມລູກຂ່າຍໃນຮູບແບບໃດກໍໄດ້ທີ່ເໝາະສົມກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ທ່ານສາມາດຈັດກຸ່ມລູກຂ່າຍຕາມລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງ, ຕາມສະຖານທີ່ຕັ້ງທາງກາຍະພາບ, ຫຼື ຕາມປະເພດຂອງວຽກທີ່ພວກເຂົາກຳລັງຈັດການ. ລູກຂ່າຍສາມາດຢູ່ໃນຫຼາຍກຸ່ມພ້ອມກັນໄດ້, ດັ່ງນັ້ນທ່ານຈຶ່ງສາມາດກຳນົດກຸ່ມຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ຫຼາຍຮູບແບບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-groups.adoc:4
msgid ""
"When you have clients organized into groups, you can perform updates on all "
"clients in one or more groups, or on intersections between groups.  For "
"example, you can define one group for all clients with web server software, "
"and another group for all SLES clients.  You can then perform updates on all "
"clients with web server software, or use the intersection between the "
"groups, and update all SLES clients with web server software."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານຈັດກຸ່ມລູກຂ່າຍແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດອັບເດດລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດໃນກຸ່ມດຽວ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກຸ່ມ, ຫຼື ອັບເດດສະເພາະລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຢູ່ຈຸດຕັດກັນ (intersection) ລະຫວ່າງກຸ່ມ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດກຸ່ມໜຶ່ງສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດທີ່ມີຊອບແວເວັບເຊີເວີ, ແລະ ອີກກຸ່ມໜຶ່ງສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍ SLES ທັງໝົດ. ຈາກນັ້ນທ່ານສາມາດອັບເດດລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດທີ່ມີຊອບແວເວັບເຊີເວີ, ຫຼື ໃຊ້ຈຸດຕັດກັນລະຫວ່າງກຸ່ມ ເພື່ອອັບເດດສະເພາະລູກຂ່າຍ SLES ທີ່ມີຊອບແວເວັບເຊີເວີເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-groups.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create Groups"
msgstr "ສ້າງກຸ່ມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-groups.adoc:6
msgid ""
"You need to create some groups before you can use them to organize your "
"clients."
msgstr "ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງກຸ່ມບາງກຸ່ມກ່ອນ ຈຶ່ງຈະສາມາດໃຊ້ມັນເພື່ອຈັດລະບຽບລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-groups.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a New System Group"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງກຸ່ມລະບົບໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-groups.adoc:8
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[System Groups]."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[System Groups]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-groups.adoc:10
msgid "Give your new group a name and a description."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຊື່ ແລະ ໃສ່ຄຳອະທິບາຍໃຫ້ກັບກຸ່ມໃໝ່ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-groups.adoc:11
msgid "Click btn:[Create Group] to save your group."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Create Group] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກກຸ່ມຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-groups.adoc:12
msgid "Repeat for each group you require."
msgstr "ເຮັດຊ້ຳຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະກຸ່ມທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-groups.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add Clients to Groups"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມລູກຂ່າຍເຂົ້າໃນກຸ່ມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-groups.adoc:14
msgid ""
"You can add individual clients to your groups, or add multiple clients at "
"the same time."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມລູກຂ່າຍແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງເຂົ້າໃນກຸ່ມຂອງທ່ານ, ຫຼື ເພີ່ມລູກຂ່າຍຫຼາຍເຄື່ອງພ້ອມກັນໃນເທື່ອດຽວ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-groups.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding A Single Client to a Group"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເພີ່ມລູກຂ່າຍດຽວເຂົ້າໃນກຸ່ມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-groups.adoc:16
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[System List] and "
"click the name of the client to add."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[System List] ແລະ ຄລິກໃສ່ຊື່ຂອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-groups.adoc:17
msgid "Navigate to the menu:Groups[Join] tab."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແຖບເມນູ: Groups[Join]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-groups.adoc:18
msgid "Check the group to join and click btn:[Join Selected Groups]."
msgstr "ເລືອກກຸ່ມທີ່ຕ້ອງການເຂົ້າຮ່ວມ ແລະ ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Join Selected Groups]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-groups.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding Multiple Clients to a Group"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເພີ່ມລູກຂ່າຍຫຼາຍເຄື່ອງເຂົ້າໃນກຸ່ມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-groups.adoc:20
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[System Groups] and "
"click the name of the group to add clients to."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[System Groups] ແລະ ຄລິກໃສ່ຊື່ຂອງກຸ່ມທີ່ຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-groups.adoc:21
msgid "Navigate to the [guimenu]``Target systems`` tab."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-groups.adoc:22
msgid "Check the clients to add and click btn:[Add Systems]."
msgstr "ເລືອກລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມ ແລະ ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Add Systems]."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-groups.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding Multiple Clients to a Group with SSM"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເພີ່ມລູກຂ່າຍຫຼາຍເຄື່ອງເຂົ້າໃນກຸ່ມດ້ວຍ SSM"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-groups.adoc:24
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[System List] and "
"check each client to add, this adds the clients to the system set manager."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[System List] ແລະ ເລືອກລູກຂ່າຍແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງທີ່ຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມ, ການເຮັດແບບນີ້ຈະເປັນການເພີ່ມລູກຂ່າຍເຂົ້າໃນຕົວຈັດການຊຸດລະບົບ (SSM)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-groups.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Systems[System Set Manager], and go to the "
"[guimenu]``Groups`` tab."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-groups.adoc:26
msgid "Locate the group to join and check [guimenu]``Add``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-groups.adoc:27
msgid "Click btn:[Alter Membership]."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Alter Membership]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-groups.adoc:28
msgid "Click btn:[Confirm] to join the clients to the selected group."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Confirm] ເພື່ອໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍເຂົ້າຮ່ວມໃນກຸ່ມທີ່ເລືອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-groups.adoc:29
msgid ""
"For more information about the system set manager, see "
"xref:client-configuration:system-set-manager.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຕົວຈັດການຊຸດລະບົບ (SSM), ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:client-configuration:system-set-manager.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-groups.adoc:30
msgid ""
"You can see which clients are in a group by navigating to "
"menu:Systems[System Groups], clicking the name of the group, and navigating "
"to the [guimenu]``Systems`` tab."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-groups.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Work with Groups"
msgstr "ການເຮັດວຽກກັບກຸ່ມ"

#.  For Salt clients, you can also apply states and formulas to all clients in a group.
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-groups.adoc:32
msgid ""
"When you have your clients arranged into groups, you can use your groups to "
"manage updates."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານຈັດລຽງລູກຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານເຂົ້າໃນກຸ່ມແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ກຸ່ມເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນເພື່ອຈັດການການອັບເດດໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-groups.adoc:33
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[System Groups].  The "
"list shows an icon if there are updates available for any of the clients in "
"the group.  The list shows a question mark icon if checking the update "
"status is disabled for any of the clients in the group.  Click the icon to "
"see more information about the updates available and to apply them to the "
"clients."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[System Groups]. ລາຍຊື່ຈະສະແດງໄອຄອນຖ້າມີການອັບເດດສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍໃດໜຶ່ງໃນກຸ່ມ. ລາຍຊື່ຈະສະແດງໄອຄອນເຄື່ອງໝາຍຄຳຖາມ ຖ້າການກວດສອບສະຖານະການອັບເດດຖືກປິດໄວ້ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍໃນກຸ່ມນັ້ນ. ຄລິກທີ່ໄອຄອນເພື່ອເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການອັບເດດທີ່ມີ ແລະ ເພື່ອນຳໃຊ້ພວກມັນກັບລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-groups.adoc:34
msgid ""
"You can also work with more than one group at a time.  Select the groups you "
"want to work with, and click btn:[Work with union] to select every client in "
"every selected group."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເຮັດວຽກກັບຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງກຸ່ມໃນເວລາພ້ອມກັນໄດ້. ເລືອກກຸ່ມທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ, ແລະ ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Work with union] ເພື່ອເລືອກທຸກລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຢູ່ໃນທຸກກຸ່ມທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-groups.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can work on intersections of groups.  Select two or more "
"groups, and click btn:[Work with intersection] to select only those clients "
"that exist in all the selected groups.  For example, you might have one "
"group for all clients with web server software, and another group for all "
"SLES clients.  The intersection of these groups would be all SLES clients "
"with web server software."
msgstr "ຫຼື ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດວຽກກັບຈຸດຕັດກັນຂອງກຸ່ມ. ເລືອກສອງກຸ່ມ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່າ, ແລະ ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Work with intersection] ເພື່ອເລືອກສະເພາະລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນທຸກໆກຸ່ມທີ່ເລືອກເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ທ່ານອາດຈະມີກຸ່ມໜຶ່ງສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດທີ່ມີຊອບແວເວັບເຊີເວີ, ແລະ ອີກກຸ່ມໜຶ່ງສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍ SLES ທັງໝົດ. ຈຸດຕັດກັນຂອງກຸ່ມເຫຼົ່ານີ້ກໍຄືລູກຂ່າຍ SLES ທັງໝົດທີ່ມີຊອບແວເວັບເຊີເວີ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-locking.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "System Locking"
msgstr "ການລັອກລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-locking.adoc:2
msgid ""
"System locks are used to prevent actions from occurring on a client.  For "
"example, a system lock prevents a client from being updated or restarted.  "
"This is useful for clients running production software, or to prevent "
"accidental changes.  You can disable the system lock when you are ready to "
"perform actions."
msgstr "ການລັອກລະບົບຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ເກີດການປະຕິບັດງານໃດໜຶ່ງເທິງລູກຂ່າຍ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການລັອກລະບົບຈະປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍຖືກອັບເດດ ຫຼື ຖືກເລີ່ມລະບົບໃໝ່ (restart). ນີ້ເປັນປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ໃຊ້ຊອບແວທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຈິງ (production), ຫຼື ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນການປ່ຽນແປງໂດຍບໍ່ຕັ້ງໃຈ. ທ່ານສາມາດປິດການລັອກລະບົບໄດ້ເມື່ອທ່ານພ້ອມທີ່ຈະປະຕິບັດງານ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-locking.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "System Locks on Clients"
msgstr "ການລັອກລະບົບເທິງລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-locking.adoc:4
msgid ""
"When a client is locked, or put into blackout mode, no actions can be "
"scheduled, execution commands are disabled, and a yellow banner is displayed "
"on the [guimenu]``System Details`` page.  In this mode, actions can be "
"scheduled for the locked client using the {webui} or the API, but the "
"actions fail."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-locking.adoc:5
msgid "The locking mechanism is not available for {salt} SSH clients."
msgstr "ກົນໄກການລັອກນີ້ແມ່ນບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍ {salt} SSH."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-locking.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: System Locking a Client"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລັອກລະບົບຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-locking.adoc:7
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to the [guimenu]``System Details`` "
"page for the client you want to lock."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-locking.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Navigate to the [guimenu]``Formulas`` tab, check the system lock formula, "
"and click btn:[Save]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-locking.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Formulas[System Lock] tab, check [guimenu]``Lock "
"system``, and click btn:[Save]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-locking.adoc:10
msgid ""
"On this page, you can also enable specific Salt modules while the client is "
"locked."
msgstr "ໃນໜ້ານີ້, ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ບາງໂມດູນ Salt ທີ່ສະເພາະເຈາະຈົງໃນຂະນະທີ່ລູກຂ່າຍຖືກລັອກຢູ່ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-locking.adoc:11
msgid "When you have made your changes, you might need to apply the highstate."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານປ່ຽນແປງຂໍ້ມູນແລ້ວ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງນຳໃຊ້ highstate (apply highstate)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-locking.adoc:12
msgid ""
"In this case, a banner in the {webui} notifies you.  The client remains "
"locked until you remove the system lock formula."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ຈະມີແຖບແຈ້ງເຕືອນໃນ {webui} ບອກໃຫ້ທ່ານຊາບ. ລູກຂ່າຍຈະຍັງຄົງຖືກລັອກຢູ່ຈົນກວ່າທ່ານຈະເອົາສູດການລັອກລະບົບອອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-locking.adoc:13
msgid ""
"For more information about blackout mode in {salt}, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/blackout."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບໂໝດ blackout ໃນ {salt}, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/topics/blackout."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-locking.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Package Locks"
msgstr "ການລັອກແພັກເກດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-locking.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Package locking can be used on several clients, but different feature sets "
"are available.  You must differentiate between {sle} and {opensuse} "
"(zypp-based) versus {rhel} or {debian} clients."
msgstr "ການລັອກແພັກເກດສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍຫຼາຍປະເພດ, ແຕ່ຊຸດຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ມີໃຫ້ແມ່ນຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນ. ທ່ານຕ້ອງແຍກຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງລະຫວ່າງລູກຂ່າຍ {sle} ແລະ {opensuse} (ທີ່ໃຊ້ zypp) ກັບລູກຂ່າຍ {rhel} ຫຼື {debian}."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-locking.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Package Locks on Zypp-based Systems"
msgstr "ການລັອກແພັກເກດໃນລະບົບທີ່ໃຊ້ Zypp"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-locking.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Package locks are used to prevent unauthorized installation or upgrades to "
"software packages.  When a package has been locked, it shows a padlock icon, "
"indicating that it cannot be installed.  Any attempt to install a locked "
"package is reported as an error in the event log."
msgstr "ການລັອກແພັກເກດຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນການຕິດຕັ້ງ ຫຼື ການອັບເກຣດແພັກເກດຊອບແວໂດຍບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດ. ເມື່ອແພັກເກດຖືກລັອກ, ມັນຈະສະແດງໄອຄອນຮູບກະແຈ, ເຊິ່ງບົ່ງບອກວ່າມັນບໍ່ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງໄດ້. ຄວາມພະຍາຍາມໃດໆທີ່ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດທີ່ຖືກລັອກຈະຖືກລາຍງານວ່າເປັນຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນບັນທຶກເຫດການ (event log)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-locking.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Locked packages cannot be installed, upgraded, or removed, neither through "
"the {productname} {webui}, nor directly on the client machine using a "
"package manager.  Locked packages also indirectly lock any dependent "
"packages."
msgstr "ແພັກເກດທີ່ຖືກລັອກຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ, ອັບເກຣດ, ຫຼື ລຶບອອກໄດ້, ບໍ່ວ່າຈະຜ່ານ {webui} ຂອງ {productname} ຫຼື ໂດຍກົງທີ່ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຜ່ານຕົວຈັດການແພັກເກດ. ແພັກເກດທີ່ຖືກລັອກຍັງເປັນການລັອກແພັກເກດອື່ນໆທີ່ຕ້ອງເພິ່ງພາ (dependent packages) ມັນໂດຍທາງອ້ອມນຳອີກ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-locking.adoc:19
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-locking.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Using Package Locks"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການໃຊ້ງານການລັອກແພັກເກດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-locking.adoc:20
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-locking.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:Software[Packages > Lock] tab on the managed system to "
"see a list of all available packages."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແຖບເມນູ: Software[Packages > Lock] ໃນລະບົບທີ່ຖືກຈັດການ ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ແພັກເກດທັງໝົດທີ່ມີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-locking.adoc:21
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-locking.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Select the packages to lock, and click btn:[Request Lock].  Pick date and "
"time for the lock to activate.  By default, the lock is activated as soon as "
"possible.  Note that the lock might not activate immediately."
msgstr "ເລືອກແພັກເກດທີ່ຕ້ອງການລັອກ, ແລະ ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Request Lock]. ເລືອກວັນທີ ແລະ ເວລາເພື່ອໃຫ້ການລັອກມີຜົນ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ, ການລັອກຈະມີຜົນທັນທີທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້. ໝາຍເຫດວ່າການລັອກອາດຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນໃນທັນທີທັນໃດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-locking.adoc:22
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-locking.adoc:31
msgid ""
"To remove a package lock, select the packages to unlock and click "
"btn:[Request Unlock].  Pick date and time as with activating the lock."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເອົາການລັອກແພັກເກດອອກ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກແພັກເກດທີ່ຕ້ອງການປົດລັອກ ແລະ ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Request Unlock]. ເລືອກວັນທີ ແລະ ເວລາຄືກັນກັບການເປີດໃຊ້ການລັອກ."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-locking.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Package Locks on {rhel}- and {debian}-like Systems"
msgstr "ການລັອກແພັກເກດໃນລະບົບທີ່ຄ້າຍຄື {rhel} ແລະ {debian}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-locking.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Some {rhel}- and {debian}-like systems have package locking available on "
"clients."
msgstr "ບາງລະບົບທີ່ຄ້າຍຄື {rhel} ແລະ {debian} ແມ່ນມີການລັອກແພັກເກດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານເທິງລູກຂ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-locking.adoc:25
msgid ""
"On {rhel}- and {debian}-like systems, package locks are only used to prevent "
"unauthorized upgrades or removals to software packages.  When a package has "
"been locked, it shows a padlock icon, indicating that it cannot be changed.  "
"Any attempt to change a locked package is reported as an error in the event "
"log."
msgstr "ໃນລະບົບທີ່ຄ້າຍຄື {rhel} ແລະ {debian}, ການລັອກແພັກເກດແມ່ນໃຊ້ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນການອັບເກຣດ ຫຼື ການລຶບແພັກເກດຊອບແວໂດຍບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເມື່ອແພັກເກດຖືກລັອກ, ມັນຈະສະແດງໄອຄອນຮູບກະແຈ, ເຊິ່ງບົ່ງບອກວ່າມັນບໍ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້. ຄວາມພະຍາຍາມໃດໆທີ່ຈະປ່ຽນແປງແພັກເກດທີ່ຖືກລັອກຈະຖືກລາຍງານວ່າເປັນຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນບັນທຶກເຫດການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-locking.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Locked packages cannot be upgraded or removed, neither through the "
"{productname} {webui}, nor directly on the client machine using a package "
"manager.  Locked packages also indirectly lock any dependent packages."
msgstr "ແພັກເກດທີ່ຖືກລັອກຈະບໍ່ສາມາດອັບເກຣດ ຫຼື ລຶບອອກໄດ້, ບໍ່ວ່າຈະຜ່ານ {webui} ຂອງ {productname} ຫຼື ໂດຍກົງທີ່ເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຜ່ານຕົວຈັດການແພັກເກດ. ແພັກເກດທີ່ຖືກລັອກຍັງເປັນການລັອກແພັກເກດອື່ນໆທີ່ຕ້ອງເພິ່ງພາມັນໂດຍທາງອ້ອມນຳອີກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-locking.adoc:28
msgid ""
"On {rhel} 7 systems, install [package]``yum-plugin-versionlock``, and on "
"{rhel} 8 or 9 systems, install [package]``python3-dnf-plugin-versionlock`` "
"as [systemitem]``root``.  On {debian} systems, the ``apt`` tool has the "
"locking feature included."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-set-manager.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "System Set Manager"
msgstr "ຕົວຈັດການຊຸດລະບົບ (System Set Manager)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-set-manager.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The system set manager (SSM) is used to perform actions on more than one "
"client at a time.  SSM creates ephemeral sets of clients, making it useful "
"for one-off actions that you need to apply to a number of clients.  If you "
"want more permanent sets, consider using system groups instead.  For more "
"information about system groups, see "
"xref:client-configuration:system-groups.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຕົວຈັດການຊຸດລະບົບ (SSM) ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອປະຕິບັດງານກັບລູກຂ່າຍຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງເຄື່ອງໃນເວລາພ້ອມກັນ. SSM ຈະສ້າງຊຸດລູກຂ່າຍແບບຊົ່ວຄາວ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບການປະຕິບັດງານຄັ້ງດຽວທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການນຳໃຊ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຊຸດທີ່ຖາວອນກວ່າ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ກຸ່ມລະບົບແທນ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບກຸ່ມລະບົບ, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:system-groups.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-set-manager.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The actions available for use in SSM are listed in table.  The icons in this "
"table indicate:"
msgstr "ການປະຕິບັດງານທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນ SSM ແມ່ນມີລາຍຊື່ຢູ່ໃນຕາຕະລາງ. ໄອຄອນໃນຕາຕະລາງນີ້ໝາຍເຖິງ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-set-manager.adoc:5
msgid "{check} this action is available in SSM for this client type"
msgstr "{check} ການປະຕິບັດງານນີ້ແມ່ນມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນ SSM ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍປະເພດນີ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-set-manager.adoc:6
msgid "{cross} this action is not available in SSM for this client type"
msgstr "{cross} ການປະຕິບັດງານນີ້ແມ່ນບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນ SSM ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍປະເພດນີ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-set-manager.adoc:7
msgid ""
"{question} this action is under consideration for this client type, and may "
"or may not be supported at a later date."
msgstr "{question} ການປະຕິບັດງານນີ້ກຳລັງຢູ່ໃນລະຫວ່າງການພິຈາລະນາສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍປະເພດນີ້, ແລະ ອາດຈະໄດ້ຮັບ ຫຼື ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບໃນອະນາຄົດ."

#. type: Block title
