#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-set-manager.adoc:10
msgid "You can select clients for the SSM in several ways:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກລູກຂ່າຍສຳລັບ SSM ໄດ້ຫຼາຍວິທີ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-set-manager.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Systems[System List] and check the clients you want to work "
"with."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[System List] ແລະ ເລືອກລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເຮັດວຽກນຳ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-set-manager.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Systems[System Groups], and click btn:[Use in SSM] for the "
"system group you want to work with."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[System Groups], ແລະ ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Use in SSM] ສຳລັບກຸ່ມລະບົບທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເຮັດວຽກນຳ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-set-manager.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Systems[System Groups], check the group you want to work "
"with, and click btn:[Work with Group]."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[System Groups], ເລືອກກຸ່ມທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເຮັດວຽກນຳ, ແລະ ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Work with Group]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-set-manager.adoc:14
msgid ""
"When you have selected the clients you want to work with, navigate to "
"menu:Systems[System Set Manager], or click the [guimenu]``systems selected`` "
"icon in the top menu bar."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-set-manager.adoc:15
msgid ""
"The details in SSM might differ slightly from the details in other parts of "
"the {productname} {webui}.  In SSM, all available updates are shown.  This "
"allows you to upgrade to packages that might not be the latest version."
msgstr "ລາຍລະອຽດໃນ SSM ອາດຈະແຕກຕ່າງຈາກລາຍລະອຽດໃນສ່ວນອື່ນໆຂອງ {webui} ຂອງ {productname} ເລັກນ້ອຍ. ໃນ SSM, ຈະມີການສະແດງການອັບເດດທັງໝົດທີ່ມີ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດອັບເກຣດເປັນແພັກເກດທີ່ອາດຈະບໍ່ແມ່ນເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດກໍໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-set-manager.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Change Base Channels in SSM"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກ (Base Channels) ໃນ SSM"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-set-manager.adoc:17
msgid ""
"You can use SSM to change the base channel of more than one client at the "
"same time."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ SSM ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກຂອງລູກຂ່າຍຫຼາຍເຄື່ອງພ້ອມກັນໃນເທື່ອດຽວໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-set-manager.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Changing the base channel significantly changes the packages and patches "
"available to the affected clients.  Use with caution."
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ແພັກເກດ ແລະ ແພັດທີ່ມີສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍນັ້ນປ່ຽນແປງໄປຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ. ກະລຸນາໃຊ້ດ້ວຍຄວາມລະມັດລະວັງ."

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-set-manager.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Using SSM to Change Base Channels for Multiple Clients"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການໃຊ້ SSM ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຊ່ອງທາງຫຼັກສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍຫຼາຍເຄື່ອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-set-manager.adoc:20
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[System List], check "
"the clients you want to work with, and navigate to menu:Systems[System Set "
"Manager]."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[System List], ເລືອກລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ, ແລະ ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[System Set Manager]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-set-manager.adoc:21
msgid "Navigate to the [guimenu]``Channels`` subtab."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-set-manager.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Locate the current base channel in the list, and verify that the number "
"shown in the [guimenu]``Systems`` column is correct."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-set-manager.adoc:23
msgid ""
"You can click the number in this column to see more details of the clients "
"you are changing."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຄລິກທີ່ຈຳນວນໃນຖັນນີ້ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມຂອງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງປ່ຽນແປງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-set-manager.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Select the new base channel in the [guimenu]``Desired base Channel`` field, "
"and click btn:[Next]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-set-manager.adoc:25
msgid ""
"For each child channel, select [guimenu]``No change``, "
"[guimenu]``Subscribe``, or [guimenu]``Unsubscribe``, and click btn:[Next]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-set-manager.adoc:26
msgid "Check the changes you are making, and choose a time for the action to occur."
msgstr "ກວດສອບການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງເຮັດ, ແລະ ເລືອກເວລາທີ່ຈະໃຫ້ການປະຕິບັດງານເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-set-manager.adoc:27
msgid "Click btn:[Confirm] to schedule the changes."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Confirm] ເພື່ອກຳນົດເວລາການປ່ຽນແປງ."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-types.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "System Types"
msgstr "ປະເພດລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-types.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Clients are categorized by system type.  Every client can have both a base "
"system type, and an add-on system type assigned."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍຖືກແບ່ງໝວດໝູ່ຕາມປະເພດລະບົບ. ລູກຂ່າຍທຸກເຄື່ອງສາມາດມີທັງປະເພດລະບົບຫຼັກ (base system type) ແລະ ປະເພດລະບົບເສີມ (add-on system type) ທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-types.adoc:3
msgid "Base system type is ``Salt`` for all clients."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-types.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Add-on system types include ``Virtualization Host``, for clients that "
"operate as virtual hosts, and ``Container Build Host`` for clients that "
"operate as a build host."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/system-types.adoc:5
msgid ""
"You can adjust the add-on system type by navigating to menu:Systems[System "
"List > System Types].  Check the clients you want to change the add-on "
"system type for, select the [guimenu]``Add-On System Type``, and click "
"either btn:[Add System Type] or btn:[Remove System Type]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Virtual Host Manager and Amazon Web Services"
msgstr "ຕົວຈັດການ Virtual Host ແລະ Amazon Web Services"

#.  2024-04-04 OM: It had been decided in the conversation with the SUMA PO 
#.  that this Public Cloud related file can stay in the Uyuni books
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:2
msgid ""
"You can use a virtual host manager (VHM) to gather instances from Amazon Web "
"Services (AWS)."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຕົວຈັດການ virtual host (VHM) ເພື່ອຮວບຮວມ instance ຈາກ Amazon Web Services (AWS)."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The VHM allows {productname} to obtain and report information about your "
"clusters.  For more information on VHMs, see "
"xref:client-configuration:vhm.adoc[]."
msgstr "VHM ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ {productname} ສາມາດດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ລາຍງານຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບ cluster ຂອງທ່ານໄດ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ VHM, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:vhm.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create an Amazon EC2 VHM"
msgstr "ສ້າງ Amazon EC2 VHM"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:5
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:8
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-gce.adoc:8
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:6
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:5
msgid "The Virtual Host Manager (VHM) runs on the {productname} Server."
msgstr "ຕົວຈັດການ Virtual Host (VHM) ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ເທິງ {productname} Server."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:6
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:9
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-gce.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Ensure you have installed the [systemitem]``virtual-host-gatherer-libcloud`` "
"package on the {productname} Server."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating an Amazon EC2 VHM"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງ Amazon EC2 VHM"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:8
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:11
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-file.adoc:8
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-gce.adoc:13
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:10
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:11
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Virtual Host "
"Managers]."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[Virtual Host Managers]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Create] and select [guimenu]``Amazon EC2`` from the drop-down "
"menu."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:10
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Add an Amazon EC2 Virtual Host Manager`` section, use "
"these parameters:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:11
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:14
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-file.adoc:11
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-gce.adoc:16
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:13
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:14
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Label`` field, type a custom name for your VHM."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:12
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Access Key ID`` field, type the access key ID provided by "
"Amazon."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:13
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Secret Access Key`` field, type the secret access key "
"associated with the Amazon instance."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:14
msgid "In the [guimenu]``Region`` field, type the region to use."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:15
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Zone`` field, type the zone your VM is located in.  This "
"is required for subscription matching to work.  For more information about "
"setting regions and zones, see "
"xref:client-configuration:virtualization.adoc#_susesupport_and_vm_zones[]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:16
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:21
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-file.adoc:13
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-gce.adoc:22
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:18
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:19
msgid "Click btn:[Create] to save your changes and create the VHM."
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ btn:[Create] ເພື່ອບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງ ແລະ ສ້າງ VHM."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:17
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:22
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-file.adoc:14
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-gce.adoc:23
msgid "On the [guimenu]``Virtual Host Managers`` page, select the new VHM."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:18
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:23
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-file.adoc:15
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-gce.adoc:24
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:20
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:21
msgid ""
"On the [guimenu]``Properties`` page, click btn:[Refresh Data] to inventory "
"the new VHM."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:19
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:24
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-gce.adoc:25
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-nutanix.adoc:21
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-vmware.adoc:22
msgid ""
"To see which objects and resources have been inventoried, navigate to "
"menu:Systems[System List > Virtual Systems]."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເບິ່ງວ່າວັດຖຸ ແລະ ຊັບພະຍາກອນໃດແດ່ທີ່ຖືກສຳຫຼວດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ເມນູ: Systems[System List > Virtual Systems]."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Instances running on the Amazon public cloud report a UUID to the "
"{productname} Server in the format of an ``i`` followed by seventeen "
"hexadecimal digits:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "I1234567890abcdef0\n"
msgstr "I1234567890abcdef0\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "AWS Permissions for Virtual Host Manager"
msgstr "ການອະນຸຍາດ AWS ສຳລັບຕົວຈັດການ Virtual Host"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:23
msgid ""
"For security reasons, always grant the least privilege possible for a task "
"to be performed.  Using an Access Key with excessive permissions for users "
"connecting to AWS is not advised."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຄວາມປອດໄພ, ຄວນກຳນົດສິດການເຂົ້າເຖິງໃຫ້ໜ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດເທົ່າທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບວຽກນັ້ນໆ (least privilege). ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ Access Key ທີ່ມີສິດຫຼາຍເກີນໄປສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາ AWS."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:24
msgid ""
"For {productname} to gather the information required from AWS, the VHM needs "
"permission to describe EC2 instances and addresses.  One method to grant "
"this is to create a new IAM user (Identity and Access Management) specific "
"to this task, create a policy as follows and attach to the user:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ {productname} ສາມາດຮວບຮວມຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈຳເປັນຈາກ AWS ໄດ້, VHM ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີສິດໃນການອະທິບາຍ (describe) instance EC2 ແລະ ທີ່ຢູ່ຕ່າງໆ. ວິທີໜຶ່ງໃນການໃຫ້ສິດນີ້ແມ່ນການສ້າງຜູ້ໃຊ້ IAM ໃໝ່ທີ່ໃຊ້ສະເພາະວຽກນີ້, ສ້າງນະໂຍບາຍ (policy) ດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ ແລະ ຕິດກັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ນັ້ນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{\n"
"    \"Version\": \"2012-10-17\",\n"
"    \"Statement\":[\n"
"        {\n"
"            \"Effect\": \"Allow\",\n"
"            \"Action\": [\n"
"                \"ec2:DescribeAddresses\",\n"
"                \"ec2:DescribeInstances\"\n"
"            ],\n"
"            \"Resource\": \"*\"\n"
"        }\n"
"    ]\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"{\n"
"    \"Version\": \"2012-10-17\",\n"
"    \"Statement\":[\n"
"        {\n"
"            \"Effect\": \"Allow\",\n"
"            \"Action\": [\n"
"                \"ec2:DescribeAddresses\",\n"
"                \"ec2:DescribeInstances\"\n"
"            ],\n"
"            \"Resource\": \"*\"\n"
"        }\n"
"    ]\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-aws.adoc:26
msgid ""
"You can limit permissions more by restricting access to specific regions.  "
"For more information, see "
"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/ExamplePolicies_EC2.html#iam-example-read-only."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຈຳກັດສິດໄດ້ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນໂດຍການຈຳກັດການເຂົ້າເຖິງສະເພາະພາກພື້ນທີ່ກຳນົດ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/ExamplePolicies_EC2.html#iam-example-read-only."

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Virtual Host Manager and Azure"
msgstr "ຕົວຈັດການ Virtual Host ແລະ Azure"

#.  2024-04-04 OM: It had been decided in the conversation with the SUMA PO 
#.  that this Public Cloud related file can stay in the Uyuni books
#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:2
msgid ""
"You can use a virtual host manager (VHM) to gather instances from Microsoft "
"Azure."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຕົວຈັດການ virtual host (VHM) ເພື່ອຮວບຮວມ instance ຈາກ Microsoft Azure."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:3
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-gce.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The VHM allows {productname} to obtain and report information about your "
"virtual machines.  For more information on VHMs, see "
"xref:client-configuration:vhm.adoc[]."
msgstr "VHM ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ {productname} ສາມາດດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ລາຍງານຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບເຄື່ອງສະເືອນ (virtual machines) ຂອງທ່ານໄດ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ VHM, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:vhm.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:4
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-gce.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "ສິ່ງທີ່ຕ້ອງມີກ່ອນ (Prerequisites)"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The VHM you create needs to have the correct permissions assigned, in order "
"for it to access the Azure VM."
msgstr "VHM ທີ່ທ່ານສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີການກຳນົດສິດທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ Azure VM ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Log in to your Azure account as the subscription administrator, and ensure "
"that the Azure user account and application are in the correct groups.  The "
"group that the application is in determines the role it has, and therefore "
"the permissions."
msgstr "ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ Azure ຂອງທ່ານໃນຖານະຜູ້ດູແລການສະໝັກໃຊ້ (subscription administrator), ແລະ ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຊ້ Azure ແລະ ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ ຢູ່ໃນກຸ່ມທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ກຸ່ມທີ່ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຢູ່ນັ້ນຈະເປັນຕົວກຳນົດບົດບາດ (role) ແລະ ສິດການເຂົ້າເຖິງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create an Azure VHM"
msgstr "ສ້າງ Azure VHM"

#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating an Azure VHM"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສ້າງ Azure VHM"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:12
msgid "Click btn:[Create] and select [guimenu]``Azure`` from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:13
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Add an Azure Virtual Host Manager`` section, use these "
"parameters:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:15
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Subscription ID`` field, type the subscription ID found in "
"[path]``Azure portal > Services > Subscriptions`` page."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:16
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Application ID`` field, type the application ID that you "
"collected when you registered the application."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:17
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Tenant ID`` field, type the tenant ID provided by Azure "
"that you collected when you registered the application."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:18
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Secret Key`` field, type the secret key associated with "
"the Azure instance."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:19
msgid ""
"In the [guimenu]``Zone`` field, type the zone your VM is located in. For "
"example, for West Europe, enter [path]``westeurope``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:20
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-gce.adoc:21
msgid "This is required for subscription matching to work."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຈັບຄູ່ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Assigning permissions"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດສິດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:26
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-gce.adoc:27
msgid ""
"If the permissions are not set correctly, you might receive an error like "
"this when you run [command]``virtual-host-gatherer``:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"General error: [AuthorizationFailed] The client 'client_name' with object id "
"'object_ID' does not have authorization to perform action "
"'Microsoft.Compute/virtualMachines/read' over scope "
"'/subscriptions/not-very-secret-subscription-id' or the scope is invalid. If "
"access was recently granted, please refresh your credentials.\n"
msgstr "General error: [AuthorizationFailed] The client 'client_name' with object id 'object_ID' does not have authorization to perform action 'Microsoft.Compute/virtualMachines/read' over scope '/subscriptions/not-very-secret-subscription-id' or the scope is invalid. If access was recently granted, please refresh your credentials.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:28
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-gce.adoc:29
msgid ""
"To determine the correct credentials, run this command at the prompt on the "
"{productname} Server:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອພິຈາລະນາຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ (credentials) ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຢູ່ທີ່ໜ້າຈໍຄຳສັ່ງ (prompt) ຂອງ {productname} Server:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "virtual-host-gatherer -i input_azure.json -o out_azure.json -vvv\n"
msgstr "virtual-host-gatherer -i input_azure.json -o out_azure.json -vvv\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:30
msgid "The [path]``input_azure.json`` file should contain this information:"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[\n"
"    {\n"
"        \"id\": \"azure_vhm\",\n"
"        \"module\": \"Azure\",\n"
"        \"subscription_id\": \"subscription-id\",\n"
"        \"application_id\": \"application-id\",\n"
"        \"tenant_id\": \"tenant-id\",\n"
"        \"secret_key\": \"secret-key\",\n"
"        \"zone\": \"zone\"\n"
"    }\n"
"]\n"
msgstr ""
"[\n"
"    {\n"
"        \"id\": \"azure_vhm\",\n"
"        \"module\": \"Azure\",\n"
"        \"subscription_id\": \"subscription-id\",\n"
"        \"application_id\": \"application-id\",\n"
"        \"tenant_id\": \"tenant-id\",\n"
"        \"secret_key\": \"secret-key\",\n"
"        \"zone\": \"zone\"\n"
"    }\n"
"]\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Azure UUID"
msgstr "Azure UUID"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Instances running on the Azure public cloud report this UUID to the "
"{productname} Server:"
msgstr "Instance ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນ Azure public cloud ຈະລາຍງານ UUID ນີ້ໄປຍັງ {productname} Server:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-azure.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "13f56399-bd52-4150-9748-7190aae1ff21\n"
msgstr "13f56399-bd52-4150-9748-7190aae1ff21\n"

#. type: Title =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-file.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Virtualization with Other Third Party Providers"
msgstr "ການເຮັດ Virtualization ກັບຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການພາຍນອກອື່ນໆ"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-file.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you want to use a third-party virtualization provider other than Xen, "
"KVM, or VMware, you can import a JSON configuration file to {productname}."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ virtualization ພາຍນອກອື່ນໆ ນອກຈາກ Xen, KVM, ຫຼື VMware, ທ່ານສາມາດນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າ JSON ເຂົ້າໄປໃນ {productname} ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-file.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Similarly, if you have a VMware installation that does not provide direct "
"access to the API, a file-based VHM provides you with some basic management "
"features."
msgstr "ໃນທຳນອງດຽວກັນ, ຖ້າທ່ານມີການຕິດຕັ້ງ VMware ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຫ້ການເຂົ້າເຖິງ API ໂດຍກົງ, VHM ແບບໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ (file-based) ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານມີຄຸນສົມບັດການຈັດການພື້ນຖານບາງຢ່າງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-file.adoc:4
msgid ""
"This option is for importing files that have been created with the "
"[command]``virtual-host-gatherer`` tool.  It is not designed for manually "
"created files."
msgstr ""

#.  Add instructions for custom JSON file, including example if possible. LKB 2019-10-23
#.  https://github.com/uyuni-project/uyuni-rfc/blob/master/accepted/00056-subscription-matching-in-public-clouds.md#the-output-from-a-virtual-host-gatherer-plugin
#. type: Block title
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-file.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Exporting and Importing a JSON File"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການສົ່ງອອກ ແລະ ນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ JSON"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-file.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Export the JSON configuration file by running "
"[command]``virtual-host-gatherer`` on the VM network."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/client-configuration/pages/vhm-file.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Save the produced file to a location accessible by your {productname} "
"Server."
msgstr "ບັນທຶກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ໄດ້ ໄວ້ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ {productname} Server ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້."

